export const dicomViewerTranslationsByLocale = Object.freeze({"am":{"Private DICOM Image Viewer":"የግል DICOM ምስል መመልከቻ","DICOM Viewer — Open Medical Images Privately in Your Browser":"DICOM መመልከቻ - የሕክምና ምስሎችን በግል አሳሽዎ ውስጥ ይክፈቱ","Open and scroll through uncompressed monochrome DICOM image series locally. Adjust window and level; files are not uploaded. Compressed formats are identified clearly.":"ክፍት እና ያልተጨመቀ ባለ monochrome DICOM ምስል ተከታታዮች በአገር ውስጥ። መስኮቱን እና ደረጃውን ያስተካክሉ; ፋይሎች አልተሰቀሉም። የተጨመቁ ቅርጸቶች በግልጽ ተለይተው ይታወቃሉ.","Open a DICOM image or select one local series. Scroll through ordered slices, adjust window and level, and inspect technical image metadata. Files stay in this browser.":"የDICOM ምስል ይክፈቱ ወይም አንድ የሀገር ውስጥ ተከታታይ ይምረጡ። በታዘዙ ቁርጥራጮች ውስጥ ይሸብልሉ፣ መስኮትን እና ደረጃን ያስተካክሉ እና የቴክኒክ ምስል ዲበ ውሂብን ይፈትሹ። ፋይሎች በዚህ አሳሽ ውስጥ ይቆያሉ።","Supported images":"የሚደገፉ ምስሎች","This viewer reads DICOM Part 10 files with uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian or Explicit VR Little Endian pixel data. It supports single-frame 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome images, including MONOCHROME1 inversion.":"ይህ ተመልካች የDICOM Part 10 ፋይሎችን ባልተጨመቀ ስውር ቪአር ትንሹ ኢንዲያን ወይም ግልጽ ቪአር ትንሹ ኢንዲያን ፒክሰል ዳታ ያነባል። ነጠላ-ፍሬም 8-bit ወይም 16-ቢት ሞኖክሮም ምስሎችን, MONOCHROME1 ግልበጣን ጨምሮ ይደግፋል.","Privacy and safe use":"ግላዊነት እና ደህንነቱ የተጠበቀ አጠቃቀም","Selected files are read on this device and decoded in a temporary Web Worker. The worker is terminated when processing finishes or you cancel. Patient name, ID, birth date and accession fields are not displayed. This page does not upload or save images and has no screenshot-sharing feature.":"የተመረጡት ፋይሎች በዚህ መሳሪያ ላይ ይነበባሉ እና በጊዜያዊ የድር ሰራተኛ ውስጥ ይገለጣሉ። ስራው ሲጠናቀቅ ሰራተኛው ይቋረጣል ወይም ይሰርዙታል። የታካሚ ስም፣ መታወቂያ፣ የልደት ቀን እና የመግባቢያ መስኮች አይታዩም። ይህ ገጽ ምስሎችን አይጭንም ወይም አያስቀምጥም እና ምንም የቅጽበታዊ ገጽ እይታ ማጋራት ባህሪ የለውም።","DICOM viewer questions":"DICOM መመልከቻ ጥያቄዎች","Formats and limitations":"ቅርጸቶች እና ገደቦች","This is a basic file viewer, not a PACS, DICOMweb client, radiology workstation or diagnostic device. It does not support compressed transfer syntaxes, color images, multi-frame objects, presentation states, overlays, structured reports, enhanced multi-frame studies or clinical measurements. Do not use it to make or change a diagnosis. If a study fails, the viewer reports the unsupported feature instead of showing a blank image.":"ይህ መሰረታዊ የፋይል መመልከቻ እንጂ የ PACS፣ DICOMweb ደንበኛ፣ የራዲዮሎጂ ስራ ጣቢያ ወይም የምርመራ መሳሪያ አይደለም። የታመቁ የዝውውር አገባቦችን፣ የቀለም ምስሎችን፣ ባለብዙ ፍሬም ዕቃዎችን፣ የአቀራረብ ሁኔታዎችን፣ ተደራቢዎችን፣ የተዋቀሩ ሪፖርቶችን፣ የተሻሻሉ ባለብዙ ፍሬም ጥናቶችን ወይም ክሊኒካዊ መለኪያዎችን አይደግፍም። ምርመራ ለማድረግ ወይም ለመለወጥ አይጠቀሙበት. አንድ ጥናት ካልተሳካ ተመልካቹ ባዶ ምስል ከማሳየት ይልቅ የማይደገፍ ባህሪን ሪፖርት ያደርጋል።","Are my medical images uploaded?":"የእኔ የሕክምና ምስሎች ተሰቅለዋል?","No. The selected file bytes are read locally by your browser and a temporary local worker. This tool has no upload, remote PACS or DICOMweb connection.":"ቁ. የተመረጠው የፋይል ባይት በአሳሽዎ እና በጊዜያዊ የአካባቢ ሰራተኛ በአገር ውስጥ ይነበባል። ይህ መሳሪያ ምንም ሰቀላ፣ የርቀት PACS ወይም DICOMweb ግንኙነት የለውም።","Can I use this viewer to diagnose a condition?":"በሽታን ለመመርመር ይህንን ተመልካች መጠቀም እችላለሁን?","No. It is a limited technical viewer for supported files, not a medical device or diagnostic workstation. Use validated clinical software and ask a qualified clinician to interpret medical images.":"ቁ. ለሚደገፉ ፋይሎች የተገደበ የቴክኒክ መመልከቻ እንጂ የሕክምና መሣሪያ ወይም የምርመራ ቦታ አይደለም። የተረጋገጠ ክሊኒካዊ ሶፍትዌር ተጠቀም እና የህክምና ምስሎችን እንዲተረጉም ብቃት ያለው የህክምና ባለሙያ ጠይቅ።","Choose DICOM file(s)":"DICOM ፋይል(ዎች) ይምረጡ","Medical files can contain identifying information. This viewer does not upload them and hides common identity fields, but review your screen before sharing it.":"የሕክምና ፋይሎች መለያ መረጃ ሊይዙ ይችላሉ። ይህ ተመልካች አይሰቅላቸውም እና የጋራ መታወቂያ መስኮችን ይደብቃል፣ ነገር ግን ከማጋራቱ በፊት የእርስዎን ማያ ገጽ ይገምግሙ።","Select a single DICOM image or files from a single series. Supported: uncompressed, single-frame, 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome Part 10 files. A computer is recommended for larger studies.":"አንድ ነጠላ DICOM ምስል ወይም ፋይሎች ከአንድ ተከታታይ ይምረጡ። የሚደገፉ: ያልተጨመቀ, ነጠላ-ፍሬም, 8-ቢት ወይም 16-ቢት ሞኖክሮም ክፍል 10 ፋይሎች. ኮምፒውተር ለትላልቅ ጥናቶች ይመከራል።","Choose one image or a series to begin.":"ለመጀመር አንድ ምስል ወይም ተከታታይ ይምረጡ።","Reading locally":"በአገር ውስጥ ማንበብ","Image series ready.":"የምስል ተከታታይ ዝግጁ።","Images ready. The files did not include a series identifier; check that you selected only one series.":"ምስሎች ዝግጁ። ፋይሎቹ ተከታታይ መለያ አላካተቱም; አንድ ተከታታይ ብቻ እንደመረጡ ያረጋግጡ።","Reading cancelled. The temporary viewer data was cleared.":"ማንበብ ተሰርዟል። ጊዜያዊ ተመልካች ውሂብ ጸድቷል።","Clear files":"ፋይሎችን አጽዳ","Cancel reading":"ማንበብ ሰርዝ","Previous slice":"የቀደመው ቁራጭ","Next slice":"ቀጣይ ቁራጭ","Slice":"ቁራጭ","Current slice":"የአሁኑ ቁራጭ","Window center":"የመስኮት ማዕከል","Window width":"የመስኮት ስፋት","Modality":"ሞዳልቲ","Image size":"የምስል መጠን","Pixel spacing":"Pixel ክፍተት","Slice thickness":"የቁራጭ ውፍረት","Image position (patient coordinates)":"የምስል አቀማመጥ (የታካሚ መጋጠሚያዎች)","Image orientation":"የምስል አቀማመጥ","Photometric interpretation":"የፎቶሜትሪክ ትርጉም","Pixel format":"Pixel ቅርጸት","Transfer syntax":"አገባብ ያስተላልፉ","Not available":"የለም","This is not a DICOM Part 10 file with a DICM header.":"ይህ የDICOM ክፍል 10 ፋይል ከDICM ራስጌ ጋር አይደለም።","The DICOM file is truncated or malformed.":"የDICOM ፋይሉ የተቆረጠ ወይም የተበላሸ ነው።","Unsupported transfer syntax. This viewer accepts only uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian and Explicit VR Little Endian.":"የማይደገፍ የዝውውር አገባብ። ይህ ተመልካች የሚቀበለው ያልተጨመቀ ስውር ቪአር ትንሹ ኢንዲያን እና ግልጽ ቪአር ትንሹ ኢንዲያን ነው።","This DICOM object has no pixel data to display.":"ይህ DICOM ነገር ምንም የሚታይ የፒክሰል ዳታ የለውም።","Image dimensions exceed this viewer’s safe limit (2,048 per side and 4 megapixels per image).":"የምስል ልኬቶች ከዚህ የተመልካች አስተማማኝ ገደብ (2,048 በአንድ ጎን እና 4 ሜጋፒክስሎች በአንድ ምስል) ያልፋሉ።","Unsupported image type. Choose a single-sample MONOCHROME1 or MONOCHROME2 image.":"የማይደገፍ የምስል አይነት። ነጠላ-ናሙና MONOCHROME1 ወይም MONOCHROME2 ምስል ይምረጡ።","Unsupported pixel encoding. Only 8-bit and 16-bit monochrome integer pixels are supported.":"የማይደገፍ የፒክሰል ኢንኮዲንግ። 8-ቢት እና 16-ቢት ሞኖክሮም ኢንቲጀር ፒክስሎች ብቻ ናቸው የሚደገፉት።","This file contains multiple frames. Select a single-frame image or split the series with trusted DICOM software.":"ይህ ፋይል በርካታ ፍሬሞችን ይዟል። ባለአንድ ፍሬም ምስል ይምረጡ ወይም ተከታታዩን በታመነ DICOM ሶፍትዌር ይከፋፍሏቸው።","Invalid rescale values in this image.":"በዚህ ምስል ውስጥ ልክ ያልሆኑ የዳግም ልኬት እሴቶች።","This image uses a modality lookup table that this viewer does not support.":"ይህ ምስል ይህ ተመልካች የማይደግፈውን የሞዳሊቲ ፍለጋ ሰንጠረዥ ይጠቀማል።","A file is empty or exceeds the 16 MiB per-file limit.":"ፋይሉ ባዶ ነው ወይም ከ16 MiB በፋይል ገደብ ይበልጣል።","This selection exceeds the safe series limit (100 files, 128 MiB input or 20 megapixels total). Select a smaller series.":"ይህ ምርጫ ከአስተማማኝ ተከታታይ ገደብ (100 ፋይሎች፣ 128 MiB ግብዓት ወይም 20 ሜጋፒክስል ጠቅላላ) ይበልጣል። አነስ ያለ ተከታታይ ይምረጡ።","The selection contains more than one DICOM series. Choose files from one series only.":"ምርጫው ከአንድ በላይ DICOM ተከታታይ ይዟል። ከአንድ ተከታታይ ፋይሎችን ብቻ ይምረጡ።","The selected files have different image dimensions. Choose one consistent series.":"የተመረጡት ፋይሎች የተለያየ የምስል መጠን አላቸው። አንድ ተከታታይ ተከታታይ ይምረጡ።","The selected files have different image orientations. Choose one consistent series.":"የተመረጡት ፋይሎች የተለያዩ የምስል አቅጣጫዎች አሏቸው። አንድ ተከታታይ ተከታታይ ይምረጡ።","This file could not be read as a supported DICOM image.":"ይህ ፋይል የሚደገፍ የDICOM ምስል ሆኖ ሊነበብ አልቻለም።","Enter a finite window center and a window width of at least 1.":"የተወሰነ የመስኮት ማእከል እና ቢያንስ 1 የመስኮት ስፋት አስገባ።","DICOM image preview":"DICOM ምስል ቅድመ እይታ","Image metadata":"የምስል ዲበ ውሂብ","Use the slice slider, or the previous and next buttons, to move through the series.":"ተከታታዩን ለማለፍ የስክሪፕ ማንሸራተቻውን ወይም የቀደመውን እና ቀጣይ ቁልፎችን ይጠቀሙ።"},"ar":{"Private DICOM Image Viewer":"عارض صور DICOM خاص","DICOM Viewer — Open Medical Images Privately in Your Browser":"DICOM Viewer — افتح الصور الطبية بشكل خاص في متصفحك","Open and scroll through uncompressed monochrome DICOM image series locally. Adjust window and level; files are not uploaded. Compressed formats are identified clearly.":"افتح وقم بالتمرير عبر سلسلة صور DICOM أحادية اللون غير المضغوطة محليًا. ضبط النافذة والمستوى. لا يتم تحميل الملفات. يتم تحديد التنسيقات المضغوطة بوضوح.","Open a DICOM image or select one local series. Scroll through ordered slices, adjust window and level, and inspect technical image metadata. Files stay in this browser.":"افتح صورة DICOM أو حدد سلسلة محلية واحدة. قم بالتمرير عبر الشرائح المطلوبة، واضبط النافذة والمستوى، وافحص البيانات التعريفية الفنية للصورة. تبقى الملفات في هذا المتصفح.","Supported images":"الصور المدعومة","This viewer reads DICOM Part 10 files with uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian or Explicit VR Little Endian pixel data. It supports single-frame 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome images, including MONOCHROME1 inversion.":"يقرأ هذا العارض ملفات DICOM Part 10 مع بيانات البكسل الضمنية VR Little Endian غير المضغوطة أو بيانات بكسل Endian الصغيرة الصريحة. وهو يدعم الصور أحادية اللون 8 بت أو 16 بت أحادية اللون، بما في ذلك الانعكاس MONOCHROME1.","Privacy and safe use":"الخصوصية والاستخدام الآمن","Selected files are read on this device and decoded in a temporary Web Worker. The worker is terminated when processing finishes or you cancel. Patient name, ID, birth date and accession fields are not displayed. This page does not upload or save images and has no screenshot-sharing feature.":"تتم قراءة الملفات المحددة على هذا الجهاز وفك تشفيرها في Web Worker مؤقت. يتم إنهاء العامل عند انتهاء المعالجة أو عند الإلغاء. لا يتم عرض اسم المريض وهويته وتاريخ ميلاده وحقول الانضمام. لا تقوم هذه الصفحة بتحميل الصور أو حفظها ولا تحتوي على ميزة مشاركة لقطات الشاشة.","DICOM viewer questions":"أسئلة عارض DICOM","Formats and limitations":"التنسيقات والقيود","This is a basic file viewer, not a PACS, DICOMweb client, radiology workstation or diagnostic device. It does not support compressed transfer syntaxes, color images, multi-frame objects, presentation states, overlays, structured reports, enhanced multi-frame studies or clinical measurements. Do not use it to make or change a diagnosis. If a study fails, the viewer reports the unsupported feature instead of showing a blank image.":"هذا هو عارض ملفات أساسي، وليس PACS أو عميل DICOMweb أو محطة عمل الأشعة أو جهاز التشخيص. وهو لا يدعم تركيب جمل النقل المضغوطة، أو الصور الملونة، أو الكائنات متعددة الإطارات، أو حالات العرض التقديمي، أو التراكبات، أو التقارير المنظمة، أو الدراسات المحسنة متعددة الإطارات أو القياسات السريرية. لا تستخدمه لإجراء أو تغيير التشخيص. إذا فشلت الدراسة، يقوم العارض بالإبلاغ عن الميزة غير المدعومة بدلاً من عرض صورة فارغة.","Are my medical images uploaded?":"هل تم تحميل الصور الطبية الخاصة بي؟","No. The selected file bytes are read locally by your browser and a temporary local worker. This tool has no upload, remote PACS or DICOMweb connection.":"رقم. تتم قراءة وحدات بايت الملف المحددة محليًا بواسطة المستعرض الخاص بك والعامل المحلي المؤقت. لا تحتوي هذه الأداة على أي تحميل أو اتصال PACS عن بعد أو DICOMweb.","Can I use this viewer to diagnose a condition?":"هل يمكنني استخدام هذا العارض لتشخيص الحالة؟","No. It is a limited technical viewer for supported files, not a medical device or diagnostic workstation. Use validated clinical software and ask a qualified clinician to interpret medical images.":"رقم. إنه عارض تقني محدود للملفات المدعومة، وليس جهازًا طبيًا أو محطة عمل تشخيصية. استخدم برامج سريرية معتمدة واطلب من طبيب مؤهل تفسير الصور الطبية.","Choose DICOM file(s)":"اختر ملف (ملفات) DICOM","Medical files can contain identifying information. This viewer does not upload them and hides common identity fields, but review your screen before sharing it.":"يمكن أن تحتوي الملفات الطبية على معلومات تعريفية. لا يقوم هذا العارض بتحميلها ويخفي حقول الهوية المشتركة، ولكنه يقوم بمراجعة شاشتك قبل مشاركتها.","Select a single DICOM image or files from a single series. Supported: uncompressed, single-frame, 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome Part 10 files. A computer is recommended for larger studies.":"حدد صورة DICOM واحدة أو ملفات من سلسلة واحدة. المدعومة: ملفات غير مضغوطة أحادية الإطار أو 8 بت أو 16 أحادية اللون جزء 10. يوصى باستخدام الكمبيوتر للدراسات الأكبر.","Choose one image or a series to begin.":"اختر صورة واحدة أو سلسلة للبدء.","Reading locally":"القراءة محليًا","Image series ready.":"سلسلة الصور جاهزة.","Images ready. The files did not include a series identifier; check that you selected only one series.":"الصور جاهزة. لم تتضمن الملفات معرف سلسلة؛ تأكد من أنك حددت سلسلة واحدة فقط.","Reading cancelled. The temporary viewer data was cleared.":"تم إلغاء القراءة. تم مسح بيانات العارض المؤقتة.","Clear files":"مسح الملفات","Cancel reading":"إلغاء القراءة","Previous slice":"الشريحة السابقة","Next slice":"الشريحة التالية","Slice":"شريحة","Current slice":"الشريحة الحالية","Window center":"مركز النافذة","Window width":"عرض النافذة","Modality":"الطريقة","Image size":"حجم الصورة","Pixel spacing":"تباعد وحدات البكسل","Slice thickness":"سمك الشريحة","Image position (patient coordinates)":"موضع الصورة (إحداثيات المريض)","Image orientation":"اتجاه الصورة","Photometric interpretation":"التفسير الضوئي","Pixel format":"تنسيق البكسل","Transfer syntax":"بناء جملة النقل","Not available":"غير متوفر","This is not a DICOM Part 10 file with a DICM header.":"هذا ليس ملف 10 جزء DICOM برأس DICM.","The DICOM file is truncated or malformed.":"ملف DICOM مقطوع أو مشوه.","Unsupported transfer syntax. This viewer accepts only uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian and Explicit VR Little Endian.":"بناء جملة نقل غير مدعوم. يقبل هذا العارض فقط Implicit VR Little Endian وExplicit VR Little Endian غير المضغوطة.","This DICOM object has no pixel data to display.":"لا يحتوي كائن DICOM هذا على بيانات بكسل لعرضها.","Image dimensions exceed this viewer’s safe limit (2,048 per side and 4 megapixels per image).":"أبعاد الصورة تتجاوز الحد الآمن لهذا العارض (2,048 لكل جانب و4 ميجابكسل لكل صورة).","Unsupported image type. Choose a single-sample MONOCHROME1 or MONOCHROME2 image.":"نوع صورة غير مدعوم. اختر صورة أحادية العينة MONOCHROME1 أو MONOCHROME2.","Unsupported pixel encoding. Only 8-bit and 16-bit monochrome integer pixels are supported.":"ترميز البكسل غير مدعوم. يتم دعم وحدات البكسل الصحيحة أحادية اللون 8-bit و16-bit فقط.","This file contains multiple frames. Select a single-frame image or split the series with trusted DICOM software.":"يحتوي هذا الملف على إطارات متعددة. حدد صورة ذات إطار واحد أو قم بتقسيم السلسلة باستخدام برنامج DICOM الموثوق به.","Invalid rescale values in this image.":"قيم تغيير الحجم غير صالحة في هذه الصورة.","This image uses a modality lookup table that this viewer does not support.":"تستخدم هذه الصورة جدول بحث طريقة لا يدعمه هذا العارض.","A file is empty or exceeds the 16 MiB per-file limit.":"الملف فارغ أو يتجاوز حد 16 MiB لكل ملف.","This selection exceeds the safe series limit (100 files, 128 MiB input or 20 megapixels total). Select a smaller series.":"يتجاوز هذا التحديد حد السلسلة الآمنة (ملفات 100 أو إدخال 128 MiB أو 20 إجمالي وحدات البكسل). حدد سلسلة أصغر.","The selection contains more than one DICOM series. Choose files from one series only.":"يحتوي التحديد على أكثر من سلسلة DICOM واحدة. اختر ملفات من سلسلة واحدة فقط.","The selected files have different image dimensions. Choose one consistent series.":"الملفات المحددة لها أبعاد صورة مختلفة. اختر سلسلة واحدة متسقة.","The selected files have different image orientations. Choose one consistent series.":"الملفات المحددة لها اتجاهات مختلفة للصور. اختر سلسلة واحدة متسقة.","This file could not be read as a supported DICOM image.":"تعذرت قراءة هذا الملف كصورة DICOM مدعومة.","Enter a finite window center and a window width of at least 1.":"أدخل مركز نافذة محدود وعرض نافذة لا يقل عن 1.","DICOM image preview":"معاينة صورة DICOM","Image metadata":"بيانات تعريف الصورة","Use the slice slider, or the previous and next buttons, to move through the series.":"استخدم شريط تمرير الشريحة، أو الأزرار السابقة والتالية، للتنقل عبر السلسلة."},"bg":{"Private DICOM Image Viewer":"Частен DICOM преглед на изображения","DICOM Viewer — Open Medical Images Privately in Your Browser":"DICOM Viewer — отваряйте частно медицински изображения във вашия браузър","Open and scroll through uncompressed monochrome DICOM image series locally. Adjust window and level; files are not uploaded. Compressed formats are identified clearly.":"Отворете и превъртете локално некомпресирани монохромни DICOM изображения. Регулирайте прозореца и нивото; файловете не са качени. Компресираните формати се идентифицират ясно.","Open a DICOM image or select one local series. Scroll through ordered slices, adjust window and level, and inspect technical image metadata. Files stay in this browser.":"Отворете DICOM изображение или изберете една локална серия. Превъртете през подредените срезове, коригирайте прозореца и нивото и проверете техническите метаданни на изображението. Файловете остават в този браузър.","Supported images":"Поддържани изображения","This viewer reads DICOM Part 10 files with uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian or Explicit VR Little Endian pixel data. It supports single-frame 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome images, including MONOCHROME1 inversion.":"Този преглед чете DICOM Part 10 файлове с некомпресирани пикселни данни за имплицитен VR Little Endian или Explicit VR Little Endian. Поддържа 8-битови или 16-битови монохромни изображения с един кадър, включително MONOCHROME1 инверсия.","Privacy and safe use":"Поверителност и безопасна употреба","Selected files are read on this device and decoded in a temporary Web Worker. The worker is terminated when processing finishes or you cancel. Patient name, ID, birth date and accession fields are not displayed. This page does not upload or save images and has no screenshot-sharing feature.":"Избраните файлове се четат на това устройство и се декодират във временен Web Worker. Работникът се прекратява, когато обработката приключи или анулирате. Името на пациента, ID, датата на раждане и полетата за присъединяване не се показват. Тази страница не качва или запазва изображения и няма функция за споделяне на екранни снимки.","DICOM viewer questions":"Въпроси за DICOM зрителя","Formats and limitations":"Формати и ограничения","This is a basic file viewer, not a PACS, DICOMweb client, radiology workstation or diagnostic device. It does not support compressed transfer syntaxes, color images, multi-frame objects, presentation states, overlays, structured reports, enhanced multi-frame studies or clinical measurements. Do not use it to make or change a diagnosis. If a study fails, the viewer reports the unsupported feature instead of showing a blank image.":"Това е основна програма за преглед на файлове, а не PACS, DICOMweb клиент, радиологична работна станция или диагностично устройство. Не поддържа компресиран синтаксис за прехвърляне, цветни изображения, многокадрови обекти, състояния на представяне, наслагвания, структурирани отчети, подобрени многокадрови проучвания или клинични измервания. Не го използвайте за поставяне или промяна на диагноза. Ако изследването е неуспешно, зрителят съобщава за неподдържаната функция, вместо да показва празно изображение.","Are my medical images uploaded?":"Моите медицински изображения качени ли са?","No. The selected file bytes are read locally by your browser and a temporary local worker. This tool has no upload, remote PACS or DICOMweb connection.":"Бр. Избраните файлови байтове се четат локално от вашия браузър и временен локален работник. Този инструмент няма качване, отдалечена PACS или DICOMweb връзка.","Can I use this viewer to diagnose a condition?":"Мога ли да използвам този визуализатор за диагностициране на състояние?","No. It is a limited technical viewer for supported files, not a medical device or diagnostic workstation. Use validated clinical software and ask a qualified clinician to interpret medical images.":"Бр. Това е ограничен технически преглед на поддържаните файлове, а не медицинско устройство или диагностична работна станция. Използвайте валидиран клиничен софтуер и помолете квалифициран клиницист да интерпретира медицински изображения.","Choose DICOM file(s)":"Изберете DICOM файл(ове)","Medical files can contain identifying information. This viewer does not upload them and hides common identity fields, but review your screen before sharing it.":"Медицинските досиета могат да съдържат идентифицираща информация. Този зрител не ги качва и скрива общи полета за самоличност, но прегледайте екрана си, преди да го споделите.","Select a single DICOM image or files from a single series. Supported: uncompressed, single-frame, 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome Part 10 files. A computer is recommended for larger studies.":"Изберете едно DICOM изображение или файлове от една серия. Поддържани: некомпресирани, еднокадрови, 8-битови или 16-битови монохромни файлове с част 10. Препоръчва се компютър за по-големи изследвания.","Choose one image or a series to begin.":"Изберете едно изображение или серия, за да започнете.","Reading locally":"Четене локално","Image series ready.":"Готова серия изображения.","Images ready. The files did not include a series identifier; check that you selected only one series.":"Изображенията са готови. Файловете не включват идентификатор на серия; проверете дали сте избрали само една серия.","Reading cancelled. The temporary viewer data was cleared.":"Четенето е отменено. Данните за временния зрител бяха изчистени.","Clear files":"Изчистване на файлове","Cancel reading":"Отмяна на четенето","Previous slice":"Предишен срез","Next slice":"Следващ срез","Slice":"Срез","Current slice":"Текущ срез","Window center":"Център на прозореца","Window width":"Ширина на прозореца","Modality":"Модалност","Image size":"Размер на изображението","Pixel spacing":"Разстояние между пикселите","Slice thickness":"Дебелина на среза","Image position (patient coordinates)":"Позиция на изображението (координати на пациента)","Image orientation":"Ориентация на изображението","Photometric interpretation":"Фотометрична интерпретация","Pixel format":"Пиксел формат","Transfer syntax":"Синтаксис за прехвърляне","Not available":"Не е налично","This is not a DICOM Part 10 file with a DICM header.":"Това не е DICOM част 10 файл с DICM хедър.","The DICOM file is truncated or malformed.":"DICOM файлът е съкратен или деформиран.","Unsupported transfer syntax. This viewer accepts only uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian and Explicit VR Little Endian.":"Неподдържан синтаксис за прехвърляне. Този визуализатор приема само некомпресирани имплицитни VR Little Endian и Explicit VR Little Endian.","This DICOM object has no pixel data to display.":"Този DICOM обект няма пикселни данни за показване.","Image dimensions exceed this viewer’s safe limit (2,048 per side and 4 megapixels per image).":"Размерите на изображението надвишават безопасното ограничение на този зрител (2,048 на страна и 4 мегапиксела на изображение).","Unsupported image type. Choose a single-sample MONOCHROME1 or MONOCHROME2 image.":"Неподдържан тип изображение. Изберете изображение с една проба MONOCHROME1 или MONOCHROME2.","Unsupported pixel encoding. Only 8-bit and 16-bit monochrome integer pixels are supported.":"Неподдържано пикселно кодиране. Поддържат се само 8-битови и 16-битови монохромни цели пиксели.","This file contains multiple frames. Select a single-frame image or split the series with trusted DICOM software.":"Този файл съдържа множество рамки. Изберете еднокадрово изображение или разделете серията с доверен софтуер DICOM.","Invalid rescale values in this image.":"Невалидни стойности за повторно мащабиране в това изображение.","This image uses a modality lookup table that this viewer does not support.":"Това изображение използва таблица за търсене на модалност, която тази програма за преглед не поддържа.","A file is empty or exceeds the 16 MiB per-file limit.":"Файлът е празен или надвишава лимита от 16 MiB за файл.","This selection exceeds the safe series limit (100 files, 128 MiB input or 20 megapixels total). Select a smaller series.":"Този избор надвишава ограничението за безопасна серия (100 файлове, 128 входни MiB или общо 20 мегапиксела). Изберете по-малка серия.","The selection contains more than one DICOM series. Choose files from one series only.":"Изборът съдържа повече от една серия DICOM. Изберете файлове само от една серия.","The selected files have different image dimensions. Choose one consistent series.":"Избраните файлове имат различни размери на изображението. Изберете една последователна серия.","The selected files have different image orientations. Choose one consistent series.":"Избраните файлове имат различна ориентация на изображението. Изберете една последователна серия.","This file could not be read as a supported DICOM image.":"Този файл не може да бъде прочетен като поддържано DICOM изображение.","Enter a finite window center and a window width of at least 1.":"Въведете краен център на прозореца и ширина на прозореца най-малко 1.","DICOM image preview":"Визуализация на DICOM изображение","Image metadata":"Метаданни на изображението","Use the slice slider, or the previous and next buttons, to move through the series.":"Използвайте плъзгача за разделяне или бутоните за предишен и следващ, за да се придвижвате през серията."},"bn":{"Private DICOM Image Viewer":"প্রাইভেট DICOM ইমেজ ভিউয়ার","DICOM Viewer — Open Medical Images Privately in Your Browser":"DICOM ভিউয়ার - আপনার ব্রাউজারে ব্যক্তিগতভাবে মেডিকেল ছবি খুলুন","Open and scroll through uncompressed monochrome DICOM image series locally. Adjust window and level; files are not uploaded. Compressed formats are identified clearly.":"অনকম্প্রেসড মনোক্রোম DICOM ইমেজ সিরিজ স্থানীয়ভাবে খুলুন এবং স্ক্রোল করুন। উইন্ডো এবং স্তর সামঞ্জস্য করুন; ফাইল আপলোড করা হয় না। সংকুচিত বিন্যাস স্পষ্টভাবে চিহ্নিত করা হয়.","Open a DICOM image or select one local series. Scroll through ordered slices, adjust window and level, and inspect technical image metadata. Files stay in this browser.":"একটি DICOM চিত্র খুলুন বা একটি স্থানীয় সিরিজ নির্বাচন করুন। অর্ডারকৃত স্লাইসগুলির মাধ্যমে স্ক্রোল করুন, উইন্ডো এবং স্তর সামঞ্জস্য করুন এবং প্রযুক্তিগত চিত্র মেটাডেটা পরিদর্শন করুন। ফাইল এই ব্রাউজারে থাকে।","Supported images":"সমর্থিত ছবি","This viewer reads DICOM Part 10 files with uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian or Explicit VR Little Endian pixel data. It supports single-frame 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome images, including MONOCHROME1 inversion.":"এই দর্শক DICOM পার্ট 10 ফাইলগুলিকে আনকম্প্রেসড ইমপ্লিসিট ভিআর লিটল এন্ডিয়ান বা এক্সপ্লিসিট ভিআর লিটল এন্ডিয়ান পিক্সেল ডেটা সহ পড়ে। এটি একক-ফ্রেম 8-বিট বা 16-বিট একরঙা ছবি সমর্থন করে, যার মধ্যে MONOCHROME1 ইনভার্সন রয়েছে৷","Privacy and safe use":"গোপনীয়তা এবং নিরাপদ ব্যবহার","Selected files are read on this device and decoded in a temporary Web Worker. The worker is terminated when processing finishes or you cancel. Patient name, ID, birth date and accession fields are not displayed. This page does not upload or save images and has no screenshot-sharing feature.":"নির্বাচিত ফাইলগুলি এই ডিভাইসে পড়া হয় এবং একটি অস্থায়ী ওয়েব ওয়ার্কারে ডিকোড করা হয়৷ প্রসেসিং শেষ হলে বা আপনি বাতিল করলে কর্মীকে বরখাস্ত করা হয়। রোগীর নাম, আইডি, জন্ম তারিখ এবং যোগদানের ক্ষেত্রগুলি প্রদর্শিত হয় না। এই পৃষ্ঠাটি ছবি আপলোড বা সংরক্ষণ করে না এবং স্ক্রিনশট-ভাগ করার বৈশিষ্ট্য নেই।","DICOM viewer questions":"DICOM দর্শকের প্রশ্ন","Formats and limitations":"ফরম্যাট এবং সীমাবদ্ধতা","This is a basic file viewer, not a PACS, DICOMweb client, radiology workstation or diagnostic device. It does not support compressed transfer syntaxes, color images, multi-frame objects, presentation states, overlays, structured reports, enhanced multi-frame studies or clinical measurements. Do not use it to make or change a diagnosis. If a study fails, the viewer reports the unsupported feature instead of showing a blank image.":"এটি একটি মৌলিক ফাইল ভিউয়ার, একটি PACS, DICOMweb ক্লায়েন্ট, রেডিওলজি ওয়ার্কস্টেশন বা ডায়াগনস্টিক ডিভাইস নয়। এটি কম্প্রেসড ট্রান্সফার সিনট্যাক্স, কালার ইমেজ, মাল্টি-ফ্রেম অবজেক্ট, প্রেজেন্টেশন স্টেট, ওভারলে, স্ট্রাকচার্ড রিপোর্ট, বর্ধিত মাল্টি-ফ্রেম স্টাডি বা ক্লিনিকাল পরিমাপ সমর্থন করে না। রোগ নির্ণয় করতে বা পরিবর্তন করতে এটি ব্যবহার করবেন না। যদি একটি গবেষণা ব্যর্থ হয়, দর্শক একটি ফাঁকা ছবি দেখানোর পরিবর্তে অসমর্থিত বৈশিষ্ট্য রিপোর্ট করে।","Are my medical images uploaded?":"আমার চিকিৎসা ছবি আপলোড করা হয়?","No. The selected file bytes are read locally by your browser and a temporary local worker. This tool has no upload, remote PACS or DICOMweb connection.":"না। নির্বাচিত ফাইল বাইটগুলি স্থানীয়ভাবে আপনার ব্রাউজার এবং একজন অস্থায়ী স্থানীয় কর্মী দ্বারা পড়া হয়৷ এই টুলটিতে কোনো আপলোড, দূরবর্তী PACS বা DICOMweb সংযোগ নেই৷","Can I use this viewer to diagnose a condition?":"আমি কি এই ভিউয়ারটিকে একটি শর্ত নির্ণয় করতে ব্যবহার করতে পারি?","No. It is a limited technical viewer for supported files, not a medical device or diagnostic workstation. Use validated clinical software and ask a qualified clinician to interpret medical images.":"না। এটি সমর্থিত ফাইলগুলির জন্য একটি সীমিত প্রযুক্তিগত দর্শক, একটি মেডিকেল ডিভাইস বা ডায়াগনস্টিক ওয়ার্কস্টেশন নয়। বৈধ ক্লিনিকাল সফ্টওয়্যার ব্যবহার করুন এবং একজন যোগ্য চিকিত্সককে চিকিৎসা চিত্রগুলি ব্যাখ্যা করতে বলুন।","Choose DICOM file(s)":"DICOM ফাইল(গুলি) চয়ন করুন","Medical files can contain identifying information. This viewer does not upload them and hides common identity fields, but review your screen before sharing it.":"মেডিকেল ফাইলে সনাক্তকারী তথ্য থাকতে পারে। এই দর্শক সেগুলি আপলোড করে না এবং সাধারণ পরিচয় ক্ষেত্রগুলি লুকিয়ে রাখে, তবে এটি ভাগ করার আগে আপনার স্ক্রিনটি পর্যালোচনা করুন৷","Select a single DICOM image or files from a single series. Supported: uncompressed, single-frame, 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome Part 10 files. A computer is recommended for larger studies.":"একটি সিরিজ থেকে একটি একক DICOM ছবি বা ফাইল নির্বাচন করুন৷ সমর্থিত: অসংকুচিত, একক-ফ্রেম, 8-বিট বা 16-বিট একরঙা অংশ 10 ফাইল। বড় অধ্যয়নের জন্য একটি কম্পিউটার সুপারিশ করা হয়।","Choose one image or a series to begin.":"শুরু করতে একটি ছবি বা একটি সিরিজ বেছে নিন।","Reading locally":"স্থানীয়ভাবে পড়া","Image series ready.":"ইমেজ সিরিজ প্রস্তুত।","Images ready. The files did not include a series identifier; check that you selected only one series.":"ছবি প্রস্তুত। ফাইলগুলিতে একটি সিরিজ শনাক্তকারী অন্তর্ভুক্ত ছিল না; আপনি শুধুমাত্র একটি সিরিজ নির্বাচন করেছেন তা পরীক্ষা করুন।","Reading cancelled. The temporary viewer data was cleared.":"পড়া বাতিল করা হয়েছে৷ অস্থায়ী দর্শক ডেটা সাফ করা হয়েছে৷","Clear files":"ফাইলগুলি সাফ করুন৷","Cancel reading":"পড়া বাতিল করুন","Previous slice":"আগের স্লাইস","Next slice":"পরবর্তী স্লাইস","Slice":"স্লাইস","Current slice":"বর্তমান স্লাইস","Window center":"উইন্ডো সেন্টার","Window width":"উইন্ডোর প্রস্থ","Modality":"মোডালিটি","Image size":"ছবির আকার","Pixel spacing":"পিক্সেল ব্যবধান","Slice thickness":"স্লাইস বেধ","Image position (patient coordinates)":"চিত্রের অবস্থান (রোগীর স্থানাঙ্ক)","Image orientation":"ইমেজ ওরিয়েন্টেশন","Photometric interpretation":"ফটোমেট্রিক ব্যাখ্যা","Pixel format":"পিক্সেল বিন্যাস","Transfer syntax":"সিনট্যাক্স স্থানান্তর করুন","Not available":"উপলভ্য নয়","This is not a DICOM Part 10 file with a DICM header.":"এটি একটি DICOM শিরোনাম সহ একটি DICOM অংশ 10 ফাইল নয়৷","The DICOM file is truncated or malformed.":"DICOM ফাইলটি কাটা বা বিকৃত।","Unsupported transfer syntax. This viewer accepts only uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian and Explicit VR Little Endian.":"অসমর্থিত স্থানান্তর সিনট্যাক্স। এই দর্শক শুধুমাত্র অসংকুচিত ইমপ্লিসিট ভিআর লিটল এন্ডিয়ান এবং এক্সপ্লিসিট ভিআর লিটল এন্ডিয়ান গ্রহণ করে।","This DICOM object has no pixel data to display.":"এই DICOM বস্তুটিতে প্রদর্শনের জন্য কোনো পিক্সেল ডেটা নেই।","Image dimensions exceed this viewer’s safe limit (2,048 per side and 4 megapixels per image).":"চিত্রের মাত্রা এই দর্শকের নিরাপদ সীমা অতিক্রম করেছে (প্রতি পাশে 2,048 এবং চিত্র প্রতি 4 মেগাপিক্সেল)।","Unsupported image type. Choose a single-sample MONOCHROME1 or MONOCHROME2 image.":"অসমর্থিত চিত্রের ধরন। একটি একক-নমুনা MONOCHROME1 বা MONOCHROME2 ছবি চয়ন করুন৷","Unsupported pixel encoding. Only 8-bit and 16-bit monochrome integer pixels are supported.":"অসমর্থিত পিক্সেল এনকোডিং। শুধুমাত্র 8-বিট এবং 16-বিট একরঙা পূর্ণসংখ্যা পিক্সেল সমর্থিত।","This file contains multiple frames. Select a single-frame image or split the series with trusted DICOM software.":"এই ফাইলটিতে একাধিক ফ্রেম রয়েছে। একটি একক-ফ্রেম চিত্র নির্বাচন করুন বা বিশ্বস্ত DICOM সফ্টওয়্যার দিয়ে সিরিজটি বিভক্ত করুন।","Invalid rescale values in this image.":"এই ছবিতে অবৈধ রিস্কেল মান।","This image uses a modality lookup table that this viewer does not support.":"এই ছবিটি একটি মোডালিটি লুকআপ টেবিল ব্যবহার করে যা এই দর্শক সমর্থন করে না।","A file is empty or exceeds the 16 MiB per-file limit.":"একটি ফাইল খালি বা 16 MiB প্রতি ফাইলের সীমা অতিক্রম করে।","This selection exceeds the safe series limit (100 files, 128 MiB input or 20 megapixels total). Select a smaller series.":"এই নির্বাচনটি নিরাপদ সিরিজের সীমা অতিক্রম করেছে (100 ফাইল, 128 MiB ইনপুট বা 20 মেগাপিক্সেল মোট)। একটি ছোট সিরিজ নির্বাচন করুন.","The selection contains more than one DICOM series. Choose files from one series only.":"নির্বাচনে একাধিক DICOM সিরিজ রয়েছে। শুধুমাত্র একটি সিরিজ থেকে ফাইল চয়ন করুন.","The selected files have different image dimensions. Choose one consistent series.":"নির্বাচিত ফাইলগুলির বিভিন্ন চিত্রের মাত্রা রয়েছে৷ একটি ধারাবাহিক সিরিজ বেছে নিন।","The selected files have different image orientations. Choose one consistent series.":"নির্বাচিত ফাইলগুলির বিভিন্ন ইমেজ ওরিয়েন্টেশন আছে। একটি ধারাবাহিক সিরিজ বেছে নিন।","This file could not be read as a supported DICOM image.":"এই ফাইলটি একটি সমর্থিত DICOM চিত্র হিসাবে পড়া যাবে না৷","Enter a finite window center and a window width of at least 1.":"একটি সীমাবদ্ধ উইন্ডো কেন্দ্র এবং কমপক্ষে 1 এর একটি উইন্ডো প্রস্থ লিখুন।","DICOM image preview":"DICOM ছবির পূর্বরূপ","Image metadata":"ইমেজ মেটাডেটা","Use the slice slider, or the previous and next buttons, to move through the series.":"সিরিজের মধ্য দিয়ে যেতে স্লাইস স্লাইডার বা পূর্ববর্তী এবং পরবর্তী বোতাম ব্যবহার করুন।"},"ca":{"Private DICOM Image Viewer":"Visor d'imatges DICOM privat","DICOM Viewer — Open Medical Images Privately in Your Browser":"Visor DICOM: obriu imatges mèdiques de manera privada al vostre navegador","Open and scroll through uncompressed monochrome DICOM image series locally. Adjust window and level; files are not uploaded. Compressed formats are identified clearly.":"Obre i desplaça't localment per la sèrie d'imatges DICOM monocromes sense comprimir. Ajusteu la finestra i el nivell; els fitxers no es carreguen. Els formats comprimits s'identifiquen clarament.","Open a DICOM image or select one local series. Scroll through ordered slices, adjust window and level, and inspect technical image metadata. Files stay in this browser.":"Obre una imatge DICOM o selecciona una sèrie local. Desplaceu-vos per les seccions ordenades, ajusteu la finestra i el nivell i inspeccioneu les metadades de la imatge tècnica. Els fitxers romanen en aquest navegador.","Supported images":"Imatges admeses","This viewer reads DICOM Part 10 files with uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian or Explicit VR Little Endian pixel data. It supports single-frame 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome images, including MONOCHROME1 inversion.":"Aquest visor llegeix fitxers DICOM Part 10 amb dades de píxels de Little Endian VR implícites o Little Endian de VR explícites sense comprimir. Admet imatges monocromes d'un sol fotograma 8-bit o 16-bit, inclosa la inversió MONOCHROME1.","Privacy and safe use":"Privadesa i ús segur","Selected files are read on this device and decoded in a temporary Web Worker. The worker is terminated when processing finishes or you cancel. Patient name, ID, birth date and accession fields are not displayed. This page does not upload or save images and has no screenshot-sharing feature.":"Els fitxers seleccionats es llegeixen en aquest dispositiu i es descodifiquen en un treballador web temporal. El treballador s'acomiada quan finalitzi la tramitació o vostè cancel·la. Els camps de nom del pacient, identificador, data de naixement i accés no es mostren. Aquesta pàgina no carrega ni desa imatges i no té cap funció per compartir captures de pantalla.","DICOM viewer questions":"Preguntes del visualitzador DICOM","Formats and limitations":"Formats i limitacions","This is a basic file viewer, not a PACS, DICOMweb client, radiology workstation or diagnostic device. It does not support compressed transfer syntaxes, color images, multi-frame objects, presentation states, overlays, structured reports, enhanced multi-frame studies or clinical measurements. Do not use it to make or change a diagnosis. If a study fails, the viewer reports the unsupported feature instead of showing a blank image.":"Aquest és un visualitzador de fitxers bàsic, no un PACS, un client DICOMweb, una estació de treball de radiologia o un dispositiu de diagnòstic. No admet sintaxis de transferència comprimides, imatges en color, objectes multifotograma, estats de presentació, superposicions, informes estructurats, estudis millorats multifotograma o mesures clíniques. No l'utilitzeu per fer o canviar un diagnòstic. Si un estudi falla, l'espectador informa de la funció no compatible en lloc de mostrar una imatge en blanc.","Are my medical images uploaded?":"S'han penjat les meves imatges mèdiques?","No. The selected file bytes are read locally by your browser and a temporary local worker. This tool has no upload, remote PACS or DICOMweb connection.":"Núm. El vostre navegador i un treballador local temporal llegeixen localment els bytes de fitxer seleccionats. Aquesta eina no té connexió remota, PACS o DICOMweb.","Can I use this viewer to diagnose a condition?":"Puc utilitzar aquest visor per diagnosticar una afecció?","No. It is a limited technical viewer for supported files, not a medical device or diagnostic workstation. Use validated clinical software and ask a qualified clinician to interpret medical images.":"Núm. És un visor tècnic limitat per a fitxers compatibles, no un dispositiu mèdic ni una estació de treball de diagnòstic. Utilitzeu programari clínic validat i demaneu a un metge qualificat que interpreti imatges mèdiques.","Choose DICOM file(s)":"Trieu fitxers DICOM","Medical files can contain identifying information. This viewer does not upload them and hides common identity fields, but review your screen before sharing it.":"Els fitxers mèdics poden contenir informació d'identificació. Aquest visor no els penja i amaga camps d'identitat comuns, però revisa la teva pantalla abans de compartir-la.","Select a single DICOM image or files from a single series. Supported: uncompressed, single-frame, 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome Part 10 files. A computer is recommended for larger studies.":"Seleccioneu una única imatge DICOM o fitxers d'una sola sèrie. Suport: sense comprimir, fotograma únic,8-bit o16Part monocroma -bit10fitxers. Es recomana un ordinador per a estudis més grans.","Choose one image or a series to begin.":"Trieu una imatge o una sèrie per començar.","Reading locally":"Lectura local","Image series ready.":"Sèrie d'imatges a punt.","Images ready. The files did not include a series identifier; check that you selected only one series.":"Imatges a punt. Els fitxers no incloïen un identificador de sèrie; comproveu que només heu seleccionat una sèrie.","Reading cancelled. The temporary viewer data was cleared.":"Lectura cancel·lada. S'han esborrat les dades temporals del visualitzador.","Clear files":"Esborra els fitxers","Cancel reading":"Cancel·la la lectura","Previous slice":"Tronc anterior","Next slice":"Següent tros","Slice":"Tall","Current slice":"Tronc actual","Window center":"Centre de la finestra","Window width":"Amplada de la finestra","Modality":"Modalitat","Image size":"Mida de la imatge","Pixel spacing":"Espaciat entre píxels","Slice thickness":"Grossor de llesca","Image position (patient coordinates)":"Posició de la imatge (coordenades del pacient)","Image orientation":"Orientació de la imatge","Photometric interpretation":"Interpretació fotomètrica","Pixel format":"Format de píxels","Transfer syntax":"Transferir sintaxi","Not available":"No disponible","This is not a DICOM Part 10 file with a DICM header.":"Aquest no és un fitxer DICOM Part 10 amb una capçalera DICM.","The DICOM file is truncated or malformed.":"El fitxer DICOM està truncat o té un format incorrecte.","Unsupported transfer syntax. This viewer accepts only uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian and Explicit VR Little Endian.":"Sintaxi de transferència no admesa. Aquest espectador només accepta Little Endian VR implícit i Little Endian VR explícit sense comprimir.","This DICOM object has no pixel data to display.":"Aquest objecte DICOM no té dades de píxels per mostrar.","Image dimensions exceed this viewer’s safe limit (2,048 per side and 4 megapixels per image).":"Les dimensions de la imatge superen el límit segur d'aquest visor (2,048 per costat i 4 megapíxels per imatge).","Unsupported image type. Choose a single-sample MONOCHROME1 or MONOCHROME2 image.":"Tipus d'imatge no compatible. Trieu una imatge d'una mostra MONOCHROME1 o MONOCHROME2.","Unsupported pixel encoding. Only 8-bit and 16-bit monochrome integer pixels are supported.":"Codificació de píxels no admesa. Només s'admeten els píxels enters monocroms de 8 i 16 bits.","This file contains multiple frames. Select a single-frame image or split the series with trusted DICOM software.":"Aquest fitxer conté diversos fotogrames. Seleccioneu una imatge d'un sol fotograma o dividiu la sèrie amb un programari DICOM de confiança.","Invalid rescale values in this image.":"Valors de reescala no vàlids en aquesta imatge.","This image uses a modality lookup table that this viewer does not support.":"Aquesta imatge utilitza una taula de cerca de modalitats que aquest visor no admet.","A file is empty or exceeds the 16 MiB per-file limit.":"Un fitxer està buit o supera el límit 16 MiB per fitxer.","This selection exceeds the safe series limit (100 files, 128 MiB input or 20 megapixels total). Select a smaller series.":"Aquesta selecció supera el límit de sèrie segura (fitxers 100, entrada 128 MiB o 20 megapíxels en total). Seleccioneu una sèrie més petita.","The selection contains more than one DICOM series. Choose files from one series only.":"La selecció conté més d'una sèrie DICOM. Trieu fitxers només d'una sèrie.","The selected files have different image dimensions. Choose one consistent series.":"Els fitxers seleccionats tenen diferents dimensions d'imatge. Trieu una sèrie coherent.","The selected files have different image orientations. Choose one consistent series.":"Els fitxers seleccionats tenen diferents orientacions d'imatge. Trieu una sèrie coherent.","This file could not be read as a supported DICOM image.":"Aquest fitxer no s'ha pogut llegir com a imatge DICOM compatible.","Enter a finite window center and a window width of at least 1.":"Introduïu un centre de finestra finit i una amplada de finestra d'almenys 1.","DICOM image preview":"Previsualització de la imatge DICOM","Image metadata":"Metadades de la imatge","Use the slice slider, or the previous and next buttons, to move through the series.":"Utilitzeu el control lliscant de talls, o els botons anterior i següent, per moure's per la sèrie."},"de":{"Private DICOM Image Viewer":"Privater DICOM-Bildbetrachter","DICOM Viewer — Open Medical Images Privately in Your Browser":"DICOM Viewer – Öffnen Sie medizinische Bilder privat in Ihrem Browser","Open and scroll through uncompressed monochrome DICOM image series locally. Adjust window and level; files are not uploaded. Compressed formats are identified clearly.":"Lokal unkomprimierte monochrome DICOM-Bildserien öffnen und durchblättern. Fenster und Ebene anpassen; Dateien werden nicht hochgeladen. Komprimierte Formate werden eindeutig identifiziert.","Open a DICOM image or select one local series. Scroll through ordered slices, adjust window and level, and inspect technical image metadata. Files stay in this browser.":"Öffnen Sie ein DICOM-Bild oder wählen Sie eine lokale Serie aus. Scrollen Sie durch geordnete Slices, passen Sie Fenster und Ebene an und überprüfen Sie technische Bildmetadaten. Dateien bleiben in diesem Browser.","Supported images":"Unterstützte Bilder","This viewer reads DICOM Part 10 files with uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian or Explicit VR Little Endian pixel data. It supports single-frame 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome images, including MONOCHROME1 inversion.":"Dieser Viewer liest DICOM Part 10-Dateien mit unkomprimierten impliziten VR-Little-Endian- oder expliziten VR-Little-Endian-Pixeldaten. Es unterstützt Einzelbild-8-Bit- oder 16-Bit-Monochrombilder, einschließlich MONOCHROME1-Invertierung.","Privacy and safe use":"Privatsphäre und sichere Nutzung","Selected files are read on this device and decoded in a temporary Web Worker. The worker is terminated when processing finishes or you cancel. Patient name, ID, birth date and accession fields are not displayed. This page does not upload or save images and has no screenshot-sharing feature.":"Ausgewählte Dateien werden auf diesem Gerät gelesen und in einem temporären Web Worker dekodiert. Der Worker wird beendet, wenn die Verarbeitung abgeschlossen ist oder Sie abbrechen. Die Felder „Patientenname“, „ID“, „Geburtsdatum“ und „Beitritt“ werden nicht angezeigt. Auf dieser Seite werden keine Bilder hochgeladen oder gespeichert und es gibt keine Funktion zum Teilen von Screenshots.","DICOM viewer questions":"DICOM-Viewer-Fragen","Formats and limitations":"Formate und Einschränkungen","This is a basic file viewer, not a PACS, DICOMweb client, radiology workstation or diagnostic device. It does not support compressed transfer syntaxes, color images, multi-frame objects, presentation states, overlays, structured reports, enhanced multi-frame studies or clinical measurements. Do not use it to make or change a diagnosis. If a study fails, the viewer reports the unsupported feature instead of showing a blank image.":"Dies ist ein einfacher Dateibetrachter, kein PACS, DICOMweb-Client, Radiologie-Workstation oder Diagnosegerät. Komprimierte Übertragungssyntaxen, Farbbilder, Multiframe-Objekte, Präsentationszustände, Überlagerungen, strukturierte Berichte, erweiterte Multiframe-Studien oder klinische Messungen werden nicht unterstützt. Verwenden Sie es nicht, um eine Diagnose zu stellen oder zu ändern. Wenn eine Studie fehlschlägt, meldet der Betrachter die nicht unterstützte Funktion, anstatt ein leeres Bild anzuzeigen.","Are my medical images uploaded?":"Werden meine medizinischen Bilder hochgeladen?","No. The selected file bytes are read locally by your browser and a temporary local worker. This tool has no upload, remote PACS or DICOMweb connection.":"Nr. Die ausgewählten Dateibytes werden lokal von Ihrem Browser und einem temporären lokalen Worker gelesen. Dieses Tool verfügt über keine Upload-, Remote-PACS- oder DICOMweb-Verbindung.","Can I use this viewer to diagnose a condition?":"Kann ich diesen Viewer zur Diagnose einer Erkrankung verwenden?","No. It is a limited technical viewer for supported files, not a medical device or diagnostic workstation. Use validated clinical software and ask a qualified clinician to interpret medical images.":"Nr. Es handelt sich um einen eingeschränkten technischen Viewer für unterstützte Dateien, nicht um ein medizinisches Gerät oder eine Diagnose-Workstation. Verwenden Sie validierte klinische Software und bitten Sie einen qualifizierten Arzt, medizinische Bilder zu interpretieren.","Choose DICOM file(s)":"DICOM-Datei(en) auswählen","Medical files can contain identifying information. This viewer does not upload them and hides common identity fields, but review your screen before sharing it.":"Medizinische Dateien können identifizierende Informationen enthalten. Dieser Viewer lädt sie nicht hoch und verbirgt allgemeine Identitätsfelder. Überprüfen Sie jedoch Ihren Bildschirm, bevor Sie ihn freigeben.","Select a single DICOM image or files from a single series. Supported: uncompressed, single-frame, 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome Part 10 files. A computer is recommended for larger studies.":"Wählen Sie ein einzelnes DICOM-Bild oder Dateien aus einer einzelnen Serie aus. Unterstützt: unkomprimierte Einzelbilddateien, 8-Bit- oder 16-Bit-Monochrom-Part-10-Dateien. Für größere Studien empfiehlt sich ein Computer.","Choose one image or a series to begin.":"Wählen Sie ein Bild oder eine Serie aus, um zu beginnen.","Reading locally":"Lokal lesen","Image series ready.":"Bildserie bereit.","Images ready. The files did not include a series identifier; check that you selected only one series.":"Bilder bereit. Die Dateien enthielten keine Serienkennung; Überprüfen Sie, ob Sie nur eine Serie ausgewählt haben.","Reading cancelled. The temporary viewer data was cleared.":"Lesung abgebrochen. Die temporären Zuschauerdaten wurden gelöscht.","Clear files":"Dateien löschen","Cancel reading":"Lesung abbrechen","Previous slice":"Vorheriges Segment","Next slice":"Nächstes Segment","Slice":"Scheibe","Current slice":"Aktuelles Segment","Window center":"Fenstermitte","Window width":"Fensterbreite","Modality":"Modalität","Image size":"Bildgröße","Pixel spacing":"Pixelabstand","Slice thickness":"Scheibendicke","Image position (patient coordinates)":"Bildposition (Patientenkoordinaten)","Image orientation":"Bildausrichtung","Photometric interpretation":"Photometrische Interpretation","Pixel format":"Pixelformat","Transfer syntax":"Übertragungssyntax","Not available":"Nicht verfügbar","This is not a DICOM Part 10 file with a DICM header.":"Dies ist keine DICOM-Part-10-Datei mit einem DICM-Header.","The DICOM file is truncated or malformed.":"Die DICOM-Datei ist abgeschnitten oder fehlerhaft.","Unsupported transfer syntax. This viewer accepts only uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian and Explicit VR Little Endian.":"Nicht unterstützte Übertragungssyntax. Dieser Viewer akzeptiert nur unkomprimiertes implizites VR-Little-Endian und explizites VR-Little-Endian.","This DICOM object has no pixel data to display.":"Dieses DICOM-Objekt verfügt über keine anzuzeigenden Pixeldaten.","Image dimensions exceed this viewer’s safe limit (2,048 per side and 4 megapixels per image).":"Die Bildabmessungen überschreiten die sichere Grenze dieses Viewers (2,048 pro Seite und 4 Megapixel pro Bild).","Unsupported image type. Choose a single-sample MONOCHROME1 or MONOCHROME2 image.":"Nicht unterstützter Bildtyp. Wählen Sie ein MONOCHROME1- oder MONOCHROME2-Einzelprobenbild.","Unsupported pixel encoding. Only 8-bit and 16-bit monochrome integer pixels are supported.":"Nicht unterstützte Pixelkodierung. Es werden nur monochrome Ganzzahlpixel mit 8-Bit und 16-Bit unterstützt.","This file contains multiple frames. Select a single-frame image or split the series with trusted DICOM software.":"Diese Datei enthält mehrere Frames. Wählen Sie ein Einzelbild aus oder teilen Sie die Serie mit der bewährten DICOM-Software auf.","Invalid rescale values in this image.":"Ungültige Neuskalierungswerte in diesem Bild.","This image uses a modality lookup table that this viewer does not support.":"Dieses Bild verwendet eine Modalitäts-Nachschlagetabelle, die dieser Viewer nicht unterstützt.","A file is empty or exceeds the 16 MiB per-file limit.":"Eine Datei ist leer oder überschreitet das MiB-Limit 16 pro Datei.","This selection exceeds the safe series limit (100 files, 128 MiB input or 20 megapixels total). Select a smaller series.":"Diese Auswahl überschreitet das sichere Serienlimit (100-Dateien, 128 MiB-Eingabe oder 20 Megapixel insgesamt). Wählen Sie eine kleinere Serie.","The selection contains more than one DICOM series. Choose files from one series only.":"Die Auswahl enthält mehr als eine DICOM-Serie. Wählen Sie nur Dateien aus einer Serie.","The selected files have different image dimensions. Choose one consistent series.":"Die ausgewählten Dateien haben unterschiedliche Bildabmessungen. Wählen Sie eine konsistente Serie.","The selected files have different image orientations. Choose one consistent series.":"Die ausgewählten Dateien haben unterschiedliche Bildausrichtungen. Wählen Sie eine konsistente Serie.","This file could not be read as a supported DICOM image.":"Diese Datei konnte nicht als unterstütztes DICOM-Bild gelesen werden.","Enter a finite window center and a window width of at least 1.":"Geben Sie einen endlichen Fenstermittelpunkt und eine Fensterbreite von mindestens 1 ein.","DICOM image preview":"DICOM-Bildvorschau","Image metadata":"Bildmetadaten","Use the slice slider, or the previous and next buttons, to move through the series.":"Verwenden Sie den Slice-Schieberegler oder die Schaltflächen „Zurück“ und „Weiter“, um durch die Serie zu navigieren."},"el":{"Private DICOM Image Viewer":"Ιδιωτικό πρόγραμμα προβολής εικόνων DICOM","DICOM Viewer — Open Medical Images Privately in Your Browser":"DICOM Viewer — Ανοίξτε τις ιατρικές εικόνες ιδιωτικά στο πρόγραμμα περιήγησής σας","Open and scroll through uncompressed monochrome DICOM image series locally. Adjust window and level; files are not uploaded. Compressed formats are identified clearly.":"Ανοίξτε και πραγματοποιήστε κύλιση στις μη συμπιεσμένες μονόχρωμες σειρές εικόνων DICOM τοπικά. Ρύθμιση παραθύρου και επιπέδου. τα αρχεία δεν μεταφορτώνονται. Οι συμπιεσμένες μορφές προσδιορίζονται με σαφήνεια.","Open a DICOM image or select one local series. Scroll through ordered slices, adjust window and level, and inspect technical image metadata. Files stay in this browser.":"Ανοίξτε μια εικόνα DICOM ή επιλέξτε μια τοπική σειρά. Πραγματοποιήστε κύλιση στα διατεταγμένα τμήματα, προσαρμόστε το παράθυρο και το επίπεδο και επιθεωρήστε τα τεχνικά μεταδεδομένα εικόνας. Τα αρχεία παραμένουν σε αυτό το πρόγραμμα περιήγησης.","Supported images":"Υποστηριζόμενες εικόνες","This viewer reads DICOM Part 10 files with uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian or Explicit VR Little Endian pixel data. It supports single-frame 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome images, including MONOCHROME1 inversion.":"Αυτό το πρόγραμμα προβολής διαβάζει αρχεία DICOM Part 10 με μη συμπιεσμένα δεδομένα εικονοστοιχείων Implicit VR Little Endian ή Explicit VR Little Endian. Υποστηρίζει μονόχρωμες εικόνες 8-bit ή 16-bit ενός καρέ, συμπεριλαμβανομένης της αναστροφής MONOCHROME1.","Privacy and safe use":"Απόρρητο και ασφαλής χρήση","Selected files are read on this device and decoded in a temporary Web Worker. The worker is terminated when processing finishes or you cancel. Patient name, ID, birth date and accession fields are not displayed. This page does not upload or save images and has no screenshot-sharing feature.":"Τα επιλεγμένα αρχεία διαβάζονται σε αυτήν τη συσκευή και αποκωδικοποιούνται σε ένα προσωρινό Web Worker. Ο εργαζόμενος τερματίζεται όταν τελειώσει η επεξεργασία ή ακυρώσετε. Το όνομα ασθενούς, η ταυτότητα, η ημερομηνία γέννησης και τα πεδία προσχώρησης δεν εμφανίζονται. Αυτή η σελίδα δεν ανεβάζει ούτε αποθηκεύει εικόνες και δεν διαθέτει δυνατότητα κοινής χρήσης στιγμιότυπων οθόνης.","DICOM viewer questions":"Ερωτήσεις θεατή DICOM","Formats and limitations":"Μορφές και περιορισμοί","This is a basic file viewer, not a PACS, DICOMweb client, radiology workstation or diagnostic device. It does not support compressed transfer syntaxes, color images, multi-frame objects, presentation states, overlays, structured reports, enhanced multi-frame studies or clinical measurements. Do not use it to make or change a diagnosis. If a study fails, the viewer reports the unsupported feature instead of showing a blank image.":"Πρόκειται για βασικό πρόγραμμα προβολής αρχείων, όχι για PACS, πρόγραμμα-πελάτη DICOMweb, σταθμό εργασίας ακτινολογίας ή διαγνωστική συσκευή. Δεν υποστηρίζει συμπιεσμένες συντακτικές μεταφοράς, έγχρωμες εικόνες, αντικείμενα πολλαπλών καρέ, καταστάσεις παρουσίασης, επικαλύψεις, δομημένες αναφορές, βελτιωμένες μελέτες πολλαπλών καρέ ή κλινικές μετρήσεις. Μην το χρησιμοποιείτε για να κάνετε ή να αλλάξετε μια διάγνωση. Εάν μια μελέτη αποτύχει, ο θεατής αναφέρει τη μη υποστηριζόμενη δυνατότητα αντί να εμφανίζει μια κενή εικόνα.","Are my medical images uploaded?":"Μεταφορτώθηκαν οι ιατρικές μου εικόνες;","No. The selected file bytes are read locally by your browser and a temporary local worker. This tool has no upload, remote PACS or DICOMweb connection.":"Αρ. Τα επιλεγμένα byte αρχείου διαβάζονται τοπικά από το πρόγραμμα περιήγησής σας και από έναν προσωρινό τοπικό εργαζόμενο. Αυτό το εργαλείο δεν έχει σύνδεση μεταφόρτωσης, απομακρυσμένου PACS ή DICOMweb.","Can I use this viewer to diagnose a condition?":"Μπορώ να χρησιμοποιήσω αυτό το πρόγραμμα προβολής για να διαγνώσω μια πάθηση;","No. It is a limited technical viewer for supported files, not a medical device or diagnostic workstation. Use validated clinical software and ask a qualified clinician to interpret medical images.":"Αρ. Είναι μια περιορισμένη τεχνική προβολή για υποστηριζόμενα αρχεία, όχι ιατρική συσκευή ή διαγνωστικό σταθμό εργασίας. Χρησιμοποιήστε επικυρωμένο κλινικό λογισμικό και ζητήστε από έναν εξειδικευμένο κλινικό ιατρό να ερμηνεύσει ιατρικές εικόνες.","Choose DICOM file(s)":"Επιλέξτε αρχείο(α) DICOM","Medical files can contain identifying information. This viewer does not upload them and hides common identity fields, but review your screen before sharing it.":"Τα ιατρικά αρχεία μπορούν να περιέχουν πληροφορίες ταυτοποίησης. Αυτό το πρόγραμμα προβολής δεν τα ανεβάζει και αποκρύπτει κοινά πεδία ταυτότητας, αλλά εξετάζει την οθόνη σας πριν την κοινοποιήσει.","Select a single DICOM image or files from a single series. Supported: uncompressed, single-frame, 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome Part 10 files. A computer is recommended for larger studies.":"Επιλέξτε μία εικόνα ή αρχεία DICOM από μία μόνο σειρά. Υποστηριζόμενα: μη συμπιεσμένα αρχεία ενός καρέ, 8-bit ή 16-bit μονόχρωμα μέρη 10. Συνιστάται υπολογιστής για μεγαλύτερες μελέτες.","Choose one image or a series to begin.":"Επιλέξτε μια εικόνα ή μια σειρά για να ξεκινήσετε.","Reading locally":"Ανάγνωση τοπικά","Image series ready.":"Έτοιμη σειρά εικόνων.","Images ready. The files did not include a series identifier; check that you selected only one series.":"Έτοιμες εικόνες. Τα αρχεία δεν περιλάμβαναν αναγνωριστικό σειράς. ελέγξτε ότι επιλέξατε μόνο μία σειρά.","Reading cancelled. The temporary viewer data was cleared.":"Η ανάγνωση ακυρώθηκε. Τα προσωρινά δεδομένα θεατή διαγράφηκαν.","Clear files":"Εκκαθάριση αρχείων","Cancel reading":"Ακύρωση ανάγνωσης","Previous slice":"Προηγούμενο κομμάτι","Next slice":"Επόμενο κομμάτι","Slice":"Φέτα","Current slice":"Τρέχον κομμάτι","Window center":"Κέντρο παραθύρου","Window width":"Πλάτος παραθύρου","Modality":"Τρόπος","Image size":"Μέγεθος εικόνας","Pixel spacing":"Απόσταση pixel","Slice thickness":"Πάχος φέτας","Image position (patient coordinates)":"Θέση εικόνας (συντεταγμένες ασθενούς)","Image orientation":"Προσανατολισμός εικόνας","Photometric interpretation":"Φωτομετρική ερμηνεία","Pixel format":"Μορφή pixel","Transfer syntax":"Σύνταξη μεταφοράς","Not available":"Μη διαθέσιμο","This is not a DICOM Part 10 file with a DICM header.":"Δεν είναι αρχείο DICOM Part 10 με κεφαλίδα DICM.","The DICOM file is truncated or malformed.":"Το αρχείο DICOM είναι περικομμένο ή εσφαλμένο.","Unsupported transfer syntax. This viewer accepts only uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian and Explicit VR Little Endian.":"Μη υποστηριζόμενη σύνταξη μεταφοράς. Αυτός ο θεατής δέχεται μόνο μη συμπιεσμένα Implicit VR Little Endian και Explicit VR Little Endian.","This DICOM object has no pixel data to display.":"Αυτό το αντικείμενο DICOM δεν έχει δεδομένα pixel για εμφάνιση.","Image dimensions exceed this viewer’s safe limit (2,048 per side and 4 megapixels per image).":"Οι διαστάσεις της εικόνας υπερβαίνουν το ασφαλές όριο αυτού του θεατή (2,048 ανά πλευρά και 4 megapixel ανά εικόνα).","Unsupported image type. Choose a single-sample MONOCHROME1 or MONOCHROME2 image.":"Μη υποστηριζόμενος τύπος εικόνας. Επιλέξτε μια εικόνα ενός δείγματος MONOCHROME1 ή MONOCHROME2.","Unsupported pixel encoding. Only 8-bit and 16-bit monochrome integer pixels are supported.":"Μη υποστηριζόμενη κωδικοποίηση pixel. Υποστηρίζονται μόνο μονόχρωμα ακέραια pixel 8-bit και 16-bit.","This file contains multiple frames. Select a single-frame image or split the series with trusted DICOM software.":"Αυτό το αρχείο περιέχει πολλά πλαίσια. Επιλέξτε μια εικόνα ενός καρέ ή χωρίστε τη σειρά με αξιόπιστο λογισμικό DICOM.","Invalid rescale values in this image.":"Μη έγκυρες τιμές αλλαγής κλίμακας σε αυτήν την εικόνα.","This image uses a modality lookup table that this viewer does not support.":"Αυτή η εικόνα χρησιμοποιεί έναν πίνακα αναζήτησης τροπικότητας που δεν υποστηρίζει αυτό το πρόγραμμα προβολής.","A file is empty or exceeds the 16 MiB per-file limit.":"Ένα αρχείο είναι κενό ή υπερβαίνει το όριο 16 MiB ανά αρχείο.","This selection exceeds the safe series limit (100 files, 128 MiB input or 20 megapixels total). Select a smaller series.":"Αυτή η επιλογή υπερβαίνει το όριο ασφαλούς σειράς (αρχεία 100, είσοδος 128 MiB ή 20 megapixel συνολικά). Επιλέξτε μια μικρότερη σειρά.","The selection contains more than one DICOM series. Choose files from one series only.":"Η επιλογή περιέχει περισσότερες από μία σειρές DICOM. Επιλέξτε αρχεία από μία μόνο σειρά.","The selected files have different image dimensions. Choose one consistent series.":"Τα επιλεγμένα αρχεία έχουν διαφορετικές διαστάσεις εικόνας. Επιλέξτε μια σταθερή σειρά.","The selected files have different image orientations. Choose one consistent series.":"Τα επιλεγμένα αρχεία έχουν διαφορετικούς προσανατολισμούς εικόνας. Επιλέξτε μια σταθερή σειρά.","This file could not be read as a supported DICOM image.":"Δεν ήταν δυνατή η ανάγνωση αυτού του αρχείου ως υποστηριζόμενης εικόνας DICOM.","Enter a finite window center and a window width of at least 1.":"Εισαγάγετε ένα πεπερασμένο κέντρο παραθύρου και ένα πλάτος παραθύρου τουλάχιστον 1.","DICOM image preview":"Προεπισκόπηση εικόνας DICOM","Image metadata":"Μεταδεδομένα εικόνας","Use the slice slider, or the previous and next buttons, to move through the series.":"Χρησιμοποιήστε το ρυθμιστικό φέτας ή το προηγούμενο και το επόμενο κουμπί για να μετακινηθείτε στη σειρά."},"es":{"Private DICOM Image Viewer":"Visor de imágenes DICOM privado","DICOM Viewer — Open Medical Images Privately in Your Browser":"Visor DICOM: abra imágenes médicas de forma privada en su navegador","Open and scroll through uncompressed monochrome DICOM image series locally. Adjust window and level; files are not uploaded. Compressed formats are identified clearly.":"Abra y desplácese localmente por series de imágenes DICOM monocromáticas sin comprimir. Ajustar ventana y nivel; Los archivos no se cargan. Los formatos comprimidos se identifican claramente.","Open a DICOM image or select one local series. Scroll through ordered slices, adjust window and level, and inspect technical image metadata. Files stay in this browser.":"Abra una imagen DICOM o seleccione una serie local. Desplácese por los sectores ordenados, ajuste la ventana y el nivel e inspeccione los metadatos técnicos de la imagen. Los archivos permanecen en este navegador.","Supported images":"Imágenes compatibles","This viewer reads DICOM Part 10 files with uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian or Explicit VR Little Endian pixel data. It supports single-frame 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome images, including MONOCHROME1 inversion.":"Este visor lee archivos DICOM Part 10 con datos de píxeles de VR Little Endian implícitos o Little Endian de VR explícitos sin comprimir. Admite imágenes monocromáticas de un solo cuadro 8-bit o 16-bit, incluida la inversión MONOCHROME1.","Privacy and safe use":"Privacidad y uso seguro","Selected files are read on this device and decoded in a temporary Web Worker. The worker is terminated when processing finishes or you cancel. Patient name, ID, birth date and accession fields are not displayed. This page does not upload or save images and has no screenshot-sharing feature.":"Los archivos seleccionados se leen en este dispositivo y se decodifican en un Web Worker temporal. El trabajador se da de baja cuando finaliza el procesamiento o se cancela. Los campos de nombre del paciente, ID, fecha de nacimiento y acceso no se muestran. Esta página no carga ni guarda imágenes y no tiene función para compartir capturas de pantalla.","DICOM viewer questions":"Preguntas del visor DICOM","Formats and limitations":"Formatos y limitaciones","This is a basic file viewer, not a PACS, DICOMweb client, radiology workstation or diagnostic device. It does not support compressed transfer syntaxes, color images, multi-frame objects, presentation states, overlays, structured reports, enhanced multi-frame studies or clinical measurements. Do not use it to make or change a diagnosis. If a study fails, the viewer reports the unsupported feature instead of showing a blank image.":"Este es un visor de archivos básico, no un PACS, un cliente DICOMweb, una estación de trabajo de radiología o un dispositivo de diagnóstico. No admite sintaxis de transferencia comprimidas, imágenes en color, objetos de múltiples fotogramas, estados de presentación, superposiciones, informes estructurados, estudios mejorados de múltiples fotogramas ni mediciones clínicas. No lo utilice para realizar o cambiar un diagnóstico. Si un estudio falla, el espectador informa que la función no es compatible en lugar de mostrar una imagen en blanco.","Are my medical images uploaded?":"¿Se cargan mis imágenes médicas?","No. The selected file bytes are read locally by your browser and a temporary local worker. This tool has no upload, remote PACS or DICOMweb connection.":"No. Los bytes del archivo seleccionado son leídos localmente por su navegador y un trabajador local temporal. Esta herramienta no tiene carga, PACS remoto o conexión DICOMweb.","Can I use this viewer to diagnose a condition?":"¿Puedo utilizar este visor para diagnosticar una afección?","No. It is a limited technical viewer for supported files, not a medical device or diagnostic workstation. Use validated clinical software and ask a qualified clinician to interpret medical images.":"No. Es un visor técnico limitado para archivos compatibles, no un dispositivo médico ni una estación de trabajo de diagnóstico. Utilice software clínico validado y solicite a un médico calificado que interprete las imágenes médicas.","Choose DICOM file(s)":"Elija archivos DICOM","Medical files can contain identifying information. This viewer does not upload them and hides common identity fields, but review your screen before sharing it.":"Los archivos médicos pueden contener información de identificación. Este visor no los carga y oculta campos de identidad comunes, pero revisa tu pantalla antes de compartirla.","Select a single DICOM image or files from a single series. Supported: uncompressed, single-frame, 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome Part 10 files. A computer is recommended for larger studies.":"Seleccione una sola imagen DICOM o archivos de una sola serie. Admitido: archivos monocromáticos de parte 10 de un solo cuadro, sin comprimir, 8-bit o 16-bit. Se recomienda una computadora para estudios más grandes.","Choose one image or a series to begin.":"Elija una imagen o una serie para comenzar.","Reading locally":"Lectura local","Image series ready.":"Serie de imágenes lista.","Images ready. The files did not include a series identifier; check that you selected only one series.":"Imágenes listas. Los archivos no incluían un identificador de serie; comprueba que has seleccionado sólo una serie.","Reading cancelled. The temporary viewer data was cleared.":"Lectura cancelada. Se borraron los datos del espectador temporal.","Clear files":"Borrar archivos","Cancel reading":"Cancelar lectura","Previous slice":"Rebanada anterior","Next slice":"Siguiente segmento","Slice":"Rebanada","Current slice":"Sección actual","Window center":"Centro de ventana","Window width":"Ancho de ventana","Modality":"Modalidad","Image size":"Tamaño de imagen","Pixel spacing":"Espaciado de píxeles","Slice thickness":"Espesor de rebanada","Image position (patient coordinates)":"Posición de la imagen (coordenadas del paciente)","Image orientation":"Orientación de la imagen","Photometric interpretation":"Interpretación fotométrica","Pixel format":"Formato de píxeles","Transfer syntax":"Sintaxis de transferencia","Not available":"No disponible","This is not a DICOM Part 10 file with a DICM header.":"Este no es un archivo DICOM Part 10 con un encabezado DICM.","The DICOM file is truncated or malformed.":"El archivo DICOM está truncado o tiene formato incorrecto.","Unsupported transfer syntax. This viewer accepts only uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian and Explicit VR Little Endian.":"Sintaxis de transferencia no compatible. Este visor solo acepta Little Endian VR implícito y Little Endian VR explícito sin comprimir.","This DICOM object has no pixel data to display.":"Este objeto DICOM no tiene datos de píxeles para mostrar.","Image dimensions exceed this viewer’s safe limit (2,048 per side and 4 megapixels per image).":"Las dimensiones de la imagen exceden el límite seguro de este visor (2,048 por lado y 4 megapíxeles por imagen).","Unsupported image type. Choose a single-sample MONOCHROME1 or MONOCHROME2 image.":"Tipo de imagen no admitido. Elija una imagen MONOCHROME1 o MONOCHROME2 de muestra única.","Unsupported pixel encoding. Only 8-bit and 16-bit monochrome integer pixels are supported.":"Codificación de píxeles no compatible. Solo se admiten píxeles enteros monocromáticos de bits 8 y 16 de bits.","This file contains multiple frames. Select a single-frame image or split the series with trusted DICOM software.":"Este archivo contiene varios fotogramas. Seleccione una imagen de un solo cuadro o divida la serie con un software DICOM confiable.","Invalid rescale values in this image.":"Valores de cambio de escala no válidos en esta imagen.","This image uses a modality lookup table that this viewer does not support.":"Esta imagen utiliza una tabla de búsqueda de modalidades que este visor no admite.","A file is empty or exceeds the 16 MiB per-file limit.":"Un archivo está vacío o excede el límite de MiB por archivo 16.","This selection exceeds the safe series limit (100 files, 128 MiB input or 20 megapixels total). Select a smaller series.":"Esta selección excede el límite de serie segura (archivos 100, entrada MiB 128 o megapíxeles 20 total). Seleccione una serie más pequeña.","The selection contains more than one DICOM series. Choose files from one series only.":"La selección contiene más de una serie DICOM. Elija archivos de una sola serie.","The selected files have different image dimensions. Choose one consistent series.":"Los archivos seleccionados tienen diferentes dimensiones de imagen. Elija una serie consistente.","The selected files have different image orientations. Choose one consistent series.":"Los archivos seleccionados tienen diferentes orientaciones de imagen. Elija una serie consistente.","This file could not be read as a supported DICOM image.":"Este archivo no se pudo leer como una imagen DICOM compatible.","Enter a finite window center and a window width of at least 1.":"Ingrese un centro de ventana finito y un ancho de ventana de al menos 1.","DICOM image preview":"Vista previa de imagen DICOM","Image metadata":"Metadatos de imagen","Use the slice slider, or the previous and next buttons, to move through the series.":"Utilice el control deslizante de corte, o los botones anterior y siguiente, para moverse por la serie."},"fa":{"Private DICOM Image Viewer":"نمایشگر خصوصی DICOM\nنمایشگر","DICOM Viewer — Open Medical Images Privately in Your Browser":"DICOM — باز کردن تصاویر پزشکی به صورت خصوصی در مرورگر خود","Open and scroll through uncompressed monochrome DICOM image series locally. Adjust window and level; files are not uploaded. Compressed formats are identified clearly.":"مجموعه تصاویر تک رنگ DICOM فشرده نشده را به صورت محلی باز کرده و پیمایش کنید. تنظیم پنجره و سطح؛ فایل ها آپلود نمی شوند فرمت های فشرده به وضوح مشخص می شوند.","Open a DICOM image or select one local series. Scroll through ordered slices, adjust window and level, and inspect technical image metadata. Files stay in this browser.":"یک تصویر DICOM را باز کنید یا یک سری محلی را انتخاب کنید. در میان برش های سفارش داده شده پیمایش کنید، پنجره و سطح را تنظیم کنید، و ابرداده های تصویر فنی را بررسی کنید. فایل ها در این مرورگر باقی می مانند.","Supported images":"تصاویر پشتیبانی شده","This viewer reads DICOM Part 10 files with uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian or Explicit VR Little Endian pixel data. It supports single-frame 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome images, including MONOCHROME1 inversion.":"این بیننده فایل‌های DICOM Part 10 را با داده‌های پیکسل اندیان کوچک VR یا صریح VR Little Endian می‌خواند. از تصاویر تک‌فریم 8-bit یا 16-bit تک رنگ، از جمله وارونگی MONOCHROME1 پشتیبانی می‌کند.","Privacy and safe use":"حریم خصوصی و استفاده ایمن","Selected files are read on this device and decoded in a temporary Web Worker. The worker is terminated when processing finishes or you cancel. Patient name, ID, birth date and accession fields are not displayed. This page does not upload or save images and has no screenshot-sharing feature.":"فایل های انتخابی در این دستگاه خوانده می شوند و در Web Worker موقت رمزگشایی می شوند. هنگامی که پردازش به پایان می رسد یا شما لغو می کنید، کارگر خاتمه می یابد. نام بیمار، شناسه، تاریخ تولد و فیلدهای الحاق نمایش داده نمی شود. این صفحه تصاویر را آپلود یا ذخیره نمی کند و هیچ ویژگی اشتراک گذاری اسکرین شات ندارد.","DICOM viewer questions":"سوالات بیننده DICOM","Formats and limitations":"فرمت ها و محدودیت ها","This is a basic file viewer, not a PACS, DICOMweb client, radiology workstation or diagnostic device. It does not support compressed transfer syntaxes, color images, multi-frame objects, presentation states, overlays, structured reports, enhanced multi-frame studies or clinical measurements. Do not use it to make or change a diagnosis. If a study fails, the viewer reports the unsupported feature instead of showing a blank image.":"این یک نمایشگر فایل اصلی است، نه یک PACS، مشتری DICOMweb، ایستگاه کاری رادیولوژی یا دستگاه تشخیصی. از نحوهای انتقال فشرده، تصاویر رنگی، اشیاء چند فریمی، حالت‌های ارائه، پوشش‌ها، گزارش‌های ساختاریافته، مطالعات چند فریمی پیشرفته یا اندازه‌گیری‌های بالینی پشتیبانی نمی‌کند. از آن برای ایجاد یا تغییر تشخیص استفاده نکنید. اگر مطالعه ای با شکست مواجه شود، بیننده به جای نشان دادن یک تصویر خالی، ویژگی پشتیبانی نشده را گزارش می کند.","Are my medical images uploaded?":"آیا تصاویر پزشکی من آپلود شده است؟","No. The selected file bytes are read locally by your browser and a temporary local worker. This tool has no upload, remote PACS or DICOMweb connection.":"شماره. بایت های فایل انتخابی به صورت محلی توسط مرورگر شما و یک کارگر محلی موقت خوانده می شود. این ابزار هیچ اتصال آپلود، PACS راه دور یا DICOMweb ندارد.","Can I use this viewer to diagnose a condition?":"آیا می توانم از این نمایشگر برای تشخیص بیماری استفاده کنم؟","No. It is a limited technical viewer for supported files, not a medical device or diagnostic workstation. Use validated clinical software and ask a qualified clinician to interpret medical images.":"شماره. این یک نمایشگر فنی محدود برای فایل های پشتیبانی شده است، نه یک دستگاه پزشکی یا ایستگاه کاری تشخیصی. از نرم افزار بالینی معتبر استفاده کنید و از یک پزشک متخصص بخواهید که تصاویر پزشکی را تفسیر کند.","Choose DICOM file(s)":"انتخاب فایل(های) DICOM","Medical files can contain identifying information. This viewer does not upload them and hides common identity fields, but review your screen before sharing it.":"فایل‌های پزشکی می‌توانند حاوی اطلاعات شناسایی باشند. این بیننده آنها را آپلود نمی کند و فیلدهای هویت مشترک را پنهان می کند، اما قبل از اشتراک گذاری صفحه شما را بررسی می کند.","Select a single DICOM image or files from a single series. Supported: uncompressed, single-frame, 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome Part 10 files. A computer is recommended for larger studies.":"یک تصویر یا فایل DICOM را از یک سری انتخاب کنید. پشتیبانی شده: فایل‌های تک‌فریم غیرفشرده، تک فریم، 8-bit یا 16-bit تک رنگ قسمت 10. کامپیوتر برای مطالعات بزرگتر توصیه می شود.","Choose one image or a series to begin.":"برای شروع یک تصویر یا یک سری را انتخاب کنید.","Reading locally":"خواندن محلی","Image series ready.":"سری تصویر آماده.","Images ready. The files did not include a series identifier; check that you selected only one series.":"تصاویر آماده. فایل ها دارای شناسه سری نبودند. بررسی کنید که فقط یک سری را انتخاب کرده اید.","Reading cancelled. The temporary viewer data was cleared.":"خواندن لغو شد. داده‌های بیننده موقت پاک شد.","Clear files":"پاک کردن فایل ها","Cancel reading":"لغو خواندن","Previous slice":"قطعه قبلی","Next slice":"قسمت بعدی","Slice":"برش","Current slice":"برش فعلی","Window center":"مرکز پنجره","Window width":"عرض پنجره","Modality":"وجه","Image size":"اندازه تصویر","Pixel spacing":"فاصله پیکسل","Slice thickness":"ضخامت برش","Image position (patient coordinates)":"موقعیت تصویر (مختصات بیمار)","Image orientation":"جهت تصویر","Photometric interpretation":"تفسیر فتومتری","Pixel format":"فرمت پیکسل","Transfer syntax":"نحو انتقال","Not available":"موجود نیست","This is not a DICOM Part 10 file with a DICM header.":"این یک فایل DICOM Part 10 با هدر DICM نیست.","The DICOM file is truncated or malformed.":"فایل DICOM کوتاه یا نادرست است.","Unsupported transfer syntax. This viewer accepts only uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian and Explicit VR Little Endian.":"نحو انتقال پشتیبانی نشده. این بیننده فقط Implicit VR Little Endian و صریح VR Little Endian را می‌پذیرد.","This DICOM object has no pixel data to display.":"این شی DICOM هیچ داده پیکسلی برای نمایش ندارد.","Image dimensions exceed this viewer’s safe limit (2,048 per side and 4 megapixels per image).":"ابعاد تصویر از حد ایمن این بیننده بیشتر است (2,048 در هر طرف و 4 مگاپیکسل در هر تصویر).","Unsupported image type. Choose a single-sample MONOCHROME1 or MONOCHROME2 image.":"نوع تصویر پشتیبانی نشده. یک تصویر تک نمونه MONOCHROME1 یا MONOCHROME2 را انتخاب کنید.","Unsupported pixel encoding. Only 8-bit and 16-bit monochrome integer pixels are supported.":"کدگذاری پیکسل پشتیبانی نشده. فقط پیکسل های عدد صحیح تک رنگ 8 بیتی و 16 بیتی پشتیبانی می شوند.","This file contains multiple frames. Select a single-frame image or split the series with trusted DICOM software.":"این فایل حاوی چندین فریم است. یک تصویر تک فریم را انتخاب کنید یا مجموعه را با نرم افزار مورد اعتماد DICOM تقسیم کنید.","Invalid rescale values in this image.":"مقادیر مقیاس مجدد نامعتبر در این تصویر.","This image uses a modality lookup table that this viewer does not support.":"این تصویر از جدول جستجوی مدالیته استفاده می کند که این نمایشگر از آن پشتیبانی نمی کند.","A file is empty or exceeds the 16 MiB per-file limit.":"یک فایل خالی است یا از حد مجاز 16 MiB برای هر فایل بیشتر است.","This selection exceeds the safe series limit (100 files, 128 MiB input or 20 megapixels total). Select a smaller series.":"این انتخاب از محدودیت سری امن (فایل های 100، ورودی 128 MiB یا 20 مگاپیکسل کل) فراتر می رود. یک سری کوچکتر انتخاب کنید.","The selection contains more than one DICOM series. Choose files from one series only.":"انتخاب شامل بیش از یک سری DICOM است. فایل ها را فقط از یک سری انتخاب کنید.","The selected files have different image dimensions. Choose one consistent series.":"فایل های انتخاب شده دارای ابعاد تصویر متفاوتی هستند. یک سری ثابت را انتخاب کنید.","The selected files have different image orientations. Choose one consistent series.":"فایل‌های انتخاب‌شده جهت‌گیری تصویر متفاوتی دارند. یک سری ثابت را انتخاب کنید.","This file could not be read as a supported DICOM image.":"این فایل به عنوان یک تصویر DICOM پشتیبانی نمی‌شود.","Enter a finite window center and a window width of at least 1.":"مرکز پنجره محدود و عرض پنجره حداقل 1 را وارد کنید.","DICOM image preview":"پیش نمایش تصویر DICOM","Image metadata":"فراداده تصویر","Use the slice slider, or the previous and next buttons, to move through the series.":"از اسلایدر برش یا دکمه های قبلی و بعدی برای حرکت در سری استفاده کنید."},"fr":{"Private DICOM Image Viewer":"Visionneuse d'images DICOM privée","DICOM Viewer — Open Medical Images Privately in Your Browser":"DICOM Viewer — Ouvrez des images médicales en privé dans votre navigateur","Open and scroll through uncompressed monochrome DICOM image series locally. Adjust window and level; files are not uploaded. Compressed formats are identified clearly.":"Ouvrez et faites défiler localement les séries d'images DICOM monochromes non compressées. Ajustez la fenêtre et le niveau ; les fichiers ne sont pas téléchargés. Les formats compressés sont clairement identifiés.","Open a DICOM image or select one local series. Scroll through ordered slices, adjust window and level, and inspect technical image metadata. Files stay in this browser.":"Ouvrez une image DICOM ou sélectionnez une série locale. Faites défiler les tranches ordonnées, ajustez la fenêtre et le niveau et inspectez les métadonnées techniques des images. Les fichiers restent dans ce navigateur.","Supported images":"Images prises en charge","This viewer reads DICOM Part 10 files with uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian or Explicit VR Little Endian pixel data. It supports single-frame 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome images, including MONOCHROME1 inversion.":"Cette visionneuse lit les fichiers DICOM Part 10 avec des données de pixels Implicit VR Little Endian ou Explicit VR Little Endian non compressées. Il prend en charge les images monochromes 8-bit ou 16-bit à image unique, y compris l'inversion MONOCHROME1.","Privacy and safe use":"Confidentialité et utilisation sûre","Selected files are read on this device and decoded in a temporary Web Worker. The worker is terminated when processing finishes or you cancel. Patient name, ID, birth date and accession fields are not displayed. This page does not upload or save images and has no screenshot-sharing feature.":"Les fichiers sélectionnés sont lus sur cet appareil et décodés dans un Web Worker temporaire. Le travailleur prend fin lorsque le traitement est terminé ou que vous annulez. Les champs du nom du patient, de son identifiant, de sa date de naissance et de son accession ne sont pas affichés. Cette page ne télécharge ni n'enregistre d'images et ne dispose d'aucune fonction de partage de captures d'écran.","DICOM viewer questions":"Questions relatives à la visionneuse DICOM","Formats and limitations":"Formats et limitations","This is a basic file viewer, not a PACS, DICOMweb client, radiology workstation or diagnostic device. It does not support compressed transfer syntaxes, color images, multi-frame objects, presentation states, overlays, structured reports, enhanced multi-frame studies or clinical measurements. Do not use it to make or change a diagnosis. If a study fails, the viewer reports the unsupported feature instead of showing a blank image.":"Il s'agit d'un visualiseur de fichiers de base, et non d'un PACS, d'un client DICOMweb, d'une station de travail de radiologie ou d'un appareil de diagnostic. Il ne prend pas en charge les syntaxes de transfert compressées, les images couleur, les objets multi-images, les états de présentation, les superpositions, les rapports structurés, les études multi-images améliorées ou les mesures cliniques. Ne l'utilisez pas pour établir ou modifier un diagnostic. Si une étude échoue, le visualiseur signale la fonctionnalité non prise en charge au lieu d'afficher une image vierge.","Are my medical images uploaded?":"Mes images médicales sont-elles téléchargées ?","No. The selected file bytes are read locally by your browser and a temporary local worker. This tool has no upload, remote PACS or DICOMweb connection.":"Non. Les octets du fichier sélectionné sont lus localement par votre navigateur et un travailleur local temporaire. Cet outil n'a pas de connexion de téléchargement, de PACS à distance ou de DICOMweb.","Can I use this viewer to diagnose a condition?":"Puis-je utiliser cette visionneuse pour diagnostiquer une condition ?","No. It is a limited technical viewer for supported files, not a medical device or diagnostic workstation. Use validated clinical software and ask a qualified clinician to interpret medical images.":"Non. Il s'agit d'un visualiseur technique limité pour les fichiers pris en charge, et non d'un dispositif médical ou d'une station de travail de diagnostic. Utilisez un logiciel clinique validé et demandez à un clinicien qualifié d’interpréter les images médicales.","Choose DICOM file(s)":"Choisissez le(s) fichier(s) DICOM","Medical files can contain identifying information. This viewer does not upload them and hides common identity fields, but review your screen before sharing it.":"Les dossiers médicaux peuvent contenir des informations d’identification. Cette visionneuse ne les télécharge pas et masque les champs d'identité courants, mais examine votre écran avant de le partager.","Select a single DICOM image or files from a single series. Supported: uncompressed, single-frame, 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome Part 10 files. A computer is recommended for larger studies.":"Sélectionnez une seule image DICOM ou des fichiers d’une seule série. Pris en charge : non compressé, image unique,8-bit ou16-bit pièce monochrome10fichiers. Un ordinateur est recommandé pour les études plus importantes.","Choose one image or a series to begin.":"Choisissez une image ou une série pour commencer.","Reading locally":"Lire localement","Image series ready.":"Série d'images prête.","Images ready. The files did not include a series identifier; check that you selected only one series.":"Images prêtes. Les fichiers ne comportaient pas d'identifiant de série ; vérifiez que vous n'avez sélectionné qu'une seule série.","Reading cancelled. The temporary viewer data was cleared.":"Lecture annulée. Les données temporaires de la visionneuse ont été effacées.","Clear files":"Effacer les fichiers","Cancel reading":"Annuler la lecture","Previous slice":"Tranche précédente","Next slice":"Tranche suivante","Slice":"Tranche","Current slice":"Tranche actuelle","Window center":"Centre de la fenêtre","Window width":"Largeur de la fenêtre","Modality":"Modalité","Image size":"Taille de l'image","Pixel spacing":"Espacement des pixels","Slice thickness":"Épaisseur de tranche","Image position (patient coordinates)":"Position de l'image (coordonnées du patient)","Image orientation":"Orientation de l'image","Photometric interpretation":"Interprétation photométrique","Pixel format":"Format de pixels","Transfer syntax":"Syntaxe de transfert","Not available":"Non disponible","This is not a DICOM Part 10 file with a DICM header.":"Il ne s'agit pas d'un fichier DICOM Part 10 avec un en-tête DICM.","The DICOM file is truncated or malformed.":"Le fichier DICOM est tronqué ou mal formé.","Unsupported transfer syntax. This viewer accepts only uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian and Explicit VR Little Endian.":"Syntaxe de transfert non prise en charge. Cette visionneuse accepte uniquement les formats VR Little Endian implicite et VR Little Endian non compressés.","This DICOM object has no pixel data to display.":"Cet objet DICOM n'a aucune donnée de pixel à afficher.","Image dimensions exceed this viewer’s safe limit (2,048 per side and 4 megapixels per image).":"Les dimensions de l'image dépassent la limite de sécurité de cette visionneuse (2,048 par côté et 4 mégapixels par image).","Unsupported image type. Choose a single-sample MONOCHROME1 or MONOCHROME2 image.":"Type d'image non pris en charge. Choisissez une image MONOCHROME1 ou MONOCHROME2 à échantillon unique.","Unsupported pixel encoding. Only 8-bit and 16-bit monochrome integer pixels are supported.":"Encodage de pixels non pris en charge. Seuls les pixels entiers monochromes 8-bit et 16-bit sont pris en charge.","This file contains multiple frames. Select a single-frame image or split the series with trusted DICOM software.":"Ce fichier contient plusieurs images. Sélectionnez une image à image unique ou divisez la série avec le logiciel DICOM de confiance.","Invalid rescale values in this image.":"Valeurs de redimensionnement non valides dans cette image.","This image uses a modality lookup table that this viewer does not support.":"Cette image utilise une table de recherche de modalités que cette visionneuse ne prend pas en charge.","A file is empty or exceeds the 16 MiB per-file limit.":"Un fichier est vide ou dépasse la limite 16 MiB par fichier.","This selection exceeds the safe series limit (100 files, 128 MiB input or 20 megapixels total). Select a smaller series.":"Cette sélection dépasse la limite de série sécurisée (fichiers 100, entrée MiB 128 ou total de mégapixels 20). Sélectionnez une série plus petite.","The selection contains more than one DICOM series. Choose files from one series only.":"La sélection contient plusieurs séries DICOM. Choisissez des fichiers d’une seule série.","The selected files have different image dimensions. Choose one consistent series.":"Les fichiers sélectionnés ont des dimensions d'image différentes. Choisissez une série cohérente.","The selected files have different image orientations. Choose one consistent series.":"Les fichiers sélectionnés ont des orientations d'image différentes. Choisissez une série cohérente.","This file could not be read as a supported DICOM image.":"Ce fichier n'a pas pu être lu en tant qu'image DICOM prise en charge.","Enter a finite window center and a window width of at least 1.":"Entrez un centre de fenêtre fini et une largeur de fenêtre d'au moins 1.","DICOM image preview":"Aperçu de l'image DICOM","Image metadata":"Métadonnées d'image","Use the slice slider, or the previous and next buttons, to move through the series.":"Utilisez le curseur de tranche ou les boutons précédent et suivant pour vous déplacer dans la série."},"gu":{"Private DICOM Image Viewer":"ખાનગી DICOM છબી વ્યૂઅર","DICOM Viewer — Open Medical Images Privately in Your Browser":"DICOM વ્યૂઅર — તમારા બ્રાઉઝરમાં ખાનગી રીતે મેડિકલ ઈમેજો ખોલો","Open and scroll through uncompressed monochrome DICOM image series locally. Adjust window and level; files are not uploaded. Compressed formats are identified clearly.":"સ્થાનિક રીતે અનકમ્પ્રેસ્ડ મોનોક્રોમ DICOM ઈમેજ સીરીઝ ખોલો અને સ્ક્રોલ કરો. વિન્ડો અને સ્તરને સમાયોજિત કરો; ફાઇલો અપલોડ થતી નથી. સંકુચિત બંધારણો સ્પષ્ટ રીતે ઓળખાય છે.","Open a DICOM image or select one local series. Scroll through ordered slices, adjust window and level, and inspect technical image metadata. Files stay in this browser.":"DICOM છબી ખોલો અથવા એક સ્થાનિક શ્રેણી પસંદ કરો. ઓર્ડર કરેલ સ્લાઇસેસ દ્વારા સ્ક્રોલ કરો, વિંડો અને સ્તરને સમાયોજિત કરો અને તકનીકી છબી મેટાડેટાનું નિરીક્ષણ કરો. ફાઇલો આ બ્રાઉઝરમાં રહે છે.","Supported images":"સમર્થિત છબીઓ","This viewer reads DICOM Part 10 files with uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian or Explicit VR Little Endian pixel data. It supports single-frame 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome images, including MONOCHROME1 inversion.":"આ દર્શક DICOM ભાગ 10 ફાઇલોને અનકમ્પ્રેસ્ડ ઇમ્પ્લિસિટ VR લિટલ એન્ડિયન અથવા એક્સ્પ્લિસિટ VR લિટલ એન્ડિયન પિક્સેલ ડેટા સાથે વાંચે છે. તે સિંગલ-ફ્રેમ 8-bit અથવા 16-bit મોનોક્રોમ છબીઓને સપોર્ટ કરે છે, જેમાં MONOCHROME1 વ્યુત્ક્રમનો સમાવેશ થાય છે.","Privacy and safe use":"ગોપનીયતા અને સલામત ઉપયોગ","Selected files are read on this device and decoded in a temporary Web Worker. The worker is terminated when processing finishes or you cancel. Patient name, ID, birth date and accession fields are not displayed. This page does not upload or save images and has no screenshot-sharing feature.":"પસંદ કરેલી ફાઇલો આ ઉપકરણ પર વાંચવામાં આવે છે અને અસ્થાયી વેબ વર્કરમાં ડીકોડ કરવામાં આવે છે. જ્યારે પ્રક્રિયા પૂર્ણ થાય અથવા તમે રદ કરો ત્યારે કાર્યકરને સમાપ્ત કરવામાં આવે છે. દર્દીનું નામ, ID, જન્મ તારીખ અને પ્રવેશ ફીલ્ડ પ્રદર્શિત થતા નથી. આ પૃષ્ઠ છબીઓ અપલોડ અથવા સાચવતું નથી અને તેમાં કોઈ સ્ક્રીનશૉટ-શેરિંગ સુવિધા નથી.","DICOM viewer questions":"DICOM દર્શક પ્રશ્નો","Formats and limitations":"ફોર્મેટ્સ અને મર્યાદાઓ","This is a basic file viewer, not a PACS, DICOMweb client, radiology workstation or diagnostic device. It does not support compressed transfer syntaxes, color images, multi-frame objects, presentation states, overlays, structured reports, enhanced multi-frame studies or clinical measurements. Do not use it to make or change a diagnosis. If a study fails, the viewer reports the unsupported feature instead of showing a blank image.":"આ મૂળભૂત ફાઇલ વ્યુઅર છે, PACS, DICOMweb ક્લાયંટ, રેડિયોલોજી વર્કસ્ટેશન અથવા ડાયગ્નોસ્ટિક ઉપકરણ નથી. તે કોમ્પ્રેસ્ડ ટ્રાન્સફર સિન્ટેક્સ, કલર ઈમેજીસ, મલ્ટિ-ફ્રેમ ઑબ્જેક્ટ્સ, પ્રેઝન્ટેશન સ્ટેટ્સ, ઓવરલે, સ્ટ્રક્ચર્ડ રિપોર્ટ્સ, ઉન્નત મલ્ટિ-ફ્રેમ અભ્યાસ અથવા ક્લિનિકલ માપનને સપોર્ટ કરતું નથી. નિદાન કરવા અથવા બદલવા માટે તેનો ઉપયોગ કરશો નહીં. જો અભ્યાસ નિષ્ફળ જાય, તો દર્શક ખાલી છબી બતાવવાને બદલે અસમર્થિત સુવિધાની જાણ કરે છે.","Are my medical images uploaded?":"શું મારી તબીબી છબીઓ અપલોડ કરવામાં આવી છે?","No. The selected file bytes are read locally by your browser and a temporary local worker. This tool has no upload, remote PACS or DICOMweb connection.":"નં. પસંદ કરેલ ફાઇલ બાઇટ તમારા બ્રાઉઝર અને અસ્થાયી સ્થાનિક કાર્યકર દ્વારા સ્થાનિક રીતે વાંચવામાં આવે છે. આ સાધનમાં કોઈ અપલોડ, રિમોટ PACS અથવા DICOMweb કનેક્શન નથી.","Can I use this viewer to diagnose a condition?":"શું હું આ દર્શકનો ઉપયોગ સ્થિતિનું નિદાન કરવા માટે કરી શકું?","No. It is a limited technical viewer for supported files, not a medical device or diagnostic workstation. Use validated clinical software and ask a qualified clinician to interpret medical images.":"નં. તે સપોર્ટેડ ફાઇલો માટે મર્યાદિત તકનીકી દર્શક છે, તબીબી ઉપકરણ અથવા ડાયગ્નોસ્ટિક વર્કસ્ટેશન નથી. માન્ય ક્લિનિકલ સૉફ્ટવેરનો ઉપયોગ કરો અને તબીબી છબીઓનું અર્થઘટન કરવા માટે લાયક ચિકિત્સકને કહો.","Choose DICOM file(s)":"DICOM ફાઇલ(ઓ) પસંદ કરો","Medical files can contain identifying information. This viewer does not upload them and hides common identity fields, but review your screen before sharing it.":"તબીબી ફાઈલો ઓળખવા માટેની માહિતી સમાવી શકે છે. આ દર્શક તેમને અપલોડ કરતું નથી અને સામાન્ય ઓળખ ફીલ્ડ્સને છુપાવે છે, પરંતુ તેને શેર કરતા પહેલા તમારી સ્ક્રીનની સમીક્ષા કરો.","Select a single DICOM image or files from a single series. Supported: uncompressed, single-frame, 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome Part 10 files. A computer is recommended for larger studies.":"સિંગલ શ્રેણીમાંથી એક જ DICOM છબી અથવા ફાઇલો પસંદ કરો. સપોર્ટેડ: અનકમ્પ્રેસ્ડ, સિંગલ-ફ્રેમ, 8-bit અથવા 16-bit મોનોક્રોમ ભાગ 10 ફાઇલો. મોટા અભ્યાસ માટે કમ્પ્યુટરની ભલામણ કરવામાં આવે છે.","Choose one image or a series to begin.":"શરૂ કરવા માટે એક છબી અથવા શ્રેણી પસંદ કરો.","Reading locally":"સ્થાનિક રીતે વાંચવું","Image series ready.":"ઇમેજ શ્રેણી તૈયાર છે.","Images ready. The files did not include a series identifier; check that you selected only one series.":"છબીઓ તૈયાર. ફાઇલોમાં શ્રેણી ઓળખકર્તાનો સમાવેશ થતો નથી; તપાસો કે તમે માત્ર એક શ્રેણી પસંદ કરી છે.","Reading cancelled. The temporary viewer data was cleared.":"વાંચન રદ કર્યું. અસ્થાયી દર્શક ડેટા સાફ કરવામાં આવ્યો હતો.","Clear files":"ફાઈલો સાફ કરો","Cancel reading":"વાંચન રદ કરો","Previous slice":"પહેલાની સ્લાઇસ","Next slice":"આગલી સ્લાઇસ","Slice":"સ્લાઈસ","Current slice":"વર્તમાન સ્લાઇસ","Window center":"વિન્ડો સેન્ટર","Window width":"વિંડોની પહોળાઈ","Modality":"મોડેલિટી","Image size":"છબીનું કદ","Pixel spacing":"પિક્સેલ અંતર","Slice thickness":"સ્લાઈસની જાડાઈ","Image position (patient coordinates)":"ઇમેજ પોઝિશન (દર્દી કોઓર્ડિનેટ્સ)","Image orientation":"ઇમેજ ઓરિએન્ટેશન","Photometric interpretation":"ફોટોમેટ્રિક અર્થઘટન","Pixel format":"પિક્સેલ ફોર્મેટ","Transfer syntax":"ટ્રાન્સફર સિન્ટેક્સ","Not available":"ઉપલબ્ધ નથી","This is not a DICOM Part 10 file with a DICM header.":"આ DICM હેડર સાથેની DICOM ભાગ 10 ફાઇલ નથી.","The DICOM file is truncated or malformed.":"DICOM ફાઈલ કાપેલી અથવા દૂષિત છે.","Unsupported transfer syntax. This viewer accepts only uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian and Explicit VR Little Endian.":"અસમર્થિત ટ્રાન્સફર સિન્ટેક્સ. આ દર્શક માત્ર અનકમ્પ્રેસ્ડ ઇમ્પ્લિસિટ વીઆર લિટલ એન્ડિયન અને એક્સ્પ્લિસિટ વીઆર લિટલ એન્ડિયન સ્વીકારે છે.","This DICOM object has no pixel data to display.":"આ DICOM ઑબ્જેક્ટમાં પ્રદર્શિત કરવા માટે કોઈ પિક્સેલ ડેટા નથી.","Image dimensions exceed this viewer’s safe limit (2,048 per side and 4 megapixels per image).":"ઇમેજના પરિમાણો આ દર્શકની સલામત મર્યાદાને ઓળંગે છે (બાજુ દીઠ 2,048 અને છબી દીઠ 4 મેગાપિક્સેલ).","Unsupported image type. Choose a single-sample MONOCHROME1 or MONOCHROME2 image.":"અસમર્થિત છબી પ્રકાર. સિંગલ-સેમ્પલ MONOCHROME1 અથવા MONOCHROME2 છબી પસંદ કરો.","Unsupported pixel encoding. Only 8-bit and 16-bit monochrome integer pixels are supported.":"અસમર્થિત પિક્સેલ એન્કોડિંગ. માત્ર 8-bit અને 16-bit મોનોક્રોમ પૂર્ણાંક પિક્સેલ્સ સપોર્ટેડ છે.","This file contains multiple frames. Select a single-frame image or split the series with trusted DICOM software.":"આ ફાઇલમાં બહુવિધ ફ્રેમ્સ છે. સિંગલ-ફ્રેમ ઇમેજ પસંદ કરો અથવા વિશ્વસનીય DICOM સોફ્ટવેર વડે શ્રેણીને વિભાજિત કરો.","Invalid rescale values in this image.":"આ છબીમાં અમાન્ય પુનઃસ્કેલ મૂલ્યો.","This image uses a modality lookup table that this viewer does not support.":"આ ઇમેજ મોડેલિટી લુકઅપ ટેબલનો ઉપયોગ કરે છે જેને આ દર્શક સપોર્ટ કરતું નથી.","A file is empty or exceeds the 16 MiB per-file limit.":"એક ફાઇલ ખાલી છે અથવા 16 MiB પ્રતિ-ફાઇલ મર્યાદાને ઓળંગે છે.","This selection exceeds the safe series limit (100 files, 128 MiB input or 20 megapixels total). Select a smaller series.":"આ પસંદગી સલામત શ્રેણી મર્યાદાને ઓળંગે છે (100 ફાઇલો, 128 MiB ઇનપુટ અથવા 20 મેગાપિક્સલ કુલ). નાની શ્રેણી પસંદ કરો.","The selection contains more than one DICOM series. Choose files from one series only.":"પસંદગીમાં એક કરતાં વધુ DICOM શ્રેણીઓ છે. ફક્ત એક શ્રેણીમાંથી ફાઇલો પસંદ કરો.","The selected files have different image dimensions. Choose one consistent series.":"પસંદ કરેલી ફાઇલોમાં ઇમેજના વિવિધ પરિમાણો છે. એક સુસંગત શ્રેણી પસંદ કરો.","The selected files have different image orientations. Choose one consistent series.":"પસંદ કરેલ ફાઈલો અલગ અલગ ઈમેજ ઓરિએન્ટેશન ધરાવે છે. એક સુસંગત શ્રેણી પસંદ કરો.","This file could not be read as a supported DICOM image.":"આ ફાઇલને સપોર્ટેડ DICOM ઈમેજ તરીકે વાંચી શકાતી નથી.","Enter a finite window center and a window width of at least 1.":"મર્યાદિત વિન્ડો સેન્ટર અને ઓછામાં ઓછી 1 ની વિન્ડોની પહોળાઈ દાખલ કરો.","DICOM image preview":"DICOM છબી પૂર્વાવલોકન","Image metadata":"ઇમેજ મેટાડેટા","Use the slice slider, or the previous and next buttons, to move through the series.":"શ્રેણીમાં આગળ વધવા માટે સ્લાઈસ સ્લાઈડર અથવા પહેલાનાં અને આગળનાં બટનોનો ઉપયોગ કરો."},"ha":{"Private DICOM Image Viewer":"Mai Kallon Hoton DICOM mai zaman kansa","DICOM Viewer — Open Medical Images Privately in Your Browser":"Mai Kallon DICOM - Buɗe Hotunan Likita a Keɓance a cikin Mai binciken ku","Open and scroll through uncompressed monochrome DICOM image series locally. Adjust window and level; files are not uploaded. Compressed formats are identified clearly.":"Buɗe kuma gungura ta cikin jerin hoto na monochrome DICOM mara nauyi a cikin gida. Daidaita taga da matakin; ba a loda fayiloli. Abubuwan da aka matsa ana gano su a fili.","Open a DICOM image or select one local series. Scroll through ordered slices, adjust window and level, and inspect technical image metadata. Files stay in this browser.":"Bude hoton DICOM ko zaɓi jerin gida ɗaya. Gungura ta hanyar yankan da aka ba da oda, daidaita taga da matakin, kuma bincika metadata hoton fasaha. Fayiloli suna tsayawa a cikin wannan mai binciken.","Supported images":"Hotuna masu goyan baya","This viewer reads DICOM Part 10 files with uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian or Explicit VR Little Endian pixel data. It supports single-frame 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome images, including MONOCHROME1 inversion.":"Wannan mai kallo yana karanta fayilolin DICOM Sashe na 10 tare da VR Little Endian mara inganci ko Bayyanar VR Little Endian pixel bayanai. Yana goyan bayan firam guda 8-bit ko 16-bit monochrome hotuna, gami da juyar da MONOCHROME1.","Privacy and safe use":"Keɓantawa da amfani mai aminci","Selected files are read on this device and decoded in a temporary Web Worker. The worker is terminated when processing finishes or you cancel. Patient name, ID, birth date and accession fields are not displayed. This page does not upload or save images and has no screenshot-sharing feature.":"Ana karanta fayilolin da aka zaɓa akan wannan na'urar kuma ana yanke su a cikin Ma'aikacin Yanar Gizo na ɗan lokaci. Ana ƙare ma'aikaci lokacin da aka gama aiki ko ka soke. Ba a nuna sunan mara lafiya, ID, ranar haihuwa da filayen shiga ba. Wannan shafin baya lodawa ko adana hotuna kuma bashi da fasalin raba hotuna.","DICOM viewer questions":"Tambayoyin masu kallo DICOM","Formats and limitations":"Formats da iyaka","This is a basic file viewer, not a PACS, DICOMweb client, radiology workstation or diagnostic device. It does not support compressed transfer syntaxes, color images, multi-frame objects, presentation states, overlays, structured reports, enhanced multi-frame studies or clinical measurements. Do not use it to make or change a diagnosis. If a study fails, the viewer reports the unsupported feature instead of showing a blank image.":"Wannan babban mai duba fayil ne, ba PACS ba, abokin ciniki na yanar gizo na DICOM, wurin aikin rediyo ko na'urar ganowa. Ba ya goyan bayan damtse hanyoyin daidaitawa, hotunan launi, abubuwa masu yawa, jahohin gabatarwa, overlays, rahotannin da aka tsara, ingantattun karatun firam ko ma'auni na asibiti. Kar a yi amfani da shi don yin ko canza ganewar asali. Idan binciken ya gaza, mai kallo yana ba da rahoton fasalin mara tallafi maimakon nuna hoto mara kyau.","Are my medical images uploaded?":"Ana loda hotunana na likitanci?","No. The selected file bytes are read locally by your browser and a temporary local worker. This tool has no upload, remote PACS or DICOMweb connection.":"A'a. Ana karanta bytes ɗin fayil ɗin da aka zaɓa a gida ta burauzar ku da ma'aikacin gida na wucin gadi. Wannan kayan aikin ba shi da lodawa, haɗin PACS na nesa ko DICOMweb.","Can I use this viewer to diagnose a condition?":"Zan iya amfani da wannan mai duba don gano wani yanayi?","No. It is a limited technical viewer for supported files, not a medical device or diagnostic workstation. Use validated clinical software and ask a qualified clinician to interpret medical images.":"A'a. Iyakantaccen mai duba fasaha ne don fayilolin da aka goyan baya, ba na'urar likita ba ko wurin aikin bincike ba. Yi amfani da ingantattun software na asibiti kuma tambayi ƙwararren likita don fassara hotunan likita.","Choose DICOM file(s)":"Zaɓi fayil(s) DICOM","Medical files can contain identifying information. This viewer does not upload them and hides common identity fields, but review your screen before sharing it.":"Faylolin magani na iya ƙunsar gano bayanan. Wannan mai kallo baya loda su kuma yana ɓoye filayen ainihi na gama gari, amma duba allonku kafin raba shi.","Select a single DICOM image or files from a single series. Supported: uncompressed, single-frame, 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome Part 10 files. A computer is recommended for larger studies.":"Zaɓi hoto DICOM guda ɗaya ko fayiloli daga jeri ɗaya. Goyan bayan: uncompressed, guda-frame, 8-bit ko 16-bit monochrome Sashe na 10 fayiloli. Ana ba da shawarar kwamfuta don manyan karatu.","Choose one image or a series to begin.":"Zaɓi hoto ɗaya ko jerin don farawa.","Reading locally":"Karatu a gida","Image series ready.":"An shirya jerin hotuna.","Images ready. The files did not include a series identifier; check that you selected only one series.":"An shirya hotuna. Fayilolin ba su haɗa da mai gano jerin abubuwa ba; duba cewa ka zaɓi jerin guda ɗaya kawai.","Reading cancelled. The temporary viewer data was cleared.":"An soke karatu. An share bayanan mai kallo na wucin gadi.","Clear files":"Shafe fayiloli","Cancel reading":"Soke karatu","Previous slice":"yanki na baya","Next slice":"yanki na gaba","Slice":"Yanki","Current slice":"yanki na yanzu","Window center":"Cibiyar taga","Window width":"Faɗin taga","Modality":"Modaly","Image size":"Girman hoto","Pixel spacing":"Tazarar pixel","Slice thickness":"Kaurin yanki","Image position (patient coordinates)":"Matsayin Hoto (Masu daidaita majinyaci)","Image orientation":"Tsarin hoto","Photometric interpretation":"Fassarar Hoto","Pixel format":"Tsarin pixel","Transfer syntax":"Canja wurin syntax","Not available":"Babu","This is not a DICOM Part 10 file with a DICM header.":"Wannan ba fayil ɗin Sashe na DICOM ba ne na 10 mai taken DICM.","The DICOM file is truncated or malformed.":"Fayil ɗin DICOM an soke shi ko maras kyau.","Unsupported transfer syntax. This viewer accepts only uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian and Explicit VR Little Endian.":"Wannan mai kallo yana karɓar VR Karamin Endian mara ƙarfi kawai da Bayyanar VR ƙaramin Endian.","This DICOM object has no pixel data to display.":"Wannan abu na DICOM bashi da bayanan pixel don nunawa.","Image dimensions exceed this viewer’s safe limit (2,048 per side and 4 megapixels per image).":"Girman hoto sun wuce iyakar amintaccen mai kallo (2,048 a kowane gefe da 4 megapixels a kowane hoto).","Unsupported image type. Choose a single-sample MONOCHROME1 or MONOCHROME2 image.":"Nau'in hoto mara tallafi. Zaɓi samfurin guda ɗaya MONOCHROME1 ko MONOCHROME2 hoto.","Unsupported pixel encoding. Only 8-bit and 16-bit monochrome integer pixels are supported.":"Rubutun pixel mara tallafi. 8-bit da 16-bit monochrome integer pixels ne kawai ake tallafawa.","This file contains multiple frames. Select a single-frame image or split the series with trusted DICOM software.":"Wannan fayil ya ƙunshi firam masu yawa. Zaɓi hoto guda ɗaya ko raba jerin tare da amintaccen software na DICOM.","Invalid rescale values in this image.":"Madaidaitan ƙididdiga marasa inganci a cikin wannan hoton.","This image uses a modality lookup table that this viewer does not support.":"Wannan hoton yana amfani da tebirin neman tsari wanda wannan mai kallo baya tallafawa.","A file is empty or exceeds the 16 MiB per-file limit.":"Fayil babu komai ko ya wuce iyakar 16 MiB kowane fayil.","This selection exceeds the safe series limit (100 files, 128 MiB input or 20 megapixels total). Select a smaller series.":"Wannan zaɓin ya zarce iyakar amintaccen jeri (fayilolin 100, shigarwar 128 MiB ko 20 megapixels gabaɗaya). Zaɓi ƙaramin jerin.","The selection contains more than one DICOM series. Choose files from one series only.":"Zabin ya ƙunshi jerin DICOM fiye da ɗaya. Zaɓi fayiloli daga jerin guda ɗaya kawai.","The selected files have different image dimensions. Choose one consistent series.":"Faylolin da aka zaɓa suna da girman hoto daban-daban. Zaɓi jerin daidaitattun guda ɗaya.","The selected files have different image orientations. Choose one consistent series.":"Faylolin da aka zaɓa suna da mabambantan daidaitawar hoto. Zaɓi jerin daidaitattun guda ɗaya.","This file could not be read as a supported DICOM image.":"Ba za a iya karanta wannan fayil ɗin azaman hoton DICOM mai goyan bayan ba.","Enter a finite window center and a window width of at least 1.":"Shigar da iyakataccen cibiyar taga da faɗin taga aƙalla 1.","DICOM image preview":"duban hoto na DICOM","Image metadata":"metadata hoto","Use the slice slider, or the previous and next buttons, to move through the series.":"Yi amfani da madaidaicin maɓalli, ko maɓallan baya da na gaba, don matsawa cikin jerin."},"hi":{"Private DICOM Image Viewer":"निजी DICOM छवि दर्शक","DICOM Viewer — Open Medical Images Privately in Your Browser":"DICOM व्यूअर - अपने ब्राउज़र में मेडिकल छवियों को निजी तौर पर खोलें","Open and scroll through uncompressed monochrome DICOM image series locally. Adjust window and level; files are not uploaded. Compressed formats are identified clearly.":"स्थानीय रूप से असम्पीडित मोनोक्रोम DICOM छवि श्रृंखला को खोलें और स्क्रॉल करें। खिड़की और स्तर समायोजित करें; फ़ाइलें अपलोड नहीं की गई हैं. संपीड़ित प्रारूप स्पष्ट रूप से पहचाने जाते हैं।","Open a DICOM image or select one local series. Scroll through ordered slices, adjust window and level, and inspect technical image metadata. Files stay in this browser.":"एक DICOM छवि खोलें या एक स्थानीय श्रृंखला चुनें। ऑर्डर किए गए स्लाइस के माध्यम से स्क्रॉल करें, विंडो और स्तर समायोजित करें, और तकनीकी छवि मेटाडेटा का निरीक्षण करें। फ़ाइलें इस ब्राउज़र में रहती हैं.","Supported images":"समर्थित छवियाँ","This viewer reads DICOM Part 10 files with uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian or Explicit VR Little Endian pixel data. It supports single-frame 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome images, including MONOCHROME1 inversion.":"यह व्यूअर DICOM पार्ट 10 फ़ाइलों को असम्पीडित इंप्लिसिट वीआर लिटिल एंडियन या एक्सप्लिसिट वीआर लिटिल एंडियन पिक्सेल डेटा के साथ पढ़ता है। यह MONOCHROME1 व्युत्क्रम सहित सिंगल-फ्रेम 8-बिट या 16-बिट मोनोक्रोम छवियों का समर्थन करता है।","Privacy and safe use":"गोपनीयता और सुरक्षित उपयोग","Selected files are read on this device and decoded in a temporary Web Worker. The worker is terminated when processing finishes or you cancel. Patient name, ID, birth date and accession fields are not displayed. This page does not upload or save images and has no screenshot-sharing feature.":"चयनित फ़ाइलें इस डिवाइस पर पढ़ी जाती हैं और एक अस्थायी वेब वर्कर में डीकोड की जाती हैं। प्रसंस्करण समाप्त होने पर कर्मचारी को समाप्त कर दिया जाता है या आप रद्द कर देते हैं। रोगी का नाम, आईडी, जन्मतिथि और परिग्रहण फ़ील्ड प्रदर्शित नहीं होते हैं। यह पृष्ठ छवियों को अपलोड या सहेजता नहीं है और इसमें कोई स्क्रीनशॉट-साझाकरण सुविधा नहीं है।","DICOM viewer questions":"DICOM दर्शक प्रश्न","Formats and limitations":"प्रारूप और सीमाएँ","This is a basic file viewer, not a PACS, DICOMweb client, radiology workstation or diagnostic device. It does not support compressed transfer syntaxes, color images, multi-frame objects, presentation states, overlays, structured reports, enhanced multi-frame studies or clinical measurements. Do not use it to make or change a diagnosis. If a study fails, the viewer reports the unsupported feature instead of showing a blank image.":"यह एक बुनियादी फ़ाइल व्यूअर है, न कि PACS, DICOMweb क्लाइंट, रेडियोलॉजी वर्कस्टेशन या डायग्नोस्टिक डिवाइस। यह संपीड़ित स्थानांतरण सिंटैक्स, रंगीन छवियां, मल्टी-फ़्रेम ऑब्जेक्ट, प्रस्तुति स्थिति, ओवरले, संरचित रिपोर्ट, उन्नत मल्टी-फ़्रेम अध्ययन या नैदानिक ​​​​माप का समर्थन नहीं करता है। निदान बनाने या बदलने के लिए इसका उपयोग न करें। यदि कोई अध्ययन विफल हो जाता है, तो दर्शक रिक्त छवि दिखाने के बजाय असमर्थित सुविधा की रिपोर्ट करता है।","Are my medical images uploaded?":"क्या मेरी मेडिकल छवियां अपलोड की गई हैं?","No. The selected file bytes are read locally by your browser and a temporary local worker. This tool has no upload, remote PACS or DICOMweb connection.":"नहीं। चयनित फ़ाइल बाइट्स आपके ब्राउज़र और एक अस्थायी स्थानीय कार्यकर्ता द्वारा स्थानीय रूप से पढ़ी जाती हैं। इस टूल में कोई अपलोड, रिमोट PACS या DICOMवेब कनेक्शन नहीं है।","Can I use this viewer to diagnose a condition?":"क्या मैं किसी स्थिति का निदान करने के लिए इस व्यूअर का उपयोग कर सकता हूँ?","No. It is a limited technical viewer for supported files, not a medical device or diagnostic workstation. Use validated clinical software and ask a qualified clinician to interpret medical images.":"नहीं। यह समर्थित फ़ाइलों के लिए एक सीमित तकनीकी दर्शक है, न कि कोई चिकित्सा उपकरण या डायग्नोस्टिक वर्कस्टेशन। मान्य नैदानिक ​​सॉफ़्टवेयर का उपयोग करें और किसी योग्य चिकित्सक से चिकित्सा छवियों की व्याख्या करने के लिए कहें।","Choose DICOM file(s)":"DICOM फ़ाइल चुनें","Medical files can contain identifying information. This viewer does not upload them and hides common identity fields, but review your screen before sharing it.":"मेडिकल फाइलों में पहचान संबंधी जानकारी हो सकती है। यह व्यूअर उन्हें अपलोड नहीं करता है और सामान्य पहचान फ़ील्ड छुपाता है, लेकिन इसे साझा करने से पहले अपनी स्क्रीन की समीक्षा करें।","Select a single DICOM image or files from a single series. Supported: uncompressed, single-frame, 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome Part 10 files. A computer is recommended for larger studies.":"एकल श्रृंखला से एकल DICOM छवि या फ़ाइलों का चयन करें। समर्थित: असम्पीडित, एकल-फ़्रेम, 8-बिट या 16-बिट मोनोक्रोम भाग 10 फ़ाइलें। बड़े अध्ययन के लिए कंप्यूटर की अनुशंसा की जाती है।","Choose one image or a series to begin.":"शुरू करने के लिए एक छवि या श्रृंखला चुनें।","Reading locally":"स्थानीय रूप से पढ़ना","Image series ready.":"छवि श्रृंखला तैयार।","Images ready. The files did not include a series identifier; check that you selected only one series.":"छवियां तैयार। फ़ाइलों में श्रृंखला पहचानकर्ता शामिल नहीं था; जांचें कि आपने केवल एक श्रृंखला चुनी है।","Reading cancelled. The temporary viewer data was cleared.":"पढ़ना रद्द किया गया। अस्थायी दर्शक डेटा साफ़ कर दिया गया था.","Clear files":"फ़ाइलें साफ़ करें","Cancel reading":"पढ़ना रद्द करें","Previous slice":"पिछला टुकड़ा","Next slice":"अगला टुकड़ा","Slice":"स्लाइस","Current slice":"वर्तमान स्लाइस","Window center":"विंडो केंद्र","Window width":"विंडो की चौड़ाई","Modality":"मोडैलिटी","Image size":"छवि का आकार","Pixel spacing":"पिक्सेल रिक्ति","Slice thickness":"स्लाइस मोटाई","Image position (patient coordinates)":"छवि स्थिति (रोगी निर्देशांक)","Image orientation":"छवि अभिविन्यास","Photometric interpretation":"फोटोमीट्रिक व्याख्या","Pixel format":"पिक्सेल प्रारूप","Transfer syntax":"ट्रांसफर सिंटैक्स","Not available":"उपलब्ध नहीं है","This is not a DICOM Part 10 file with a DICM header.":"यह DICM हेडर वाली DICOM पार्ट 10 फ़ाइल नहीं है।","The DICOM file is truncated or malformed.":"DICOM फ़ाइल काट दी गई है या विकृत है।","Unsupported transfer syntax. This viewer accepts only uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian and Explicit VR Little Endian.":"असमर्थित स्थानांतरण सिंटैक्स। यह दर्शक केवल असम्पीडित इम्प्लिसिट वीआर लिटिल एंडियन और एक्सप्लिसिट वीआर लिटिल एंडियन को स्वीकार करता है।","This DICOM object has no pixel data to display.":"इस DICOM ऑब्जेक्ट में प्रदर्शित करने के लिए कोई पिक्सेल डेटा नहीं है।","Image dimensions exceed this viewer’s safe limit (2,048 per side and 4 megapixels per image).":"छवि आयाम इस दर्शक की सुरक्षित सीमा (प्रति पक्ष 2,048 और प्रति छवि 4 मेगापिक्सेल) से अधिक है।","Unsupported image type. Choose a single-sample MONOCHROME1 or MONOCHROME2 image.":"असमर्थित छवि प्रकार। एकल-नमूना MONOCHROME1 या MONOCHROME2 छवि चुनें।","Unsupported pixel encoding. Only 8-bit and 16-bit monochrome integer pixels are supported.":"असमर्थित पिक्सेल एन्कोडिंग। केवल 8-बिट और 16-बिट मोनोक्रोम पूर्णांक पिक्सेल समर्थित हैं।","This file contains multiple frames. Select a single-frame image or split the series with trusted DICOM software.":"इस फ़ाइल में एकाधिक फ़्रेम हैं। एकल-फ़्रेम छवि का चयन करें या विश्वसनीय DICOM सॉफ़्टवेयर के साथ श्रृंखला को विभाजित करें।","Invalid rescale values in this image.":"इस छवि में अमान्य रीस्केल मान।","This image uses a modality lookup table that this viewer does not support.":"यह छवि एक मॉडेलिटी लुकअप तालिका का उपयोग करती है जिसका यह व्यूअर समर्थन नहीं करता है।","A file is empty or exceeds the 16 MiB per-file limit.":"एक फ़ाइल खाली है या 16 MiB प्रति-फ़ाइल सीमा से अधिक है।","This selection exceeds the safe series limit (100 files, 128 MiB input or 20 megapixels total). Select a smaller series.":"यह चयन सुरक्षित श्रृंखला सीमा (100 फ़ाइलें, 128 MiB इनपुट या कुल 20 मेगापिक्सेल) से अधिक है। एक छोटी श्रृंखला चुनें.","The selection contains more than one DICOM series. Choose files from one series only.":"चयन में एक से अधिक DICOM श्रृंखलाएँ शामिल हैं। केवल एक श्रृंखला से फ़ाइलें चुनें।","The selected files have different image dimensions. Choose one consistent series.":"चयनित फ़ाइलों में अलग-अलग छवि आयाम हैं। एक सुसंगत श्रृंखला चुनें.","The selected files have different image orientations. Choose one consistent series.":"चयनित फ़ाइलों में अलग-अलग छवि अभिविन्यास हैं। एक सुसंगत श्रृंखला चुनें.","This file could not be read as a supported DICOM image.":"इस फ़ाइल को समर्थित DICOM छवि के रूप में नहीं पढ़ा जा सका।","Enter a finite window center and a window width of at least 1.":"एक सीमित विंडो केंद्र और कम से कम 1 की विंडो चौड़ाई दर्ज करें।","DICOM image preview":"DICOM छवि पूर्वावलोकन","Image metadata":"छवि मेटाडेटा","Use the slice slider, or the previous and next buttons, to move through the series.":"श्रृंखला में आगे बढ़ने के लिए स्लाइस स्लाइडर, या पिछले और अगले बटन का उपयोग करें।"},"id":{"Private DICOM Image Viewer":"Penampil Gambar DICOM Pribadi","DICOM Viewer — Open Medical Images Privately in Your Browser":"DICOM Viewer — Buka Gambar Medis Secara Pribadi di Browser Anda","Open and scroll through uncompressed monochrome DICOM image series locally. Adjust window and level; files are not uploaded. Compressed formats are identified clearly.":"Buka dan gulir rangkaian gambar DICOM monokrom yang tidak terkompresi secara lokal. Sesuaikan jendela dan level; file tidak diunggah. Format terkompresi diidentifikasi dengan jelas.","Open a DICOM image or select one local series. Scroll through ordered slices, adjust window and level, and inspect technical image metadata. Files stay in this browser.":"Buka gambar DICOM atau pilih satu seri lokal. Gulir ke seluruh irisan yang dipesan, sesuaikan jendela dan level, dan periksa metadata gambar teknis. File tetap berada di browser ini.","Supported images":"Gambar yang didukung","This viewer reads DICOM Part 10 files with uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian or Explicit VR Little Endian pixel data. It supports single-frame 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome images, including MONOCHROME1 inversion.":"Penampil ini membaca file DICOM Bagian 10 dengan data piksel Implisit VR Little Endian atau VR Eksplisit Little Endian yang tidak terkompresi. Mendukung gambar monokrom 8-bit atau 16-bit bingkai tunggal, termasuk inversi MONOCHROME1.","Privacy and safe use":"Privasi dan penggunaan yang aman","Selected files are read on this device and decoded in a temporary Web Worker. The worker is terminated when processing finishes or you cancel. Patient name, ID, birth date and accession fields are not displayed. This page does not upload or save images and has no screenshot-sharing feature.":"File yang dipilih dibaca di perangkat ini dan didekodekan di Web Worker sementara. Pekerja diberhentikan ketika pemrosesan selesai atau Anda membatalkan. Bidang nama pasien, ID, tanggal lahir dan aksesi tidak ditampilkan. Halaman ini tidak mengunggah atau menyimpan gambar dan tidak memiliki fitur berbagi tangkapan layar.","DICOM viewer questions":"DICOM","Formats and limitations":"Format dan batasan","This is a basic file viewer, not a PACS, DICOMweb client, radiology workstation or diagnostic device. It does not support compressed transfer syntaxes, color images, multi-frame objects, presentation states, overlays, structured reports, enhanced multi-frame studies or clinical measurements. Do not use it to make or change a diagnosis. If a study fails, the viewer reports the unsupported feature instead of showing a blank image.":"Ini adalah penampil file dasar, bukan PACS, klien DICOMweb, stasiun kerja radiologi, atau perangkat diagnostik. Itu tidak mendukung sintaks transfer terkompresi, gambar berwarna, objek multi-bingkai, status presentasi, overlay, laporan terstruktur, studi multi-bingkai yang disempurnakan, atau pengukuran klinis. Jangan menggunakannya untuk membuat atau mengubah diagnosis. Jika studi gagal, pemirsa melaporkan fitur yang tidak didukung alih-alih menampilkan gambar kosong.","Are my medical images uploaded?":"Apakah gambar medis saya diunggah?","No. The selected file bytes are read locally by your browser and a temporary local worker. This tool has no upload, remote PACS or DICOMweb connection.":"Tidak. Byte file yang dipilih dibaca secara lokal oleh browser Anda dan pekerja lokal sementara. Alat ini tidak memiliki koneksi unggahan, PACS jarak jauh, atau DICOMweb.","Can I use this viewer to diagnose a condition?":"Dapatkah saya menggunakan penampil ini untuk mendiagnosis suatu kondisi?","No. It is a limited technical viewer for supported files, not a medical device or diagnostic workstation. Use validated clinical software and ask a qualified clinician to interpret medical images.":"Tidak. Ini adalah penampil teknis terbatas untuk file yang didukung, bukan perangkat medis atau stasiun kerja diagnostik. Gunakan perangkat lunak klinis yang tervalidasi dan mintalah dokter yang berkualifikasi untuk menafsirkan gambar medis.","Choose DICOM file(s)":"Pilih file DICOM","Medical files can contain identifying information. This viewer does not upload them and hides common identity fields, but review your screen before sharing it.":"File medis dapat berisi informasi identitas. Penampil ini tidak mengunggahnya dan menyembunyikan kolom identitas umum, namun meninjau layar Anda sebelum membagikannya.","Select a single DICOM image or files from a single series. Supported: uncompressed, single-frame, 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome Part 10 files. A computer is recommended for larger studies.":"Pilih satu gambar atau file DICOM dari satu seri. Didukung: file monokrom Bagian 10 yang tidak terkompresi, bingkai tunggal, 8-bit atau 16-bit. Komputer direkomendasikan untuk studi yang lebih besar.","Choose one image or a series to begin.":"Pilih satu gambar atau rangkaian untuk memulai.","Reading locally":"Membaca secara lokal","Image series ready.":"Seri gambar sudah siap.","Images ready. The files did not include a series identifier; check that you selected only one series.":"Gambar sudah siap. File tersebut tidak menyertakan pengidentifikasi seri; periksa apakah Anda hanya memilih satu seri.","Reading cancelled. The temporary viewer data was cleared.":"Pembacaan dibatalkan. Data pemirsa sementara telah dihapus.","Clear files":"Hapus file","Cancel reading":"Batalkan membaca","Previous slice":"Irisan sebelumnya","Next slice":"Potongan berikutnya","Slice":"Irisan","Current slice":"Irisan saat ini","Window center":"Pusat jendela","Window width":"Lebar jendela","Modality":"Modalitas","Image size":"Ukuran gambar","Pixel spacing":"Spasi piksel","Slice thickness":"Ketebalan irisan","Image position (patient coordinates)":"Posisi gambar (koordinat pasien)","Image orientation":"Orientasi gambar","Photometric interpretation":"Interpretasi fotometrik","Pixel format":"Format piksel","Transfer syntax":"Transfer sintaksis","Not available":"Tidak tersedia","This is not a DICOM Part 10 file with a DICM header.":"Ini bukan file DICOM Part 10 dengan header DICM.","The DICOM file is truncated or malformed.":"File DICOM terpotong atau formatnya salah.","Unsupported transfer syntax. This viewer accepts only uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian and Explicit VR Little Endian.":"Sintaks transfer tidak didukung. Penampil ini hanya menerima Little Endian VR Implisit dan Little Endian VR Eksplisit yang tidak terkompresi.","This DICOM object has no pixel data to display.":"Objek DICOM ini tidak memiliki data piksel untuk ditampilkan.","Image dimensions exceed this viewer’s safe limit (2,048 per side and 4 megapixels per image).":"Dimensi gambar melebihi batas aman pemirsa ini (2,048 per sisi dan 4 megapiksel per gambar).","Unsupported image type. Choose a single-sample MONOCHROME1 or MONOCHROME2 image.":"Jenis gambar tidak didukung. Pilih gambar sampel tunggal MONOCHROME1 atau MONOCHROME2.","Unsupported pixel encoding. Only 8-bit and 16-bit monochrome integer pixels are supported.":"Pengkodean piksel tidak didukung. Hanya piksel bilangan bulat monokrom 8-bit dan 16-bit yang didukung.","This file contains multiple frames. Select a single-frame image or split the series with trusted DICOM software.":"File ini berisi banyak bingkai. Pilih gambar bingkai tunggal atau pisahkan rangkaiannya dengan perangkat lunak DICOM yang tepercaya.","Invalid rescale values in this image.":"Nilai skala ulang tidak valid pada gambar ini.","This image uses a modality lookup table that this viewer does not support.":"Gambar ini menggunakan tabel pencarian modalitas yang tidak didukung oleh penampil ini.","A file is empty or exceeds the 16 MiB per-file limit.":"File kosong atau melebihi batas 16 MiB per file.","This selection exceeds the safe series limit (100 files, 128 MiB input or 20 megapixels total). Select a smaller series.":"Pilihan ini melebihi batas seri aman (file 100, input 128 MiB, atau total megapiksel 20). Pilih seri yang lebih kecil.","The selection contains more than one DICOM series. Choose files from one series only.":"Pilihan berisi lebih dari satu seri DICOM. Pilih file dari satu seri saja.","The selected files have different image dimensions. Choose one consistent series.":"File yang dipilih memiliki dimensi gambar yang berbeda. Pilih satu seri yang konsisten.","The selected files have different image orientations. Choose one consistent series.":"File yang dipilih memiliki orientasi gambar yang berbeda. Pilih satu seri yang konsisten.","This file could not be read as a supported DICOM image.":"File ini tidak dapat dibaca sebagai gambar DICOM yang didukung.","Enter a finite window center and a window width of at least 1.":"Masukkan pusat jendela terbatas dan lebar jendela minimal 1.\nPratinjau gambar","DICOM image preview":"DICOM","Image metadata":"Metadata gambar","Use the slice slider, or the previous and next buttons, to move through the series.":"Gunakan penggeser irisan, atau tombol sebelumnya dan berikutnya, untuk menelusuri rangkaian."},"it":{"Private DICOM Image Viewer":"Visualizzatore di immagini DICOM privato","DICOM Viewer — Open Medical Images Privately in Your Browser":"Visualizzatore DICOM: apri le immagini mediche in privato nel tuo browser","Open and scroll through uncompressed monochrome DICOM image series locally. Adjust window and level; files are not uploaded. Compressed formats are identified clearly.":"Apri e scorri localmente le serie di immagini DICOM monocromatiche non compresse. Regola la finestra e il livello; i file non vengono caricati. I formati compressi sono identificati chiaramente.","Open a DICOM image or select one local series. Scroll through ordered slices, adjust window and level, and inspect technical image metadata. Files stay in this browser.":"Apri un'immagine DICOM o seleziona una serie locale. Scorri le sezioni ordinate, regola la finestra e il livello e controlla i metadati tecnici dell'immagine. I file rimangono in questo browser.","Supported images":"Immagini supportate","This viewer reads DICOM Part 10 files with uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian or Explicit VR Little Endian pixel data. It supports single-frame 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome images, including MONOCHROME1 inversion.":"Questo visualizzatore legge file DICOM parte 10 con dati pixel VR Little Endian impliciti o VR Little Endian espliciti non compressi. Supporta immagini monocromatiche a fotogramma singolo 8-bit o 16-bit, inclusa l'inversione MONOCHROME1.","Privacy and safe use":"Privacy e utilizzo sicuro","Selected files are read on this device and decoded in a temporary Web Worker. The worker is terminated when processing finishes or you cancel. Patient name, ID, birth date and accession fields are not displayed. This page does not upload or save images and has no screenshot-sharing feature.":"I file selezionati vengono letti su questo dispositivo e decodificati in un Web Worker temporaneo. Il lavoratore viene terminato al termine dell'elaborazione o quando l'utente annulla. Il nome del paziente, l'ID, la data di nascita e i campi di adesione non vengono visualizzati. Questa pagina non carica né salva immagini e non dispone di funzionalità di condivisione degli screenshot.","DICOM viewer questions":"Domande sul visualizzatore DICOM","Formats and limitations":"Formati e limitazioni","This is a basic file viewer, not a PACS, DICOMweb client, radiology workstation or diagnostic device. It does not support compressed transfer syntaxes, color images, multi-frame objects, presentation states, overlays, structured reports, enhanced multi-frame studies or clinical measurements. Do not use it to make or change a diagnosis. If a study fails, the viewer reports the unsupported feature instead of showing a blank image.":"Questo è un visualizzatore di file di base, non un PACS, un client DICOMweb, una workstation radiologica o un dispositivo diagnostico. Non supporta sintassi di trasferimento compresse, immagini a colori, oggetti multi-frame, stati di presentazione, sovrapposizioni, report strutturati, studi multi-frame avanzati o misurazioni cliniche. Non utilizzarlo per formulare o modificare una diagnosi. Se uno studio fallisce, il visualizzatore segnala la funzionalità non supportata invece di mostrare un'immagine vuota.","Are my medical images uploaded?":"Le mie immagini mediche vengono caricate?","No. The selected file bytes are read locally by your browser and a temporary local worker. This tool has no upload, remote PACS or DICOMweb connection.":"N. I byte del file selezionato vengono letti localmente dal tuo browser e da un lavoratore locale temporaneo. Questo strumento non dispone di caricamento, PACS remoto o connessione DICOMweb.","Can I use this viewer to diagnose a condition?":"Posso utilizzare questo visualizzatore per diagnosticare una condizione?","No. It is a limited technical viewer for supported files, not a medical device or diagnostic workstation. Use validated clinical software and ask a qualified clinician to interpret medical images.":"N. Si tratta di un visualizzatore tecnico limitato per i file supportati, non di un dispositivo medico o di una workstation diagnostica. Utilizzare un software clinico convalidato e chiedere a un medico qualificato di interpretare le immagini mediche.","Choose DICOM file(s)":"Scegli file DICOM","Medical files can contain identifying information. This viewer does not upload them and hides common identity fields, but review your screen before sharing it.":"I fascicoli medici possono contenere informazioni identificative. Questo visualizzatore non li carica e nasconde i campi di identità comuni, ma controlla il tuo schermo prima di condividerlo.","Select a single DICOM image or files from a single series. Supported: uncompressed, single-frame, 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome Part 10 files. A computer is recommended for larger studies.":"Seleziona una singola immagine DICOM o file da una singola serie. Supportati: file parte 10 monocromatici non compressi, a fotogramma singolo, 8-bit o 16-bit monocromatici. Per studi più ampi è consigliato un computer.","Choose one image or a series to begin.":"Scegli un'immagine o una serie per iniziare.","Reading locally":"Lettura locale","Image series ready.":"Serie di immagini pronte.","Images ready. The files did not include a series identifier; check that you selected only one series.":"Immagini pronte. I file non includevano un identificatore di serie; controlla di aver selezionato solo una serie.","Reading cancelled. The temporary viewer data was cleared.":"Lettura annullata. I dati del visualizzatore temporaneo sono stati cancellati.","Clear files":"Cancella file","Cancel reading":"Annulla lettura","Previous slice":"Sezione precedente","Next slice":"Sezione successiva","Slice":"Fetta","Current slice":"Sezione corrente","Window center":"Centro finestra","Window width":"Larghezza finestra","Modality":"Modalità","Image size":"Dimensione immagine","Pixel spacing":"Spaziatura pixel","Slice thickness":"Spessore fetta","Image position (patient coordinates)":"Posizione immagine (coordinate paziente)","Image orientation":"Orientamento dell'immagine","Photometric interpretation":"Interpretazione fotometrica","Pixel format":"Formato pixel","Transfer syntax":"Trasferisci sintassi","Not available":"Non disponibile","This is not a DICOM Part 10 file with a DICM header.":"Questo non è un file DICOM Part 10 con un'intestazione DICM.","The DICOM file is truncated or malformed.":"Il file DICOM è troncato o non ha un formato valido.","Unsupported transfer syntax. This viewer accepts only uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian and Explicit VR Little Endian.":"Sintassi di trasferimento non supportata. Questo visualizzatore accetta solo Little Endian implicito VR e Little Endian esplicito non compresso.","This DICOM object has no pixel data to display.":"Questo oggetto DICOM non ha dati pixel da visualizzare.","Image dimensions exceed this viewer’s safe limit (2,048 per side and 4 megapixels per image).":"Le dimensioni dell'immagine superano il limite di sicurezza di questo visualizzatore (2,048 per lato e 4 megapixel per immagine).","Unsupported image type. Choose a single-sample MONOCHROME1 or MONOCHROME2 image.":"Tipo di immagine non supportato. Scegli un'immagine MONOCHROME1 o MONOCHROME2 a campione singolo.","Unsupported pixel encoding. Only 8-bit and 16-bit monochrome integer pixels are supported.":"Codifica pixel non supportata. Sono supportati solo i pixel interi monocromatici 8 bit e 16 bit.","This file contains multiple frames. Select a single-frame image or split the series with trusted DICOM software.":"Questo file contiene più fotogrammi. Seleziona un'immagine a fotogramma singolo o dividi la serie con il software DICOM affidabile.","Invalid rescale values in this image.":"Valori di ridimensionamento non validi in questa immagine.","This image uses a modality lookup table that this viewer does not support.":"Questa immagine utilizza una tabella di ricerca delle modalità che questo visualizzatore non supporta.","A file is empty or exceeds the 16 MiB per-file limit.":"Un file è vuoto o supera il limite 16 MiB per file.","This selection exceeds the safe series limit (100 files, 128 MiB input or 20 megapixels total). Select a smaller series.":"Questa selezione supera il limite della serie sicura (file 100, ingresso MiB 128 o megapixel 20 totali). Seleziona una serie più piccola.","The selection contains more than one DICOM series. Choose files from one series only.":"La selezione contiene più di una serie DICOM. Scegli i file da una sola serie.","The selected files have different image dimensions. Choose one consistent series.":"I file selezionati hanno dimensioni immagine diverse. Scegli una serie coerente.","The selected files have different image orientations. Choose one consistent series.":"I file selezionati hanno diversi orientamenti dell'immagine. Scegli una serie coerente.","This file could not be read as a supported DICOM image.":"Questo file non può essere letto come immagine DICOM supportata.","Enter a finite window center and a window width of at least 1.":"Immetti un centro finito della finestra e una larghezza della finestra di almeno 1.","DICOM image preview":"Anteprima immagine DICOM","Image metadata":"Metadati dell'immagine","Use the slice slider, or the previous and next buttons, to move through the series.":"Utilizzare il cursore della sezione o i pulsanti precedente e successivo per spostarsi attraverso la serie."},"ja":{"Private DICOM Image Viewer":"プライベート DICOM 画像ビューア","DICOM Viewer — Open Medical Images Privately in Your Browser":"DICOM ビューア — ブラウザで医療画像をプライベートに開く","Open and scroll through uncompressed monochrome DICOM image series locally. Adjust window and level; files are not uploaded. Compressed formats are identified clearly.":"非圧縮のモノクロ DICOM 画像シリーズを開いてローカルでスクロールします。ウィンドウとレベルを調整します。ファイルはアップロードされません。圧縮形式は明確に識別されます。","Open a DICOM image or select one local series. Scroll through ordered slices, adjust window and level, and inspect technical image metadata. Files stay in this browser.":"DICOM 画像を開くか、ローカル シリーズを 1 つ選択します。順序付けされたスライスをスクロールし、ウィンドウとレベルを調整し、技術的な画像メタデータを検査します。ファイルはこのブラウザ内に残ります。","Supported images":"サポートされているイメージ","This viewer reads DICOM Part 10 files with uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian or Explicit VR Little Endian pixel data. It supports single-frame 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome images, including MONOCHROME1 inversion.":"このビューアは、非圧縮の暗黙的 VR リトル エンディアンまたは明示的 VR リトル エンディアンのピクセル データを含む DICOM パート 10 ファイルを読み取ります。 MONOCHROME1 反転を含む、単一フレームの 8 ビットまたは 16 ビットのモノクロ画像をサポートします。","Privacy and safe use":"プライバシーと安全な使用","Selected files are read on this device and decoded in a temporary Web Worker. The worker is terminated when processing finishes or you cancel. Patient name, ID, birth date and accession fields are not displayed. This page does not upload or save images and has no screenshot-sharing feature.":"選択されたファイルはこのデバイスで読み取られ、一時的な Web ワーカーでデコードされます。処理が終了するかキャンセルすると、ワーカーは終了します。患者名、ID、生年月日、登録欄は表示されません。このページでは画像のアップロードや保存は行われず、スクリーンショットの共有機能もありません。","DICOM viewer questions":"DICOM ビューアの質問","Formats and limitations":"形式と制限事項","This is a basic file viewer, not a PACS, DICOMweb client, radiology workstation or diagnostic device. It does not support compressed transfer syntaxes, color images, multi-frame objects, presentation states, overlays, structured reports, enhanced multi-frame studies or clinical measurements. Do not use it to make or change a diagnosis. If a study fails, the viewer reports the unsupported feature instead of showing a blank image.":"これは基本的なファイル ビューアであり、PACS、DICOMweb クライアント、放射線科ワークステーション、または診断デバイスではありません。圧縮転送構文、カラー画像、マルチフレーム オブジェクト、プレゼンテーション状態、オーバーレイ、構造化レポート、拡張マルチフレーム 研究、臨床測定はサポートされていません。診断を作成または変更するために使用しないでください。調査が失敗した場合、ビューアは空白の画像を表示する代わりに、サポートされていない機能を報告します。","Are my medical images uploaded?":"私の医療画像はアップロードされていますか?","No. The selected file bytes are read locally by your browser and a temporary local worker. This tool has no upload, remote PACS or DICOMweb connection.":"いいえ。選択したファイルのバイトは、ブラウザと一時的なローカル ワーカーによってローカルに読み取られます。このツールにはアップロード、リモート PACS、または DICOMweb 接続がありません。","Can I use this viewer to diagnose a condition?":"このビューアを使用して状態を診断できますか?","No. It is a limited technical viewer for supported files, not a medical device or diagnostic workstation. Use validated clinical software and ask a qualified clinician to interpret medical images.":"いいえ。これは、サポートされているファイル用の限定された技術ビューアであり、医療機器や診断ワークステーションではありません。検証済みの臨床ソフトウェアを使用し、資格のある臨床医に医療画像の読影を依頼してください。","Choose DICOM file(s)":"DICOM ファイルを選択してください","Medical files can contain identifying information. This viewer does not upload them and hides common identity fields, but review your screen before sharing it.":"医療ファイルには識別情報が含まれる場合があります。このビューアはそれらをアップロードせず、共通の ID フィールドを非表示にしますが、共有する前に画面を確認してください。","Select a single DICOM image or files from a single series. Supported: uncompressed, single-frame, 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome Part 10 files. A computer is recommended for larger studies.":"単一シリーズから単一の DICOM 画像またはファイルを選択します。サポートされている: 非圧縮、シングルフレーム、8-bit または 16-bit モノクロ パーツ 10 ファイル。大規模な研究にはコンピュータをお勧めします。","Choose one image or a series to begin.":"開始するには 1 つの画像またはシリーズを選択してください。","Reading locally":"ローカルで読み取り中","Image series ready.":"画像シリーズの準備ができました。","Images ready. The files did not include a series identifier; check that you selected only one series.":"画像の準備ができました。ファイルにはシリーズ識別子が含まれていませんでした。シリーズが 1 つだけ選択されていることを確認してください。","Reading cancelled. The temporary viewer data was cleared.":"読み取りがキャンセルされました。一時的な視聴者データが消去されました。","Clear files":"クリアファイル","Cancel reading":"読み取りをキャンセル","Previous slice":"前のスライス","Next slice":"次のスライス","Slice":"スライス","Current slice":"現在のスライス","Window center":"ウィンドウの中心","Window width":"ウィンドウ幅","Modality":"モダリティ","Image size":"画像サイズ","Pixel spacing":"ピクセル間隔","Slice thickness":"スライスの厚さ","Image position (patient coordinates)":"画像位置 (患者座標)","Image orientation":"画像の向き","Photometric interpretation":"測光解釈","Pixel format":"ピクセル形式","Transfer syntax":"転送構文","Not available":"利用不可","This is not a DICOM Part 10 file with a DICM header.":"これは、DICM ヘッダーを持つ DICOM パート 10 ファイルではありません。","The DICOM file is truncated or malformed.":"DICOM ファイルが切り詰められているか、形式が正しくありません。","Unsupported transfer syntax. This viewer accepts only uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian and Explicit VR Little Endian.":"サポートされていない転送構文です。このビューアは、非圧縮の Implicit VR リトル エンディアンと Explicit VR リトル エンディアンのみを受け入れます。","This DICOM object has no pixel data to display.":"この DICOM オブジェクトには表示するピクセル データがありません。","Image dimensions exceed this viewer’s safe limit (2,048 per side and 4 megapixels per image).":"画像のサイズがこのビューアの安全制限 (片面あたり 2,048、画像あたり 4 メガピクセル) を超えています。","Unsupported image type. Choose a single-sample MONOCHROME1 or MONOCHROME2 image.":"サポートされていない画像タイプです。単一サンプルの MONOCHROME1 または MONOCHROME2 画像を選択します。","Unsupported pixel encoding. Only 8-bit and 16-bit monochrome integer pixels are supported.":"サポートされていないピクセル エンコーディングです。 8 ビットおよび 16 ビットのモノクロ整数ピクセルのみがサポートされます。","This file contains multiple frames. Select a single-frame image or split the series with trusted DICOM software.":"このファイルには複数のフレームが含まれています。単一フレーム画像を選択するか、信頼できる DICOM ソフトウェアを使用してシリーズを分割します。","Invalid rescale values in this image.":"このイメージの再スケール値が無効です。","This image uses a modality lookup table that this viewer does not support.":"この画像は、このビューアがサポートしていないモダリティ ルックアップ テーブルを使用しています。","A file is empty or exceeds the 16 MiB per-file limit.":"ファイルが空であるか、ファイルあたりの制限 16 MiB を超えています。","This selection exceeds the safe series limit (100 files, 128 MiB input or 20 megapixels total). Select a smaller series.":"この選択は安全なシリーズ制限 (100 ファイル、128 MiB 入力、または合計 20 メガピクセル) を超えています。より小さいシリーズを選択してください。","The selection contains more than one DICOM series. Choose files from one series only.":"選択には複数の DICOM シリーズが含まれています。 1 つのシリーズからのみファイルを選択してください。","The selected files have different image dimensions. Choose one consistent series.":"選択したファイルの画像サイズが異なります。一貫したシリーズを 1 つ選択してください。","The selected files have different image orientations. Choose one consistent series.":"選択したファイルの画像の向きが異なります。一貫したシリーズを 1 つ選択してください。","This file could not be read as a supported DICOM image.":"このファイルは、サポートされている DICOM イメージとして読み取れませんでした。","Enter a finite window center and a window width of at least 1.":"有限のウィンドウ中心と少なくとも 1 のウィンドウ幅を入力してください。","DICOM image preview":"DICOM 画像プレビュー","Image metadata":"画像メタデータ","Use the slice slider, or the previous and next buttons, to move through the series.":"シリーズ内を移動するには、スライス スライダー、または前へおよび次へのボタンを使用します。"},"ko":{"Private DICOM Image Viewer":"개인 DICOM 이미지 뷰어","DICOM Viewer — Open Medical Images Privately in Your Browser":"DICOM 뷰어 — 브라우저에서 비공개로 의료 이미지 열기","Open and scroll through uncompressed monochrome DICOM image series locally. Adjust window and level; files are not uploaded. Compressed formats are identified clearly.":"압축되지 않은 흑백 DICOM 이미지 시리즈를 로컬에서 열고 스크롤합니다. 창과 레벨을 조정합니다. 파일이 업로드되지 않습니다. 압축 형식이 명확하게 식별됩니다.","Open a DICOM image or select one local series. Scroll through ordered slices, adjust window and level, and inspect technical image metadata. Files stay in this browser.":"DICOM 이미지를 열거나 로컬 시리즈 하나를 선택하세요. 정렬된 조각을 스크롤하고, 창과 레벨을 조정하고, 기술 이미지 메타데이터를 검사합니다. 파일은 이 브라우저에 유지됩니다.","Supported images":"지원되는 이미지","This viewer reads DICOM Part 10 files with uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian or Explicit VR Little Endian pixel data. It supports single-frame 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome images, including MONOCHROME1 inversion.":"이 뷰어는 압축되지 않은 암시적 VR 리틀 엔디안 또는 명시적 VR 리틀 엔디안 픽셀 데이터가 포함된 DICOM 부품 10 파일을 읽습니다. MONOCHROME1 반전을 포함하여 단일 프레임 8 비트 또는 16 비트 흑백 이미지를 지원합니다.","Privacy and safe use":"개인정보 보호 및 안전한 사용","Selected files are read on this device and decoded in a temporary Web Worker. The worker is terminated when processing finishes or you cancel. Patient name, ID, birth date and accession fields are not displayed. This page does not upload or save images and has no screenshot-sharing feature.":"선택한 파일은 이 장치에서 읽고 임시 웹 작업자에서 디코딩됩니다. 처리가 완료되거나 취소하면 작업자가 종료됩니다. 환자 이름, ID, 생년월일, 가입 항목은 표시되지 않습니다. 이 페이지는 이미지를 업로드하거나 저장하지 않으며 스크린샷 공유 기능도 없습니다.","DICOM viewer questions":"DICOM 뷰어 질문","Formats and limitations":"형식 및 제한 사항","This is a basic file viewer, not a PACS, DICOMweb client, radiology workstation or diagnostic device. It does not support compressed transfer syntaxes, color images, multi-frame objects, presentation states, overlays, structured reports, enhanced multi-frame studies or clinical measurements. Do not use it to make or change a diagnosis. If a study fails, the viewer reports the unsupported feature instead of showing a blank image.":"이것은 PACS, DICOMweb 클라이언트, 방사선 워크스테이션 또는 진단 장치가 아닌 기본 파일 뷰어입니다. 압축된 전송 구문, 컬러 이미지, 다중 프레임 개체, 프리젠테이션 상태, 오버레이, 구조화된 보고서, 향상된 다중 프레임 연구 또는 임상 측정은 지원하지 않습니다. 진단을 내리거나 변경하는 데 사용하지 마십시오. 연구가 실패하면 뷰어는 빈 이미지를 표시하는 대신 지원되지 않는 기능을 보고합니다.","Are my medical images uploaded?":"내 의료 이미지가 업로드됩니까?","No. The selected file bytes are read locally by your browser and a temporary local worker. This tool has no upload, remote PACS or DICOMweb connection.":"아니요. 선택한 파일 바이트는 브라우저와 임시 로컬 작업자가 로컬로 읽습니다. 이 도구에는 업로드, 원격 PACS 또는 DICOMweb 연결이 없습니다.","Can I use this viewer to diagnose a condition?":"이 뷰어를 사용하여 상태를 진단할 수 있습니까?","No. It is a limited technical viewer for supported files, not a medical device or diagnostic workstation. Use validated clinical software and ask a qualified clinician to interpret medical images.":"아니요. 의료 기기나 진단 워크스테이션이 아닌 지원되는 파일에 대한 제한된 기술 뷰어입니다. 검증된 임상 소프트웨어를 사용하고 자격을 갖춘 임상의에게 의료 이미지 해석을 요청하세요.","Choose DICOM file(s)":"DICOM 파일 선택","Medical files can contain identifying information. This viewer does not upload them and hides common identity fields, but review your screen before sharing it.":"의료 파일에는 식별 정보가 포함될 수 있습니다. 이 뷰어는 해당 항목을 업로드하지 않고 일반 ID 필드를 숨깁니다. 하지만 공유하기 전에 화면을 검토하세요.","Select a single DICOM image or files from a single series. Supported: uncompressed, single-frame, 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome Part 10 files. A computer is recommended for larger studies.":"단일 시리즈에서 단일 DICOM 이미지 또는 파일을 선택하십시오. 지원됨: 비압축, 단일 프레임, 8비트 또는 16비트 흑백 부분 10 파일. 대규모 연구에는 컴퓨터를 권장합니다.","Choose one image or a series to begin.":"시작하려면 하나의 이미지 또는 시리즈를 선택하십시오.","Reading locally":"로컬로 읽는 중","Image series ready.":"이미지 시리즈가 준비되었습니다.","Images ready. The files did not include a series identifier; check that you selected only one series.":"이미지가 준비되었습니다. 파일에는 시리즈 식별자가 포함되지 않았습니다. 하나의 시리즈만 선택했는지 확인하세요.","Reading cancelled. The temporary viewer data was cleared.":"읽기가 취소되었습니다. 임시 시청자 데이터가 삭제되었습니다.","Clear files":"파일 지우기","Cancel reading":"읽기 취소","Previous slice":"이전 슬라이스","Next slice":"다음 슬라이스","Slice":"슬라이스","Current slice":"현재 슬라이스","Window center":"창 중앙","Window width":"창 너비","Modality":"양식","Image size":"이미지 크기","Pixel spacing":"픽셀 간격","Slice thickness":"슬라이스 두께","Image position (patient coordinates)":"이미지 위치(환자 좌표)","Image orientation":"이미지 방향","Photometric interpretation":"광도계 해석","Pixel format":"픽셀 형식","Transfer syntax":"전송 구문","Not available":"사용할 수 없음","This is not a DICOM Part 10 file with a DICM header.":"이것은 DICM 헤더가 있는 DICOM 부분 10 파일이 아닙니다.","The DICOM file is truncated or malformed.":"DICOM 파일이 잘렸거나 형식이 잘못되었습니다.","Unsupported transfer syntax. This viewer accepts only uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian and Explicit VR Little Endian.":"지원되지 않는 전송 구문입니다. 이 뷰어는 압축되지 않은 Implicit VR Little Endian과 Explicit VR Little Endian만 허용합니다.","This DICOM object has no pixel data to display.":"이 DICOM 개체에는 표시할 픽셀 데이터가 없습니다.","Image dimensions exceed this viewer’s safe limit (2,048 per side and 4 megapixels per image).":"이미지 크기가 이 뷰어의 안전 한도(측면당 2,048 및 이미지당 4 메가픽셀)를 초과했습니다.","Unsupported image type. Choose a single-sample MONOCHROME1 or MONOCHROME2 image.":"지원되지 않는 이미지 유형입니다. 단일 샘플 MONOCHROME1 또는 MONOCHROME2 이미지를 선택합니다.","Unsupported pixel encoding. Only 8-bit and 16-bit monochrome integer pixels are supported.":"지원되지 않는 픽셀 인코딩입니다. 8-비트 및 16-비트 흑백 정수 픽셀만 지원됩니다.","This file contains multiple frames. Select a single-frame image or split the series with trusted DICOM software.":"이 파일에는 여러 프레임이 포함되어 있습니다. 단일 프레임 이미지를 선택하거나 신뢰할 수 있는 DICOM 소프트웨어로 시리즈를 분할하세요.","Invalid rescale values in this image.":"이 이미지의 크기 조정 값이 잘못되었습니다.","This image uses a modality lookup table that this viewer does not support.":"이 이미지는 이 뷰어가 지원하지 않는 양식 조회 테이블을 사용합니다.","A file is empty or exceeds the 16 MiB per-file limit.":"파일이 비어 있거나 16 MiB 파일당 제한을 초과합니다.","This selection exceeds the safe series limit (100 files, 128 MiB input or 20 megapixels total). Select a smaller series.":"이 선택은 안전 시리즈 제한(100 파일, 128 MiB 입력 또는 총 20 메가픽셀)을 초과합니다. 더 작은 시리즈를 선택하세요.","The selection contains more than one DICOM series. Choose files from one series only.":"선택 항목에 DICOM 시리즈가 두 개 이상 포함되어 있습니다. 한 시리즈에서만 파일을 선택하세요.","The selected files have different image dimensions. Choose one consistent series.":"선택한 파일의 이미지 크기가 다릅니다. 일관된 시리즈 하나를 선택하세요.","The selected files have different image orientations. Choose one consistent series.":"선택한 파일의 이미지 방향이 다릅니다. 일관된 시리즈 하나를 선택하세요.","This file could not be read as a supported DICOM image.":"이 파일은 지원되는 DICOM 이미지로 읽을 수 없습니다.","Enter a finite window center and a window width of at least 1.":"유한한 창 중심과 최소 1의 창 너비를 입력하세요.","DICOM image preview":"DICOM 이미지 미리보기","Image metadata":"이미지 메타데이터","Use the slice slider, or the previous and next buttons, to move through the series.":"시리즈 사이를 이동하려면 슬라이스 슬라이더나 이전 및 다음 버튼을 사용하십시오."},"mr":{"Private DICOM Image Viewer":"खाजगी DICOM प्रतिमा दर्शक","DICOM Viewer — Open Medical Images Privately in Your Browser":"DICOM दर्शक — तुमच्या ब्राउझरमध्ये खाजगीरित्या वैद्यकीय प्रतिमा उघडा","Open and scroll through uncompressed monochrome DICOM image series locally. Adjust window and level; files are not uploaded. Compressed formats are identified clearly.":"स्थानिकरित्या अनकम्प्रेस्ड मोनोक्रोम DICOM प्रतिमा मालिका उघडा आणि स्क्रोल करा. विंडो आणि पातळी समायोजित करा; फाइल्स अपलोड केल्या जात नाहीत. संकुचित स्वरूप स्पष्टपणे ओळखले जातात.","Open a DICOM image or select one local series. Scroll through ordered slices, adjust window and level, and inspect technical image metadata. Files stay in this browser.":"DICOM प्रतिमा उघडा किंवा एक स्थानिक मालिका निवडा. ऑर्डर केलेल्या स्लाइसमधून स्क्रोल करा, विंडो आणि स्तर समायोजित करा आणि तांत्रिक इमेज मेटाडेटा तपासा. फाइल्स या ब्राउझरमध्ये राहतात.","Supported images":"समर्थित प्रतिमा","This viewer reads DICOM Part 10 files with uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian or Explicit VR Little Endian pixel data. It supports single-frame 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome images, including MONOCHROME1 inversion.":"हा दर्शक DICOM भाग 10 फाइल्स असंपीडित इंप्लिसिट व्हीआर लिटल एंडियन किंवा एक्स्प्लिसिट व्हीआर लिटल एंडियन पिक्सेल डेटासह वाचतो. हे सिंगल-फ्रेम 8-bit किंवा 16-बिट मोनोक्रोम प्रतिमांना समर्थन देते, ज्यामध्ये MONOCHROME1 इनव्हर्शन समाविष्ट आहे.","Privacy and safe use":"गोपनीयता आणि सुरक्षित वापर","Selected files are read on this device and decoded in a temporary Web Worker. The worker is terminated when processing finishes or you cancel. Patient name, ID, birth date and accession fields are not displayed. This page does not upload or save images and has no screenshot-sharing feature.":"निवडलेल्या फाइल्स या डिव्हाइसवर वाचल्या जातात आणि तात्पुरत्या वेब वर्करमध्ये डीकोड केल्या जातात. जेव्हा प्रक्रिया पूर्ण होते किंवा तुम्ही रद्द करता तेव्हा कार्यकर्ता समाप्त केला जातो. रुग्णाचे नाव, आयडी, जन्मतारीख आणि प्रवेश फील्ड प्रदर्शित होत नाहीत. हे पृष्ठ प्रतिमा अपलोड किंवा जतन करत नाही आणि स्क्रीनशॉट सामायिकरण वैशिष्ट्य नाही.","DICOM viewer questions":"DICOM दर्शक प्रश्न","Formats and limitations":"स्वरूप आणि मर्यादा","This is a basic file viewer, not a PACS, DICOMweb client, radiology workstation or diagnostic device. It does not support compressed transfer syntaxes, color images, multi-frame objects, presentation states, overlays, structured reports, enhanced multi-frame studies or clinical measurements. Do not use it to make or change a diagnosis. If a study fails, the viewer reports the unsupported feature instead of showing a blank image.":"हा मूलभूत फाइल दर्शक आहे, PACS, DICOMweb क्लायंट, रेडिओलॉजी वर्कस्टेशन किंवा निदान उपकरण नाही. हे संकुचित हस्तांतरण वाक्यरचना, रंग प्रतिमा, मल्टी-फ्रेम ऑब्जेक्ट्स, सादरीकरण स्थिती, आच्छादन, संरचित अहवाल, वर्धित मल्टी-फ्रेम अभ्यास किंवा क्लिनिकल मापनांना समर्थन देत नाही. निदान करण्यासाठी किंवा बदलण्यासाठी याचा वापर करू नका. अभ्यास अयशस्वी झाल्यास, दर्शक रिक्त प्रतिमा दर्शविण्याऐवजी असमर्थित वैशिष्ट्याचा अहवाल देतो.","Are my medical images uploaded?":"माझ्या वैद्यकीय प्रतिमा अपलोड केल्या आहेत का?","No. The selected file bytes are read locally by your browser and a temporary local worker. This tool has no upload, remote PACS or DICOMweb connection.":"नं. निवडलेल्या फाइल बाइट्स तुमच्या ब्राउझरद्वारे आणि तात्पुरत्या स्थानिक कार्यकर्त्याद्वारे स्थानिकरित्या वाचल्या जातात. या टूलमध्ये कोणतेही अपलोड, रिमोट PACS किंवा DICOMweb कनेक्शन नाही.","Can I use this viewer to diagnose a condition?":"मी एखाद्या स्थितीचे निदान करण्यासाठी या दर्शकाचा वापर करू शकतो का?","No. It is a limited technical viewer for supported files, not a medical device or diagnostic workstation. Use validated clinical software and ask a qualified clinician to interpret medical images.":"नं. हे समर्थित फाइल्ससाठी मर्यादित तांत्रिक दर्शक आहे, वैद्यकीय उपकरण किंवा निदान वर्कस्टेशन नाही. प्रमाणित क्लिनिकल सॉफ्टवेअर वापरा आणि वैद्यकीय प्रतिमांचा अर्थ लावण्यासाठी पात्र डॉक्टरांना सांगा.","Choose DICOM file(s)":"DICOM फाईल निवडा","Medical files can contain identifying information. This viewer does not upload them and hides common identity fields, but review your screen before sharing it.":"वैद्यकीय फायलींमध्ये ओळखीची माहिती असू शकते. हा दर्शक त्यांना अपलोड करत नाही आणि सामान्य ओळख फील्ड लपवत नाही, परंतु ते शेअर करण्यापूर्वी तुमच्या स्क्रीनचे पुनरावलोकन करा.","Select a single DICOM image or files from a single series. Supported: uncompressed, single-frame, 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome Part 10 files. A computer is recommended for larger studies.":"एकाच मालिकेतून एकच DICOM प्रतिमा किंवा फाइल्स निवडा. सपोर्टेड: अनकम्प्रेस्ड, सिंगल-फ्रेम, 8-बिट किंवा 16-बिट मोनोक्रोम भाग 10 फाइल्स. मोठ्या अभ्यासासाठी संगणकाची शिफारस केली जाते.","Choose one image or a series to begin.":"सुरु करण्यासाठी एक प्रतिमा किंवा मालिका निवडा.","Reading locally":"स्थानिकरित्या वाचन","Image series ready.":"चित्र मालिका तयार आहे.","Images ready. The files did not include a series identifier; check that you selected only one series.":"प्रतिमा तयार. फाइल्समध्ये मालिका अभिज्ञापक समाविष्ट नव्हता; तुम्ही फक्त एक मालिका निवडली आहे हे तपासा.","Reading cancelled. The temporary viewer data was cleared.":"वाचन रद्द केले. तात्पुरता दर्शक डेटा साफ केला गेला.","Clear files":"फाईल्स साफ करा","Cancel reading":"वाचन रद्द करा","Previous slice":"मागील स्लाइस","Next slice":"पुढील स्लाइस","Slice":"स्लाइस","Current slice":"वर्तमान स्लाइस","Window center":"विंडो सेंटर","Window width":"विंडो रुंदी","Modality":"मोडॅलिटी","Image size":"प्रतिमा आकार","Pixel spacing":"पिक्सेल अंतर","Slice thickness":"स्लाइस जाडी","Image position (patient coordinates)":"प्रतिमा स्थिती (रुग्ण समन्वय)","Image orientation":"प्रतिमा अभिमुखता","Photometric interpretation":"फोटोमेट्रिक व्याख्या","Pixel format":"पिक्सेल स्वरूप","Transfer syntax":"ट्रान्सफर सिंटॅक्स","Not available":"उपलब्ध नाही","This is not a DICOM Part 10 file with a DICM header.":"ही DICOM भाग 10 फाईल DICM शीर्षलेखासह नाही.","The DICOM file is truncated or malformed.":"DICOM फाईल कापलेली किंवा विकृत आहे.","Unsupported transfer syntax. This viewer accepts only uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian and Explicit VR Little Endian.":"असमर्थित हस्तांतरण वाक्यरचना. हा दर्शक केवळ असंपीडित इंप्लिसिट व्हीआर लिटल एंडियन आणि एक्स्प्लिसिट व्हीआर लिटल एंडियन स्वीकारतो.","This DICOM object has no pixel data to display.":"या DICOM ऑब्जेक्टमध्ये प्रदर्शित करण्यासाठी कोणताही पिक्सेल डेटा नाही.","Image dimensions exceed this viewer’s safe limit (2,048 per side and 4 megapixels per image).":"प्रतिमेचे परिमाण या दर्शकाच्या सुरक्षित मर्यादेपेक्षा जास्त आहेत (2,048 प्रति बाजू आणि 4 मेगापिक्सेल प्रति प्रतिमा).","Unsupported image type. Choose a single-sample MONOCHROME1 or MONOCHROME2 image.":"असमर्थित प्रतिमा प्रकार. एकल-नमुना MONOCHROME1 किंवा MONOCHROME2 प्रतिमा निवडा.","Unsupported pixel encoding. Only 8-bit and 16-bit monochrome integer pixels are supported.":"असमर्थित पिक्सेल एन्कोडिंग. फक्त 8-bit आणि 16-बिट मोनोक्रोम पूर्णांक पिक्सेल समर्थित आहेत.","This file contains multiple frames. Select a single-frame image or split the series with trusted DICOM software.":"या फाइलमध्ये अनेक फ्रेम्स आहेत. एकल-फ्रेम प्रतिमा निवडा किंवा विश्वसनीय DICOM सॉफ्टवेअरसह मालिका विभाजित करा.","Invalid rescale values in this image.":"या प्रतिमेतील अवैध रीस्केल मूल्ये.","This image uses a modality lookup table that this viewer does not support.":"ही प्रतिमा मोडॅलिटी लुकअप टेबल वापरते ज्याला हा दर्शक समर्थन देत नाही.","A file is empty or exceeds the 16 MiB per-file limit.":"एक फाइल रिकामी आहे किंवा 16 MiB प्रति-फाइल मर्यादा ओलांडली आहे.","This selection exceeds the safe series limit (100 files, 128 MiB input or 20 megapixels total). Select a smaller series.":"ही निवड सुरक्षित मालिका मर्यादा ओलांडते (100 फाइल्स, 128 MiB इनपुट किंवा 20 मेगापिक्सेल एकूण). एक लहान मालिका निवडा.","The selection contains more than one DICOM series. Choose files from one series only.":"निवडीत एकापेक्षा जास्त DICOM मालिका आहेत. फक्त एका मालिकेतून फायली निवडा.","The selected files have different image dimensions. Choose one consistent series.":"निवडलेल्या फायलींमध्ये भिन्न प्रतिमा परिमाण आहेत. एक सुसंगत मालिका निवडा.","The selected files have different image orientations. Choose one consistent series.":"निवडलेल्या फाइल्समध्ये भिन्न प्रतिमा अभिमुखता आहेत. एक सुसंगत मालिका निवडा.","This file could not be read as a supported DICOM image.":"ही फाइल समर्थित DICOM प्रतिमा म्हणून वाचली जाऊ शकत नाही.","Enter a finite window center and a window width of at least 1.":"एक मर्यादित विंडो केंद्र आणि किमान 1 ची विंडो रुंदी प्रविष्ट करा.","DICOM image preview":"DICOM प्रतिमा पूर्वावलोकन","Image metadata":"इमेज मेटाडेटा","Use the slice slider, or the previous and next buttons, to move through the series.":"मालिकेतून पुढे जाण्यासाठी स्लाइस स्लाइडर किंवा मागील आणि पुढील बटणे वापरा."},"ms":{"Private DICOM Image Viewer":"Pemapar Imej DICOM Peribadi","DICOM Viewer — Open Medical Images Privately in Your Browser":"DICOM Viewer — Buka Imej Perubatan Secara Persendirian dalam Penyemak Imbas Anda","Open and scroll through uncompressed monochrome DICOM image series locally. Adjust window and level; files are not uploaded. Compressed formats are identified clearly.":"Buka dan tatal melalui siri imej DICOM monokrom yang tidak dimampatkan secara setempat. Laraskan tetingkap dan aras; fail tidak dimuat naik. Format mampat dikenal pasti dengan jelas.","Open a DICOM image or select one local series. Scroll through ordered slices, adjust window and level, and inspect technical image metadata. Files stay in this browser.":"Buka imej DICOM atau pilih satu siri tempatan. Tatal melalui kepingan yang dipesan, laraskan tetingkap dan aras, dan periksa metadata imej teknikal. Fail kekal dalam penyemak imbas ini.","Supported images":"Imej yang disokong","This viewer reads DICOM Part 10 files with uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian or Explicit VR Little Endian pixel data. It supports single-frame 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome images, including MONOCHROME1 inversion.":"Pemapar ini membaca fail DICOM Bahagian 10 dengan data piksel Implisit VR Little Endian atau Explicit VR Little Endian yang tidak dimampatkan. Ia menyokong imej monokrom 8-bit atau 16-bit bingkai tunggal, termasuk penyongsangan MONOCHROME1.","Privacy and safe use":"Privasi dan penggunaan selamat","Selected files are read on this device and decoded in a temporary Web Worker. The worker is terminated when processing finishes or you cancel. Patient name, ID, birth date and accession fields are not displayed. This page does not upload or save images and has no screenshot-sharing feature.":"Fail terpilih dibaca pada peranti ini dan dinyahkod dalam Pekerja Web sementara. Pekerja ditamatkan apabila pemprosesan selesai atau anda membatalkannya. Nama pesakit, ID, tarikh lahir dan medan penyertaan tidak dipaparkan. Halaman ini tidak memuat naik atau menyimpan imej dan tidak mempunyai ciri perkongsian tangkapan skrin.","DICOM viewer questions":"soalan penonton DICOM","Formats and limitations":"Format dan had","This is a basic file viewer, not a PACS, DICOMweb client, radiology workstation or diagnostic device. It does not support compressed transfer syntaxes, color images, multi-frame objects, presentation states, overlays, structured reports, enhanced multi-frame studies or clinical measurements. Do not use it to make or change a diagnosis. If a study fails, the viewer reports the unsupported feature instead of showing a blank image.":"Ini ialah pemapar fail asas, bukan PACS, pelanggan web DICOM, stesen kerja radiologi atau peranti diagnostik. Ia tidak menyokong sintaks pemindahan termampat, imej warna, objek berbilang bingkai, keadaan pembentangan, tindanan, laporan berstruktur, kajian berbilang bingkai yang dipertingkatkan atau pengukuran klinikal. Jangan gunakannya untuk membuat atau menukar diagnosis. Jika kajian gagal, penonton melaporkan ciri yang tidak disokong dan bukannya menunjukkan imej kosong.","Are my medical images uploaded?":"Adakah imej perubatan saya dimuat naik?","No. The selected file bytes are read locally by your browser and a temporary local worker. This tool has no upload, remote PACS or DICOMweb connection.":"No. Bait fail yang dipilih dibaca secara setempat oleh penyemak imbas anda dan pekerja tempatan sementara. Alat ini tidak mempunyai muat naik, sambungan PACS jauh atau DICOMweb.","Can I use this viewer to diagnose a condition?":"Bolehkah saya menggunakan pemapar ini untuk mendiagnosis keadaan?","No. It is a limited technical viewer for supported files, not a medical device or diagnostic workstation. Use validated clinical software and ask a qualified clinician to interpret medical images.":"No. Ia adalah pemapar teknikal terhad untuk fail yang disokong, bukan peranti perubatan atau stesen kerja diagnostik. Gunakan perisian klinikal yang disahkan dan minta doktor yang berkelayakan untuk mentafsir imej perubatan.","Choose DICOM file(s)":"Pilih fail DICOM","Medical files can contain identifying information. This viewer does not upload them and hides common identity fields, but review your screen before sharing it.":"Fail perubatan boleh mengandungi maklumat pengenalpastian. Penonton ini tidak memuat naiknya dan menyembunyikan medan identiti biasa, tetapi semak skrin anda sebelum berkongsinya.","Select a single DICOM image or files from a single series. Supported: uncompressed, single-frame, 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome Part 10 files. A computer is recommended for larger studies.":"Pilih satu imej atau fail DICOM daripada satu siri. Disokong: tidak dimampatkan, bingkai tunggal, fail 8-bit atau 16-bit monokrom Bahagian 10. Komputer disyorkan untuk kajian yang lebih besar.","Choose one image or a series to begin.":"Pilih satu imej atau satu siri untuk bermula.","Reading locally":"Membaca secara tempatan","Image series ready.":"Siri imej sedia.","Images ready. The files did not include a series identifier; check that you selected only one series.":"Imej sedia. Fail tidak termasuk pengecam siri; pastikan anda memilih satu siri sahaja.","Reading cancelled. The temporary viewer data was cleared.":"Pembacaan dibatalkan. Data pemapar sementara telah dikosongkan.","Clear files":"Kosongkan fail","Cancel reading":"Batalkan bacaan","Previous slice":"Kepingan sebelumnya","Next slice":"Kepingan seterusnya","Slice":"Hiris","Current slice":"Kepingan semasa","Window center":"Pusat tetingkap","Window width":"Lebar tetingkap","Modality":"Modaliti","Image size":"Saiz imej","Pixel spacing":"Jarak piksel","Slice thickness":"Ketebalan kepingan","Image position (patient coordinates)":"Kedudukan imej (koordinat pesakit)","Image orientation":"Orientasi imej","Photometric interpretation":"Tafsiran fotometrik","Pixel format":"Format piksel","Transfer syntax":"Pindahkan sintaks","Not available":"Tidak tersedia","This is not a DICOM Part 10 file with a DICM header.":"Ini bukan fail Bahagian DICOM 10 dengan pengepala DICM.","The DICOM file is truncated or malformed.":"Fail DICOM dipotong atau cacat.","Unsupported transfer syntax. This viewer accepts only uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian and Explicit VR Little Endian.":"Sintaks pemindahan tidak disokong. Penonton ini hanya menerima Implicit VR Little Endian dan Explicit VR Little Endian yang tidak dimampatkan.","This DICOM object has no pixel data to display.":"Objek DICOM ini tidak mempunyai data piksel untuk dipaparkan.","Image dimensions exceed this viewer’s safe limit (2,048 per side and 4 megapixels per image).":"Dimensi imej melebihi had selamat penonton ini (2,048 setiap sisi dan 4 megapiksel setiap imej).","Unsupported image type. Choose a single-sample MONOCHROME1 or MONOCHROME2 image.":"Jenis imej tidak disokong. Pilih imej MONOCHROME1 atau MONOCHROME2 sampel tunggal.","Unsupported pixel encoding. Only 8-bit and 16-bit monochrome integer pixels are supported.":"Pengekodan piksel tidak disokong. Hanya piksel integer monokrom 8-bit dan 16-bit sahaja disokong.","This file contains multiple frames. Select a single-frame image or split the series with trusted DICOM software.":"Fail ini mengandungi berbilang bingkai. Pilih imej bingkai tunggal atau belah siri dengan perisian DICOM yang dipercayai.","Invalid rescale values in this image.":"Nilai skala semula tidak sah dalam imej ini.","This image uses a modality lookup table that this viewer does not support.":"Imej ini menggunakan jadual carian modaliti yang tidak disokong oleh pemapar ini.","A file is empty or exceeds the 16 MiB per-file limit.":"Fail kosong atau melebihi had 16 MiB setiap fail.","This selection exceeds the safe series limit (100 files, 128 MiB input or 20 megapixels total). Select a smaller series.":"Pemilihan ini melebihi had siri selamat (fail 100, input 128 MiB atau jumlah megapiksel 20). Pilih siri yang lebih kecil.","The selection contains more than one DICOM series. Choose files from one series only.":"Pemilihan mengandungi lebih daripada satu siri DICOM. Pilih fail daripada satu siri sahaja.","The selected files have different image dimensions. Choose one consistent series.":"Fail yang dipilih mempunyai dimensi imej yang berbeza. Pilih satu siri yang konsisten.","The selected files have different image orientations. Choose one consistent series.":"Fail yang dipilih mempunyai orientasi imej yang berbeza. Pilih satu siri yang konsisten.","This file could not be read as a supported DICOM image.":"Fail ini tidak boleh dibaca sebagai imej DICOM yang disokong.","Enter a finite window center and a window width of at least 1.":"Masukkan pusat tetingkap terhingga dan lebar tetingkap sekurang-kurangnya 1.","DICOM image preview":"Pratonton imej DICOM","Image metadata":"Metadata imej","Use the slice slider, or the previous and next buttons, to move through the series.":"Gunakan peluncur hirisan, atau butang sebelumnya dan seterusnya, untuk bergerak melalui siri ini."},"nb":{"Private DICOM Image Viewer":"Privat DICOM bildeviser","DICOM Viewer — Open Medical Images Privately in Your Browser":"DICOM Viewer — Åpne medisinske bilder privat i nettleseren din","Open and scroll through uncompressed monochrome DICOM image series locally. Adjust window and level; files are not uploaded. Compressed formats are identified clearly.":"Åpne og bla gjennom ukomprimerte monokrome DICOM-bildeserier lokalt. Juster vindu og nivå; filer er ikke lastet opp. Komprimerte formater identifiseres tydelig.","Open a DICOM image or select one local series. Scroll through ordered slices, adjust window and level, and inspect technical image metadata. Files stay in this browser.":"Åpne et DICOM-bilde eller velg en lokal serie. Bla gjennom bestilte stykker, juster vindu og nivå, og inspiser tekniske bildemetadata. Filer blir værende i denne nettleseren.","Supported images":"Støttede bilder","This viewer reads DICOM Part 10 files with uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian or Explicit VR Little Endian pixel data. It supports single-frame 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome images, including MONOCHROME1 inversion.":"Denne fremviseren leser DICOM Part 10-filer med ukomprimerte implisitte VR Little Endian eller Explicit VR Little Endian pikseldata. Den støtter enkeltbilde 8-bit eller 16-bit monokrome bilder, inkludert MONOCHROME1 inversjon.","Privacy and safe use":"Personvern og sikker bruk","Selected files are read on this device and decoded in a temporary Web Worker. The worker is terminated when processing finishes or you cancel. Patient name, ID, birth date and accession fields are not displayed. This page does not upload or save images and has no screenshot-sharing feature.":"Valgte filer leses på denne enheten og dekodes i en midlertidig Web Worker. Arbeideren blir sagt opp når behandlingen er ferdig eller du avbryter. Pasientnavn, ID, fødselsdato og tiltredelsesfelt vises ikke. Denne siden laster ikke opp eller lagrer bilder og har ingen funksjon for deling av skjermbilder.","DICOM viewer questions":"DICOM-leserspørsmål","Formats and limitations":"Formater og begrensninger","This is a basic file viewer, not a PACS, DICOMweb client, radiology workstation or diagnostic device. It does not support compressed transfer syntaxes, color images, multi-frame objects, presentation states, overlays, structured reports, enhanced multi-frame studies or clinical measurements. Do not use it to make or change a diagnosis. If a study fails, the viewer reports the unsupported feature instead of showing a blank image.":"Dette er en grunnleggende filviser, ikke en PACS, DICOMweb-klient, radiologiarbeidsstasjon eller diagnostisk enhet. Den støtter ikke komprimerte overføringssyntakser, fargebilder, multi-frame-objekter, presentasjonstilstander, overlegg, strukturerte rapporter, forbedrede multi-frame-studier eller kliniske målinger. Ikke bruk den til å stille eller endre en diagnose. Hvis en undersøkelse mislykkes, rapporterer seeren om funksjonen som ikke støttes i stedet for å vise et tomt bilde.","Are my medical images uploaded?":"Er mine medisinske bilder lastet opp?","No. The selected file bytes are read locally by your browser and a temporary local worker. This tool has no upload, remote PACS or DICOMweb connection.":"Nr. De valgte filbytene leses lokalt av nettleseren din og en midlertidig lokal arbeider. Dette verktøyet har ingen opplasting, ekstern PACS- eller DICOMweb-tilkobling.","Can I use this viewer to diagnose a condition?":"Kan jeg bruke denne fremviseren til å diagnostisere en tilstand?","No. It is a limited technical viewer for supported files, not a medical device or diagnostic workstation. Use validated clinical software and ask a qualified clinician to interpret medical images.":"Nr. Det er en begrenset teknisk visning for støttede filer, ikke en medisinsk enhet eller diagnostisk arbeidsstasjon. Bruk validert klinisk programvare og be en kvalifisert kliniker om å tolke medisinske bilder.","Choose DICOM file(s)":"Velg DICOM-fil(er)","Medical files can contain identifying information. This viewer does not upload them and hides common identity fields, but review your screen before sharing it.":"Medisinske filer kan inneholde identifiserende informasjon. Denne seeren laster dem ikke opp og skjuler vanlige identitetsfelt, men se gjennom skjermen din før du deler den.","Select a single DICOM image or files from a single series. Supported: uncompressed, single-frame, 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome Part 10 files. A computer is recommended for larger studies.":"Velg et enkelt DICOM-bilde eller filer fra en enkelt serie. Støttet: ukomprimerte, enkeltbilde, 8-bit eller 16-bit monokrome Del 10-filer. En datamaskin anbefales for større studier.","Choose one image or a series to begin.":"Velg ett bilde eller en serie for å begynne.","Reading locally":"Leser lokalt","Image series ready.":"Bildeserie klar.","Images ready. The files did not include a series identifier; check that you selected only one series.":"Bildene er klare. Filene inneholdt ikke en serieidentifikator; sjekk at du kun har valgt én serie.","Reading cancelled. The temporary viewer data was cleared.":"Lesing avbrutt. De midlertidige seerdataene ble slettet.","Clear files":"Slett filer","Cancel reading":"Avbryt lesing","Previous slice":"Forrige skive","Next slice":"Neste skive","Slice":"Skive","Current slice":"Gjeldende skive","Window center":"Vindussenter","Window width":"Vindusbredde","Modality":"Modalitet","Image size":"Bildestørrelse","Pixel spacing":"Pikselavstand","Slice thickness":"Skivetykkelse","Image position (patient coordinates)":"Bildeposisjon (pasientkoordinater)","Image orientation":"Bildeorientering","Photometric interpretation":"Fotometrisk tolkning","Pixel format":"Pikselformat","Transfer syntax":"Overføringssyntaks","Not available":"Ikke tilgjengelig","This is not a DICOM Part 10 file with a DICM header.":"Dette er ikke en DICOM-del 10-fil med en DICM-overskrift.","The DICOM file is truncated or malformed.":"DICOM-filen er avkortet eller misformet.","Unsupported transfer syntax. This viewer accepts only uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian and Explicit VR Little Endian.":"Ustøttet overføringssyntaks. Denne seeren godtar kun ukomprimert Implicit VR Little Endian og Explicit VR Little Endian.","This DICOM object has no pixel data to display.":"Dette DICOM-objektet har ingen pikseldata å vise.","Image dimensions exceed this viewer’s safe limit (2,048 per side and 4 megapixels per image).":"Bildedimensjonene overskrider denne seerens sikre grense (2,048 per side og 4 megapiksler per bilde).","Unsupported image type. Choose a single-sample MONOCHROME1 or MONOCHROME2 image.":"Ustøttet bildetype. Velg et enkelteksempel MONOCHROME1- eller MONOCHROME2-bilde.","Unsupported pixel encoding. Only 8-bit and 16-bit monochrome integer pixels are supported.":"Pikselkoding støttes ikke. Bare 8-bit og 16-bit monokrome heltallspiksler støttes.","This file contains multiple frames. Select a single-frame image or split the series with trusted DICOM software.":"Denne filen inneholder flere rammer. Velg et enkeltbilde eller del serien med pålitelig DICOM-programvare.","Invalid rescale values in this image.":"Ugyldige omskaleringsverdier i dette bildet.","This image uses a modality lookup table that this viewer does not support.":"Dette bildet bruker en modalitetsoppslagstabell som denne fremviseren ikke støtter.","A file is empty or exceeds the 16 MiB per-file limit.":"En fil er tom eller overskrider grensen for 16 MiB per fil.","This selection exceeds the safe series limit (100 files, 128 MiB input or 20 megapixels total). Select a smaller series.":"Dette valget overskrider grensen for sikker serie (100-filer, 128 MiB-inngang eller 20 megapiksler totalt). Velg en mindre serie.","The selection contains more than one DICOM series. Choose files from one series only.":"Utvalget inneholder mer enn én DICOM-serie. Velg kun filer fra én serie.","The selected files have different image dimensions. Choose one consistent series.":"De valgte filene har forskjellige bildedimensjoner. Velg én konsekvent serie.","The selected files have different image orientations. Choose one consistent series.":"De valgte filene har forskjellige bilderetninger. Velg én konsekvent serie.","This file could not be read as a supported DICOM image.":"Denne filen kunne ikke leses som et støttet DICOM-bilde.","Enter a finite window center and a window width of at least 1.":"Skriv inn et begrenset vindussenter og en vindusbredde på minst 1.","DICOM image preview":"DICOM-bildeforhåndsvisning","Image metadata":"Bildemetadata","Use the slice slider, or the previous and next buttons, to move through the series.":"Bruk skive-glidebryteren eller forrige og neste-knappen for å gå gjennom serien."},"nl":{"Private DICOM Image Viewer":"Privé DICOM-beeldviewer","DICOM Viewer — Open Medical Images Privately in Your Browser":"DICOM Viewer — Open medische beelden privé in uw browser","Open and scroll through uncompressed monochrome DICOM image series locally. Adjust window and level; files are not uploaded. Compressed formats are identified clearly.":"Open en blader lokaal door ongecomprimeerde monochrome DICOM-beeldseries. Pas venster en niveau aan; bestanden worden niet geüpload. Gecomprimeerde formaten worden duidelijk geïdentificeerd.","Open a DICOM image or select one local series. Scroll through ordered slices, adjust window and level, and inspect technical image metadata. Files stay in this browser.":"Open een DICOM-image of selecteer een lokale serie. Blader door de geordende segmenten, pas het venster en het niveau aan en inspecteer de technische metagegevens van afbeeldingen. Bestanden blijven in deze browser.","Supported images":"Ondersteunde afbeeldingen","This viewer reads DICOM Part 10 files with uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian or Explicit VR Little Endian pixel data. It supports single-frame 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome images, including MONOCHROME1 inversion.":"Deze viewer leest DICOM Part 10-bestanden met ongecomprimeerde impliciete VR Little Endian- of expliciete VR Little Endian-pixelgegevens. Het ondersteunt single-frame 8-bit of 16-bit monochrome afbeeldingen, inclusief MONOCHROME1-inversie.","Privacy and safe use":"Privacy en veilig gebruik","Selected files are read on this device and decoded in a temporary Web Worker. The worker is terminated when processing finishes or you cancel. Patient name, ID, birth date and accession fields are not displayed. This page does not upload or save images and has no screenshot-sharing feature.":"Geselecteerde bestanden worden op dit apparaat gelezen en gedecodeerd in een tijdelijke Web Worker. De werknemer wordt beëindigd wanneer de verwerking is voltooid of u annuleert. Patiëntnaam, ID, geboortedatum en toetredingsvelden worden niet weergegeven. Deze pagina uploadt of bewaart geen afbeeldingen en heeft geen functie voor het delen van schermafbeeldingen.","DICOM viewer questions":"Vragen van DICOM-viewers","Formats and limitations":"Formaten en beperkingen","This is a basic file viewer, not a PACS, DICOMweb client, radiology workstation or diagnostic device. It does not support compressed transfer syntaxes, color images, multi-frame objects, presentation states, overlays, structured reports, enhanced multi-frame studies or clinical measurements. Do not use it to make or change a diagnosis. If a study fails, the viewer reports the unsupported feature instead of showing a blank image.":"Dit is een eenvoudige bestandsviewer, geen PACS, DICOMweb-client, radiologiewerkstation of diagnostisch apparaat. Het ondersteunt geen gecomprimeerde overdrachtsyntaxis, kleurenafbeeldingen, objecten met meerdere frames, presentatiestatussen, overlays, gestructureerde rapporten, verbeterde onderzoeken met meerdere frames of klinische metingen. Gebruik het niet om een ​​diagnose te stellen of te wijzigen. Als een onderzoek mislukt, rapporteert de kijker de niet-ondersteunde functie in plaats van een blanco afbeelding weer te geven.","Are my medical images uploaded?":"Worden mijn medische beelden geüpload?","No. The selected file bytes are read locally by your browser and a temporary local worker. This tool has no upload, remote PACS or DICOMweb connection.":"Nr. De geselecteerde bestandsbytes worden lokaal gelezen door uw browser en een tijdelijke lokale medewerker. Deze tool heeft geen upload-, externe PACS- of DICOMweb-verbinding.","Can I use this viewer to diagnose a condition?":"Kan ik deze viewer gebruiken om een ​​aandoening te diagnosticeren?","No. It is a limited technical viewer for supported files, not a medical device or diagnostic workstation. Use validated clinical software and ask a qualified clinician to interpret medical images.":"Nr. Het is een beperkte technische viewer voor ondersteunde bestanden, geen medisch apparaat of diagnostisch werkstation. Gebruik gevalideerde klinische software en vraag een gekwalificeerde arts om medische beelden te interpreteren.","Choose DICOM file(s)":"Kies DICOM-bestand(en)","Medical files can contain identifying information. This viewer does not upload them and hides common identity fields, but review your screen before sharing it.":"Medische dossiers kunnen identificerende informatie bevatten. Deze viewer uploadt ze niet en verbergt algemene identiteitsvelden, maar bekijkt uw scherm voordat u deze deelt.","Select a single DICOM image or files from a single series. Supported: uncompressed, single-frame, 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome Part 10 files. A computer is recommended for larger studies.":"Selecteer een enkele DICOM-afbeelding of bestanden uit een enkele serie. Ondersteund: ongecomprimeerde, single-frame, 8-bit of 16-bit monochrome onderdeel 10-bestanden. Voor grotere onderzoeken wordt een computer aanbevolen.","Choose one image or a series to begin.":"Kies één afbeelding of een serie om te beginnen.","Reading locally":"Lokaal lezen","Image series ready.":"Beeldserie klaar.","Images ready. The files did not include a series identifier; check that you selected only one series.":"Afbeeldingen gereed. De bestanden bevatten geen serie-ID; controleer of u slechts één serie heeft geselecteerd.","Reading cancelled. The temporary viewer data was cleared.":"Lezen geannuleerd. De tijdelijke kijkergegevens zijn gewist.","Clear files":"Bestanden wissen","Cancel reading":"Lezen annuleren","Previous slice":"Vorig segment","Next slice":"Volgende plak","Slice":"Snijd","Current slice":"Huidig segment","Window center":"Venster midden","Window width":"Vensterbreedte","Modality":"Modaliteit","Image size":"Beeldformaat","Pixel spacing":"Pixelafstand","Slice thickness":"Snijdikte","Image position (patient coordinates)":"Beeldpositie (patiëntcoördinaten)","Image orientation":"Beeldoriëntatie","Photometric interpretation":"Fotometrische interpretatie","Pixel format":"Pixelformaat","Transfer syntax":"Overdrachtssyntaxis","Not available":"Niet beschikbaar","This is not a DICOM Part 10 file with a DICM header.":"Dit is geen DICOM Part 10-bestand met een DICM-header.","The DICOM file is truncated or malformed.":"Het DICOM-bestand is afgekapt of verkeerd opgemaakt.","Unsupported transfer syntax. This viewer accepts only uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian and Explicit VR Little Endian.":"Niet-ondersteunde overdrachtsyntaxis. Deze viewer accepteert alleen ongecomprimeerde impliciete VR Little Endian en expliciete VR Little Endian.","This DICOM object has no pixel data to display.":"Dit DICOM-object heeft geen pixelgegevens om weer te geven.","Image dimensions exceed this viewer’s safe limit (2,048 per side and 4 megapixels per image).":"De afmetingen van de afbeelding overschrijden de veilige limiet van deze kijker (2,048 per zijde en 4 megapixels per afbeelding).","Unsupported image type. Choose a single-sample MONOCHROME1 or MONOCHROME2 image.":"Niet-ondersteund afbeeldingstype. Kies een MONOCHROME1- of MONOCHROME2-afbeelding met één voorbeeld.","Unsupported pixel encoding. Only 8-bit and 16-bit monochrome integer pixels are supported.":"Niet-ondersteunde pixelcodering. Alleen 8-bit en 16-bit monochrome gehele pixels worden ondersteund.","This file contains multiple frames. Select a single-frame image or split the series with trusted DICOM software.":"Dit bestand bevat meerdere frames. Selecteer een afbeelding met één frame of splits de serie met vertrouwde DICOM-software.","Invalid rescale values in this image.":"Ongeldige herschaalwaarden in deze afbeelding.","This image uses a modality lookup table that this viewer does not support.":"Deze afbeelding gebruikt een modaliteitsopzoektabel die deze viewer niet ondersteunt.","A file is empty or exceeds the 16 MiB per-file limit.":"Een bestand is leeg of overschrijdt de 16 MiB-limiet per bestand.","This selection exceeds the safe series limit (100 files, 128 MiB input or 20 megapixels total). Select a smaller series.":"Deze selectie overschrijdt de veilige serielimiet (100-bestanden, 128 MiB-invoer of 20 megapixels totaal). Kies een kleinere serie.","The selection contains more than one DICOM series. Choose files from one series only.":"De selectie bevat meer dan één DICOM-serie. Kies bestanden uit slechts één serie.","The selected files have different image dimensions. Choose one consistent series.":"De geselecteerde bestanden hebben verschillende afbeeldingsafmetingen. Kies één consistente serie.","The selected files have different image orientations. Choose one consistent series.":"De geselecteerde bestanden hebben verschillende beeldoriëntaties. Kies één consistente serie.","This file could not be read as a supported DICOM image.":"Dit bestand kan niet worden gelezen als een ondersteund DICOM-image.","Enter a finite window center and a window width of at least 1.":"Voer een eindig venstermidden en een vensterbreedte van minimaal 1 in.","DICOM image preview":"DICOM-beeldvoorbeeld","Image metadata":"Metagegevens van afbeeldingen","Use the slice slider, or the previous and next buttons, to move through the series.":"Gebruik de segmentschuifregelaar of de vorige en volgende knoppen om door de reeks te bladeren."},"pl":{"Private DICOM Image Viewer":"Prywatna przeglądarka obrazów DICOM\nPrzeglądarka","DICOM Viewer — Open Medical Images Privately in Your Browser":"DICOM — otwieraj prywatnie obrazy medyczne w swojej przeglądarce","Open and scroll through uncompressed monochrome DICOM image series locally. Adjust window and level; files are not uploaded. Compressed formats are identified clearly.":"Otwieraj i przewijaj lokalnie nieskompresowane serie monochromatycznych obrazów DICOM. Dostosuj okno i poziom; pliki nie są przesyłane. Skompresowane formaty są wyraźnie oznaczone.","Open a DICOM image or select one local series. Scroll through ordered slices, adjust window and level, and inspect technical image metadata. Files stay in this browser.":"Otwórz obraz DICOM lub wybierz jedną serię lokalną. Przewiń uporządkowane wycinki, dostosuj okno i poziom oraz sprawdź techniczne metadane obrazu. Pliki pozostają w tej przeglądarce.","Supported images":"Obsługiwane obrazy","This viewer reads DICOM Part 10 files with uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian or Explicit VR Little Endian pixel data. It supports single-frame 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome images, including MONOCHROME1 inversion.":"Ta przeglądarka odczytuje pliki DICOM Part 10 z nieskompresowanymi danymi pikselowymi Implicit VR Little Endian lub Explicit VR Little Endian. Obsługuje jednoklatkowe obrazy monochromatyczne 8-bit lub 16-bit, w tym inwersję MONOCHROME1.","Privacy and safe use":"Prywatność i bezpieczeństwo użytkowania","Selected files are read on this device and decoded in a temporary Web Worker. The worker is terminated when processing finishes or you cancel. Patient name, ID, birth date and accession fields are not displayed. This page does not upload or save images and has no screenshot-sharing feature.":"Wybrane pliki są odczytywane na tym urządzeniu i dekodowane w tymczasowym Web Workerze. Proces roboczy zostaje zakończony po zakończeniu przetwarzania lub anulowaniu. Pola imienia i nazwiska pacjenta, identyfikatora, daty urodzenia i przystąpienia nie są wyświetlane. Na tej stronie nie można przesyłać ani zapisywać obrazów ani nie udostępniać funkcji udostępniania zrzutów ekranu.","DICOM viewer questions":"DICOM","Formats and limitations":"Formaty i ograniczenia","This is a basic file viewer, not a PACS, DICOMweb client, radiology workstation or diagnostic device. It does not support compressed transfer syntaxes, color images, multi-frame objects, presentation states, overlays, structured reports, enhanced multi-frame studies or clinical measurements. Do not use it to make or change a diagnosis. If a study fails, the viewer reports the unsupported feature instead of showing a blank image.":"To jest podstawowa przeglądarka plików, a nie klient PACS, DICOMweb, radiologiczna stacja robocza czy urządzenie diagnostyczne. Nie obsługuje składni skompresowanego transferu, kolorowych obrazów, obiektów wieloramkowych, stanów prezentacji, nakładek, raportów strukturalnych, ulepszonych badań wieloramkowych ani pomiarów klinicznych. Nie używaj go do stawiania lub zmiany diagnozy. Jeśli badanie zakończy się niepowodzeniem, przeglądarka zgłosi nieobsługiwaną funkcję zamiast wyświetlać pusty obraz.","Are my medical images uploaded?":"Czy moje obrazy medyczne zostały przesłane?","No. The selected file bytes are read locally by your browser and a temporary local worker. This tool has no upload, remote PACS or DICOMweb connection.":"Nie. Wybrane bajty pliku są odczytywane lokalnie przez Twoją przeglądarkę i tymczasowego lokalnego pracownika. To narzędzie nie umożliwia przesyłania, zdalnego połączenia PACS ani DICOMweb.","Can I use this viewer to diagnose a condition?":"Czy mogę używać tej przeglądarki do diagnozowania choroby?","No. It is a limited technical viewer for supported files, not a medical device or diagnostic workstation. Use validated clinical software and ask a qualified clinician to interpret medical images.":"Nie. Jest to ograniczona przeglądarka techniczna obsługiwanych plików, a nie urządzenie medyczne lub diagnostyczna stacja robocza. Skorzystaj z zatwierdzonego oprogramowania klinicznego i poproś wykwalifikowanego lekarza o interpretację obrazów medycznych.","Choose DICOM file(s)":"Wybierz plik(i) DICOM","Medical files can contain identifying information. This viewer does not upload them and hides common identity fields, but review your screen before sharing it.":"Akta medyczne mogą zawierać informacje umożliwiające identyfikację. Ta przeglądarka nie przesyła ich i ukrywa typowe pola tożsamości, ale przed udostępnieniem sprawdź ekran.","Select a single DICOM image or files from a single series. Supported: uncompressed, single-frame, 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome Part 10 files. A computer is recommended for larger studies.":"Wybierz pojedynczy obraz DICOM lub pliki z jednej serii. Obsługiwane: nieskompresowane, jednoklatkowe, monochromatyczne pliki 8-bit lub 16-bit Part 10. W przypadku większych badań zaleca się korzystanie z komputera.","Choose one image or a series to begin.":"Wybierz jeden obraz lub serię, aby rozpocząć.","Reading locally":"Odczyt lokalny","Image series ready.":"Seria obrazów gotowa.","Images ready. The files did not include a series identifier; check that you selected only one series.":"Obrazy gotowe. Pliki nie zawierały identyfikatora serii; sprawdź, czy wybrałeś tylko jedną serię.","Reading cancelled. The temporary viewer data was cleared.":"Odczyt anulowany. Tymczasowe dane przeglądarki zostały usunięte.","Clear files":"Wyczyść pliki","Cancel reading":"Anuluj czytanie","Previous slice":"Poprzedni wycinek","Next slice":"Następny plasterek","Slice":"Kawałek","Current slice":"Bieżący wycinek","Window center":"Środek okna","Window width":"Szerokość okna","Modality":"Modalność","Image size":"Rozmiar obrazu","Pixel spacing":"Odstępy pikseli","Slice thickness":"Grubość plastra","Image position (patient coordinates)":"Pozycja obrazu (współrzędne pacjenta)","Image orientation":"Orientacja obrazu","Photometric interpretation":"Interpretacja fotometryczna","Pixel format":"Format pikseli","Transfer syntax":"Składnia przesyłania","Not available":"Niedostępne","This is not a DICOM Part 10 file with a DICM header.":"To nie jest plik DICOM Part 10 z nagłówkiem DICM.","The DICOM file is truncated or malformed.":"Plik DICOM jest obcięty lub zniekształcony.","Unsupported transfer syntax. This viewer accepts only uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian and Explicit VR Little Endian.":"Nieobsługiwana składnia przesyłania. Ta przeglądarka akceptuje tylko nieskompresowane pliki Implicit VR Little Endian i Explicit VR Little Endian.","This DICOM object has no pixel data to display.":"Ten obiekt DICOM nie zawiera danych pikseli do wyświetlenia.","Image dimensions exceed this viewer’s safe limit (2,048 per side and 4 megapixels per image).":"Wymiary obrazu przekraczają bezpieczny limit tej przeglądarki (2,048 na stronę i 4 megapikseli na obraz).","Unsupported image type. Choose a single-sample MONOCHROME1 or MONOCHROME2 image.":"Nieobsługiwany typ obrazu. Wybierz jednopróbkowy obraz MONOCHROME1 lub MONOCHROME2.","Unsupported pixel encoding. Only 8-bit and 16-bit monochrome integer pixels are supported.":"Nieobsługiwane kodowanie pikseli. Obsługiwane są tylko monochromatyczne piksele całkowite 8-bit i 16-bit.","This file contains multiple frames. Select a single-frame image or split the series with trusted DICOM software.":"Ten plik zawiera wiele klatek. Wybierz obraz składający się z jednej klatki lub podziel serię za pomocą zaufanego oprogramowania DICOM.","Invalid rescale values in this image.":"Nieprawidłowe wartości przeskalowania na tym obrazie.","This image uses a modality lookup table that this viewer does not support.":"Ten obraz wykorzystuje tabelę przeglądów modalności, której ta przeglądarka nie obsługuje.","A file is empty or exceeds the 16 MiB per-file limit.":"Plik jest pusty lub przekracza limit 16 MiB na plik.","This selection exceeds the safe series limit (100 files, 128 MiB input or 20 megapixels total). Select a smaller series.":"Ten wybór przekracza limit bezpiecznej serii (pliki 100, dane wejściowe 128 MiB lub łącznie megapiksele 20). Wybierz mniejszą serię.","The selection contains more than one DICOM series. Choose files from one series only.":"Wybór zawiera więcej niż jedną serię DICOM. Wybierz pliki tylko z jednej serii.","The selected files have different image dimensions. Choose one consistent series.":"Wybrane pliki mają różne wymiary obrazu. Wybierz jedną spójną serię.","The selected files have different image orientations. Choose one consistent series.":"Wybrane pliki mają różne orientacje obrazu. Wybierz jedną spójną serię.","This file could not be read as a supported DICOM image.":"Nie można odczytać tego pliku jako obsługiwanego obrazu DICOM.","Enter a finite window center and a window width of at least 1.":"Wprowadź skończony środek okna i szerokość okna co najmniej 1.","DICOM image preview":"Podgląd obrazu DICOM","Image metadata":"Metadane obrazu","Use the slice slider, or the previous and next buttons, to move through the series.":"Użyj suwaka plasterka lub przycisków Poprzedni i Następny, aby poruszać się po serii."},"pt":{"Private DICOM Image Viewer":"Visualizador de imagens DICOM privado","DICOM Viewer — Open Medical Images Privately in Your Browser":"DICOM Viewer – Abra imagens médicas de maneira privada em seu navegador","Open and scroll through uncompressed monochrome DICOM image series locally. Adjust window and level; files are not uploaded. Compressed formats are identified clearly.":"Abra e role pelas séries de imagens DICOM monocromáticas não compactadas localmente. Ajustar janela e nível; os arquivos não são carregados. Os formatos compactados são identificados claramente.","Open a DICOM image or select one local series. Scroll through ordered slices, adjust window and level, and inspect technical image metadata. Files stay in this browser.":"Abra uma imagem DICOM ou selecione uma série local. Percorra as fatias ordenadas, ajuste a janela e o nível e inspecione os metadados técnicos da imagem. Os arquivos permanecem neste navegador.","Supported images":"Imagens suportadas","This viewer reads DICOM Part 10 files with uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian or Explicit VR Little Endian pixel data. It supports single-frame 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome images, including MONOCHROME1 inversion.":"Este visualizador lê arquivos DICOM Parte 10 com dados de pixels Little Endian VR implícitos ou Little Endian VR explícitos não compactados. Ele suporta imagens monocromáticas de quadro único 8 ou 16-bit, incluindo inversão MONOCROME1.","Privacy and safe use":"Privacidade e uso seguro","Selected files are read on this device and decoded in a temporary Web Worker. The worker is terminated when processing finishes or you cancel. Patient name, ID, birth date and accession fields are not displayed. This page does not upload or save images and has no screenshot-sharing feature.":"Os arquivos selecionados são lidos neste dispositivo e decodificados em um Web Worker temporário. O trabalhador é encerrado quando o processamento termina ou você cancela. Os campos nome do paciente, RG, data de nascimento e acesso não são exibidos. Esta página não carrega nem salva imagens e não possui recurso de compartilhamento de captura de tela.","DICOM viewer questions":"Perguntas do visualizador DICOM","Formats and limitations":"Formatos e limitações","This is a basic file viewer, not a PACS, DICOMweb client, radiology workstation or diagnostic device. It does not support compressed transfer syntaxes, color images, multi-frame objects, presentation states, overlays, structured reports, enhanced multi-frame studies or clinical measurements. Do not use it to make or change a diagnosis. If a study fails, the viewer reports the unsupported feature instead of showing a blank image.":"Este é um visualizador de arquivos básico, não um PACS, cliente DICOMweb, estação de trabalho de radiologia ou dispositivo de diagnóstico. Ele não suporta sintaxes de transferência compactadas, imagens coloridas, objetos multiquadro, estados de apresentação, sobreposições, relatórios estruturados, estudos multiquadro aprimorados ou medições clínicas. Não o utilize para fazer ou alterar um diagnóstico. Se um estudo falhar, o visualizador reportará o recurso não suportado em vez de mostrar uma imagem em branco.","Are my medical images uploaded?":"Minhas imagens médicas foram carregadas?","No. The selected file bytes are read locally by your browser and a temporary local worker. This tool has no upload, remote PACS or DICOMweb connection.":"Não. Os bytes do arquivo selecionado são lidos localmente pelo seu navegador e por um trabalhador local temporário. Esta ferramenta não possui upload, conexão PACS remota ou DICOMweb.","Can I use this viewer to diagnose a condition?":"Posso usar este visualizador para diagnosticar uma condição?","No. It is a limited technical viewer for supported files, not a medical device or diagnostic workstation. Use validated clinical software and ask a qualified clinician to interpret medical images.":"Não. É um visualizador técnico limitado para arquivos suportados, não um dispositivo médico ou estação de trabalho de diagnóstico. Utilize software clínico validado e peça a um médico qualificado para interpretar imagens médicas.","Choose DICOM file(s)":"Escolha arquivo(s) DICOM","Medical files can contain identifying information. This viewer does not upload them and hides common identity fields, but review your screen before sharing it.":"Arquivos médicos podem conter informações de identificação. Este visualizador não os carrega e oculta campos de identidade comuns, mas revisa sua tela antes de compartilhá-la.","Select a single DICOM image or files from a single series. Supported: uncompressed, single-frame, 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome Part 10 files. A computer is recommended for larger studies.":"Selecione uma única imagem DICOM ou arquivos de uma única série. Suportados: arquivos monocromáticos de parte 10 descompactados, de quadro único, 8-bit ou 16-bit. Um computador é recomendado para estudos maiores.","Choose one image or a series to begin.":"Escolha uma imagem ou uma série para começar.","Reading locally":"Leitura local","Image series ready.":"Série de imagens pronta.","Images ready. The files did not include a series identifier; check that you selected only one series.":"Imagens prontas. Os arquivos não incluíam um identificador de série; verifique se você selecionou apenas uma série.","Reading cancelled. The temporary viewer data was cleared.":"Leitura cancelada. Os dados temporários do visualizador foram apagados.","Clear files":"Limpar arquivos","Cancel reading":"Cancelar leitura","Previous slice":"Fatia anterior","Next slice":"Próxima fatia","Slice":"Fatia","Current slice":"Fatia atual","Window center":"Centro da janela","Window width":"Largura da janela","Modality":"Modalidade","Image size":"Tamanho da imagem","Pixel spacing":"Espaçamento de pixels","Slice thickness":"Espessura da fatia","Image position (patient coordinates)":"Posição da imagem (coordenadas do paciente)","Image orientation":"Orientação da imagem","Photometric interpretation":"Interpretação fotométrica","Pixel format":"Formato de pixel","Transfer syntax":"Sintaxe de transferência","Not available":"Não disponível","This is not a DICOM Part 10 file with a DICM header.":"Este não é um arquivo DICOM Parte 10 com um cabeçalho DICM.","The DICOM file is truncated or malformed.":"O arquivo DICOM está truncado ou malformado.","Unsupported transfer syntax. This viewer accepts only uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian and Explicit VR Little Endian.":"Sintaxe de transferência não suportada. Este visualizador aceita apenas Little Endian VR implícito e Little Endian VR explícito não compactados.","This DICOM object has no pixel data to display.":"Este objeto DICOM não possui dados de pixel para exibir.","Image dimensions exceed this viewer’s safe limit (2,048 per side and 4 megapixels per image).":"As dimensões da imagem excedem o limite seguro deste visualizador (2,048 por lado e 4 megapixels por imagem).","Unsupported image type. Choose a single-sample MONOCHROME1 or MONOCHROME2 image.":"Tipo de imagem não suportado. Escolha uma imagem MONOCHROME1 ou MONOCHROME2 de amostra única.","Unsupported pixel encoding. Only 8-bit and 16-bit monochrome integer pixels are supported.":"Codificação de pixels não suportada. Somente pixels inteiros monocromáticos de bits 8 e 16 são suportados.","This file contains multiple frames. Select a single-frame image or split the series with trusted DICOM software.":"Este arquivo contém vários quadros. Selecione uma imagem de quadro único ou divida a série com software DICOM confiável.","Invalid rescale values in this image.":"Valores de redimensionamento inválidos nesta imagem.","This image uses a modality lookup table that this viewer does not support.":"Esta imagem utiliza uma tabela de consulta de modalidade que este visualizador não suporta.","A file is empty or exceeds the 16 MiB per-file limit.":"Um arquivo está vazio ou excede o limite de 16 MiB por arquivo.","This selection exceeds the safe series limit (100 files, 128 MiB input or 20 megapixels total). Select a smaller series.":"Esta seleção excede o limite de série segura (arquivos 100, entrada 128 MiB ou total de megapixels 20). Selecione uma série menor.","The selection contains more than one DICOM series. Choose files from one series only.":"A seleção contém mais de uma série DICOM. Escolha arquivos de apenas uma série.","The selected files have different image dimensions. Choose one consistent series.":"Os arquivos selecionados possuem diferentes dimensões de imagem. Escolha uma série consistente.","The selected files have different image orientations. Choose one consistent series.":"Os arquivos selecionados possuem diferentes orientações de imagem. Escolha uma série consistente.","This file could not be read as a supported DICOM image.":"Este arquivo não pôde ser lido como uma imagem DICOM suportada.","Enter a finite window center and a window width of at least 1.":"Insira um centro de janela finito e uma largura de janela de pelo menos 1.","DICOM image preview":"Visualização da imagem DICOM","Image metadata":"Metadados de imagem","Use the slice slider, or the previous and next buttons, to move through the series.":"Use o controle deslizante de fatia ou os botões anterior e seguinte para percorrer a série."},"ru":{"Private DICOM Image Viewer":"Частная программа просмотра изображений DICOM","DICOM Viewer — Open Medical Images Privately in Your Browser":"DICOM Viewer — личное открытие медицинских изображений в браузере","Open and scroll through uncompressed monochrome DICOM image series locally. Adjust window and level; files are not uploaded. Compressed formats are identified clearly.":"Откройте и прокрутите серию несжатых монохромных изображений DICOM локально. Отрегулируйте окно и уровень; файлы не загружаются. Сжатые форматы четко идентифицируются.","Open a DICOM image or select one local series. Scroll through ordered slices, adjust window and level, and inspect technical image metadata. Files stay in this browser.":"Откройте изображение DICOM или выберите одну локальную серию. Пролистывайте упорядоченные фрагменты, настраивайте окно и уровень, а также проверяйте метаданные технического изображения. Файлы остаются в этом браузере.","Supported images":"Поддерживаемые изображения","This viewer reads DICOM Part 10 files with uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian or Explicit VR Little Endian pixel data. It supports single-frame 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome images, including MONOCHROME1 inversion.":"Это средство просмотра читает файлы DICOM Part 10 с несжатыми данными пикселей Implicit VR Little Endian или Explicit VR Little Endian. Он поддерживает однокадровые 8-битные или 16-битные монохромные изображения, включая инверсию MONOCHROME1.","Privacy and safe use":"Конфиденциальность и безопасное использование","Selected files are read on this device and decoded in a temporary Web Worker. The worker is terminated when processing finishes or you cancel. Patient name, ID, birth date and accession fields are not displayed. This page does not upload or save images and has no screenshot-sharing feature.":"Выбранные файлы считываются на этом устройстве и декодируются во временном веб-воркере. Работник завершается, когда обработка завершается или вы ее отменяете. Имя пациента, идентификатор, дата рождения и поля доступа не отображаются. На этой странице не загружаются и не сохраняются изображения, а также нет функции обмена скриншотами.","DICOM viewer questions":"Вопросы по просмотру DICOM","Formats and limitations":"Форматы и ограничения","This is a basic file viewer, not a PACS, DICOMweb client, radiology workstation or diagnostic device. It does not support compressed transfer syntaxes, color images, multi-frame objects, presentation states, overlays, structured reports, enhanced multi-frame studies or clinical measurements. Do not use it to make or change a diagnosis. If a study fails, the viewer reports the unsupported feature instead of showing a blank image.":"Это базовая программа просмотра файлов, а не PACS, веб-клиент DICOM, радиологическая рабочая станция или диагностическое устройство. Он не поддерживает синтаксис сжатой передачи, цветные изображения, многокадровые объекты, состояния представления, наложения, структурированные отчеты, расширенные многокадровые исследования или клинические измерения. Не используйте его для постановки или изменения диагноза. Если исследование не удалось, средство просмотра сообщает о неподдерживаемой функции вместо показа пустого изображения.","Are my medical images uploaded?":"Мои медицинские изображения загружены?","No. The selected file bytes are read locally by your browser and a temporary local worker. This tool has no upload, remote PACS or DICOMweb connection.":"Нет. Выбранные байты файла считываются локально вашим браузером и временным локальным работником. Этот инструмент не поддерживает загрузку, удаленное соединение PACS или DICOMweb.","Can I use this viewer to diagnose a condition?":"Могу ли я использовать эту программу просмотра для диагностики состояния?","No. It is a limited technical viewer for supported files, not a medical device or diagnostic workstation. Use validated clinical software and ask a qualified clinician to interpret medical images.":"Нет. Это ограниченная техническая программа просмотра поддерживаемых файлов, а не медицинское устройство или диагностическая рабочая станция. Используйте проверенное клиническое программное обеспечение и попросите квалифицированного врача интерпретировать медицинские изображения.","Choose DICOM file(s)":"Выберите файл(ы) DICOM","Medical files can contain identifying information. This viewer does not upload them and hides common identity fields, but review your screen before sharing it.":"Медицинские файлы могут содержать идентифицирующую информацию. Это средство просмотра не загружает их и скрывает общие поля идентификации, но проверяет ваш экран, прежде чем поделиться им.","Select a single DICOM image or files from a single series. Supported: uncompressed, single-frame, 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome Part 10 files. A computer is recommended for larger studies.":"Выберите одно изображение DICOM или файлы из одной серии. Поддерживаются: несжатые, однокадровые, 8-битные или 16-битные монохромные файлы Part 10. Для более масштабных исследований рекомендуется использовать компьютер.","Choose one image or a series to begin.":"Для начала выберите одно изображение или серию.","Reading locally":"Локальное чтение","Image series ready.":"Серия изображений готова.","Images ready. The files did not include a series identifier; check that you selected only one series.":"Изображения готовы. Файлы не содержали идентификатора серии; проверьте, что вы выбрали только одну серию.","Reading cancelled. The temporary viewer data was cleared.":"Чтение отменено. Временные данные просмотра были удалены.","Clear files":"Очистить файлы","Cancel reading":"Отменить чтение","Previous slice":"Предыдущий фрагмент","Next slice":"Следующий фрагмент","Slice":"Срез","Current slice":"Текущий фрагмент","Window center":"Центр окна","Window width":"Ширина окна","Modality":"Модальность","Image size":"Размер изображения","Pixel spacing":"Расстояние между пикселями","Slice thickness":"Толщина среза","Image position (patient coordinates)":"Положение изображения (координаты пациента)","Image orientation":"Ориентация изображения","Photometric interpretation":"Фотометрическая интерпретация","Pixel format":"Формат пикселей","Transfer syntax":"Синтаксис передачи","Not available":"Недоступно","This is not a DICOM Part 10 file with a DICM header.":"Это не файл DICOM Part 10 с заголовком DICM.","The DICOM file is truncated or malformed.":"Файл DICOM обрезан или имеет неверный формат.","Unsupported transfer syntax. This viewer accepts only uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian and Explicit VR Little Endian.":"Неподдерживаемый синтаксис передачи. Эта программа просмотра принимает только несжатые форматы Implicit VR Little Endian и Explicit VR Little Endian.","This DICOM object has no pixel data to display.":"Этот объект DICOM не имеет данных пикселей для отображения.","Image dimensions exceed this viewer’s safe limit (2,048 per side and 4 megapixels per image).":"Размеры изображения превышают безопасный предел этого средства просмотра (2,048 на сторону и 4 мегапикселей на изображение).","Unsupported image type. Choose a single-sample MONOCHROME1 or MONOCHROME2 image.":"Неподдерживаемый тип изображения. Выберите однообразное изображение MONOCHROME1 или MONOCHROME2.","Unsupported pixel encoding. Only 8-bit and 16-bit monochrome integer pixels are supported.":"Неподдерживаемая кодировка пикселей. Поддерживаются только монохромные целочисленные пиксели 8 и 16.","This file contains multiple frames. Select a single-frame image or split the series with trusted DICOM software.":"Этот файл содержит несколько кадров. Выберите однокадровое изображение или разделите серию с помощью надежного программного обеспечения DICOM.","Invalid rescale values in this image.":"Недопустимые значения масштабирования этого изображения.","This image uses a modality lookup table that this viewer does not support.":"В этом изображении используется таблица модальности, которая не поддерживается этим средством просмотра.","A file is empty or exceeds the 16 MiB per-file limit.":"Файл пуст или превышает ограничение 16 MiB на файл.","This selection exceeds the safe series limit (100 files, 128 MiB input or 20 megapixels total). Select a smaller series.":"Этот выбор превышает безопасный предел серии (файлы 100, входные данные MiB 128 или общее количество мегапикселей 20). Выберите меньшую серию.","The selection contains more than one DICOM series. Choose files from one series only.":"Выбор содержит более одной серии DICOM. Выбирайте файлы только из одной серии.","The selected files have different image dimensions. Choose one consistent series.":"Выбранные файлы имеют разные размеры изображений. Выберите одну последовательную серию.","The selected files have different image orientations. Choose one consistent series.":"Выбранные файлы имеют разную ориентацию изображений. Выберите одну последовательную серию.","This file could not be read as a supported DICOM image.":"Этот файл не может быть прочитан как поддерживаемый образ DICOM.","Enter a finite window center and a window width of at least 1.":"Введите конечный центр окна и ширину окна не менее 1.","DICOM image preview":"Предварительный просмотр изображения DICOM","Image metadata":"Метаданные изображения","Use the slice slider, or the previous and next buttons, to move through the series.":"Для перемещения по серии используйте ползунок фрагмента или кнопки «Предыдущая» и «Следующая»."},"sv":{"Private DICOM Image Viewer":"Privat DICOM-bildvisare","DICOM Viewer — Open Medical Images Privately in Your Browser":"DICOM Viewer — Öppna medicinska bilder privat i din webbläsare","Open and scroll through uncompressed monochrome DICOM image series locally. Adjust window and level; files are not uploaded. Compressed formats are identified clearly.":"Öppna och bläddra igenom okomprimerade monokroma DICOM-bildserier lokalt. Justera fönster och nivå; filer laddas inte upp. Komprimerade format identifieras tydligt.","Open a DICOM image or select one local series. Scroll through ordered slices, adjust window and level, and inspect technical image metadata. Files stay in this browser.":"Öppna en DICOM-bild eller välj en lokal serie. Bläddra igenom beställda skivor, justera fönster och nivå och inspektera teknisk bildmetadata. Filer stannar i den här webbläsaren.","Supported images":"Bilder som stöds","This viewer reads DICOM Part 10 files with uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian or Explicit VR Little Endian pixel data. It supports single-frame 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome images, including MONOCHROME1 inversion.":"Denna visningsprogram läser DICOM Part 10-filer med okomprimerad implicit VR Little Endian eller Explicit VR Little Endian pixeldata. Den stöder enkelbilds 8-bit eller 16-bit monokroma bilder, inklusive MONOCHROME1 inversion.","Privacy and safe use":"Sekretess och säker användning","Selected files are read on this device and decoded in a temporary Web Worker. The worker is terminated when processing finishes or you cancel. Patient name, ID, birth date and accession fields are not displayed. This page does not upload or save images and has no screenshot-sharing feature.":"Utvalda filer läses på den här enheten och avkodas i en tillfällig Web Worker. Arbetaren avslutas när behandlingen är klar eller du avbryter. Patientnamn, ID, födelsedatum och anslutningsfält visas inte. Den här sidan laddar inte upp eller sparar bilder och har ingen funktion för delning av skärmdumpar.","DICOM viewer questions":"DICOM tittarfrågor","Formats and limitations":"Format och begränsningar","This is a basic file viewer, not a PACS, DICOMweb client, radiology workstation or diagnostic device. It does not support compressed transfer syntaxes, color images, multi-frame objects, presentation states, overlays, structured reports, enhanced multi-frame studies or clinical measurements. Do not use it to make or change a diagnosis. If a study fails, the viewer reports the unsupported feature instead of showing a blank image.":"Detta är en grundläggande filvisare, inte en PACS-, DICOMweb-klient, radiologiarbetsstation eller diagnostisk enhet. Det stöder inte komprimerade överföringssyntaxer, färgbilder, multi-frame-objekt, presentationstillstånd, överlägg, strukturerade rapporter, förbättrade multi-frame-studier eller kliniska mätningar. Använd den inte för att ställa eller ändra en diagnos. Om en studie misslyckas rapporterar tittaren att funktionen inte stöds istället för att visa en tom bild.","Are my medical images uploaded?":"Är mina medicinska bilder uppladdade?","No. The selected file bytes are read locally by your browser and a temporary local worker. This tool has no upload, remote PACS or DICOMweb connection.":"Nr. De valda filbytena läses lokalt av din webbläsare och en tillfällig lokal arbetare. Det här verktyget har ingen uppladdning, fjärransluten PACS eller DICOMweb.","Can I use this viewer to diagnose a condition?":"Kan jag använda den här visningsprogrammet för att diagnostisera ett tillstånd?","No. It is a limited technical viewer for supported files, not a medical device or diagnostic workstation. Use validated clinical software and ask a qualified clinician to interpret medical images.":"Nr. Det är en begränsad teknisk visning för filer som stöds, inte en medicinsk enhet eller diagnostisk arbetsstation. Använd validerad klinisk programvara och be en kvalificerad läkare att tolka medicinska bilder.","Choose DICOM file(s)":"Välj DICOM-fil(er)","Medical files can contain identifying information. This viewer does not upload them and hides common identity fields, but review your screen before sharing it.":"Medicinska filer kan innehålla identifierande information. Den här tittaren laddar inte upp dem och döljer vanliga identitetsfält, men granska din skärm innan du delar den.","Select a single DICOM image or files from a single series. Supported: uncompressed, single-frame, 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome Part 10 files. A computer is recommended for larger studies.":"Välj en enstaka DICOM-bild eller filer från en enda serie. Stöds: okomprimerade, enkelbilds-, 8-bitars eller 16-bitars monokroma Del 10-filer. En dator rekommenderas för större studier.","Choose one image or a series to begin.":"Välj en bild eller en serie för att börja.","Reading locally":"Läser lokalt","Image series ready.":"Bildserie klar.","Images ready. The files did not include a series identifier; check that you selected only one series.":"Bilderna är klara. Filerna innehöll ingen serieidentifierare; kontrollera att du bara valt en serie.","Reading cancelled. The temporary viewer data was cleared.":"Läsning avbruten. Den tillfälliga visningsdatan raderades.","Clear files":"Rensa filer","Cancel reading":"Avbryt läsning","Previous slice":"Föregående skiva","Next slice":"Nästa skiva","Slice":"Skär","Current slice":"Aktuell skiva","Window center":"Fönster mitt","Window width":"Fönsterbredd","Modality":"Modalitet","Image size":"Bildstorlek","Pixel spacing":"Pixelavstånd","Slice thickness":"Skivtjocklek","Image position (patient coordinates)":"Bildposition (patientkoordinater)","Image orientation":"Bildorientering","Photometric interpretation":"Fotometrisk tolkning","Pixel format":"Pixelformat","Transfer syntax":"Överför syntax","Not available":"Ej tillgängligt","This is not a DICOM Part 10 file with a DICM header.":"Detta är inte en DICOM Part 10-fil med ett DICM-huvud.","The DICOM file is truncated or malformed.":"DICOM-filen är trunkerad eller felaktig.","Unsupported transfer syntax. This viewer accepts only uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian and Explicit VR Little Endian.":"Overförandesyntax som inte stöds. Den här tittaren accepterar endast okomprimerad Implicit VR Little Endian och Explicit VR Little Endian.","This DICOM object has no pixel data to display.":"Detta DICOM-objekt har inga pixeldata att visa.","Image dimensions exceed this viewer’s safe limit (2,048 per side and 4 megapixels per image).":"Bildmåtten överskrider den här tittarens säkra gräns (2,048 per sida och 4 megapixlar per bild).","Unsupported image type. Choose a single-sample MONOCHROME1 or MONOCHROME2 image.":"Bildtyp som inte stöds. Välj en bild med enstaka MONOCHROME1 eller MONOCHROME2.","Unsupported pixel encoding. Only 8-bit and 16-bit monochrome integer pixels are supported.":"Pixelkodning stöds inte. Endast 8-bitar och 16-bitar monokroma heltalspixlar stöds.","This file contains multiple frames. Select a single-frame image or split the series with trusted DICOM software.":"Den här filen innehåller flera ramar. Välj en enbildsbild eller dela serien med pålitlig DICOM-programvara.","Invalid rescale values in this image.":"Ogiltiga omskalningsvärden i denna bild.","This image uses a modality lookup table that this viewer does not support.":"Den här bilden använder en modalitetsuppslagstabell som den här visningsprogrammet inte stöder.","A file is empty or exceeds the 16 MiB per-file limit.":"En fil är tom eller överskrider gränsen för 16 MiB per fil.","This selection exceeds the safe series limit (100 files, 128 MiB input or 20 megapixels total). Select a smaller series.":"Detta val överskrider gränsen för säker serie (100-filer, 128 MiB-ingång eller 20 megapixlar totalt). Välj en mindre serie.","The selection contains more than one DICOM series. Choose files from one series only.":"Utvalet innehåller mer än en DICOM-serie. Välj endast filer från en serie.","The selected files have different image dimensions. Choose one consistent series.":"De valda filerna har olika bilddimensioner. Välj en konsekvent serie.","The selected files have different image orientations. Choose one consistent series.":"De valda filerna har olika bildorientering. Välj en konsekvent serie.","This file could not be read as a supported DICOM image.":"Den här filen kunde inte läsas som en DICOM-bild som stöds.","Enter a finite window center and a window width of at least 1.":"Ange ett ändligt fönstercentrum och en fönsterbredd på minst 1.","DICOM image preview":"DICOM-bildförhandsgranskning","Image metadata":"Bildmetadata","Use the slice slider, or the previous and next buttons, to move through the series.":"Använd skivreglaget eller föregående och nästa knapp för att gå igenom serien."},"sw":{"Private DICOM Image Viewer":"Kitazamaji cha Picha cha DICOM cha Kibinafsi","DICOM Viewer — Open Medical Images Privately in Your Browser":"DICOM Viewer — Fungua Picha za Matibabu kwa Faragha katika Kivinjari Chako","Open and scroll through uncompressed monochrome DICOM image series locally. Adjust window and level; files are not uploaded. Compressed formats are identified clearly.":"Fungua na usogeze kupitia mfululizo wa picha za monochrome za DICOM ambazo hazijabanwa ndani ya nchi. Kurekebisha dirisha na kiwango; faili hazijapakiwa. Maumbizo yaliyobanwa yanatambuliwa kwa uwazi.","Open a DICOM image or select one local series. Scroll through ordered slices, adjust window and level, and inspect technical image metadata. Files stay in this browser.":"Fungua picha ya DICOM au chagua mfululizo mmoja wa ndani. Sogeza vipande vilivyoagizwa, rekebisha dirisha na kiwango, na ukague metadata ya kiufundi ya picha. Faili hukaa kwenye kivinjari hiki.","Supported images":"Picha zinazotumika","This viewer reads DICOM Part 10 files with uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian or Explicit VR Little Endian pixel data. It supports single-frame 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome images, including MONOCHROME1 inversion.":"Mtazamaji huyu husoma faili za Sehemu ya DICOM 10 zilizo na data ya pikseli ya VR Implicit Endian Ndogo au data ya Uhalisia Pepe ya Endian Ndogo ya Uhalisia Pepe. Inaauni picha za monochrome za fremu moja za 8-bit au 16-bit, ikijumuisha ubadilishaji wa MONOCHROME1.","Privacy and safe use":"Faragha na matumizi salama","Selected files are read on this device and decoded in a temporary Web Worker. The worker is terminated when processing finishes or you cancel. Patient name, ID, birth date and accession fields are not displayed. This page does not upload or save images and has no screenshot-sharing feature.":"Faili zilizochaguliwa husomwa kwenye kifaa hiki na kusimbuwa katika Mfanyakazi wa Wavuti wa muda. Mfanyikazi huachishwa kazi wakati usindikaji ukamilika au unaghairi. Jina la mgonjwa, kitambulisho, tarehe ya kuzaliwa na sehemu za kujiunga hazionyeshwi. Ukurasa huu haupakii au kuhifadhi picha na hauna kipengele cha kushiriki picha za skrini.","DICOM viewer questions":"DICOM maswali ya watazamaji","Formats and limitations":"Miundo na mapungufu","This is a basic file viewer, not a PACS, DICOMweb client, radiology workstation or diagnostic device. It does not support compressed transfer syntaxes, color images, multi-frame objects, presentation states, overlays, structured reports, enhanced multi-frame studies or clinical measurements. Do not use it to make or change a diagnosis. If a study fails, the viewer reports the unsupported feature instead of showing a blank image.":"Hiki ni kitazamaji faili msingi, si PACS, mteja wa DICOMweb, kituo cha kazi cha radiolojia au kifaa cha uchunguzi. Haitumii sintaksia za uhamishaji zilizobanwa, picha za rangi, vipengee vya fremu nyingi, hali ya uwasilishaji, mabango, ripoti zilizopangwa, tafiti zilizoimarishwa za mifumo mingi au vipimo vya kimatibabu. Usitumie kufanya au kubadilisha utambuzi. Utafiti usipofaulu, mtazamaji ataripoti kipengele kisichotumika badala ya kuonyesha picha tupu.","Are my medical images uploaded?":"Je, picha zangu za matibabu zimepakiwa?","No. The selected file bytes are read locally by your browser and a temporary local worker. This tool has no upload, remote PACS or DICOMweb connection.":"Na. Baiti za faili zilizochaguliwa husomwa ndani na kivinjari chako na mfanyakazi wa ndani wa muda. Zana hii haina upakiaji, muunganisho wa mbali wa PACS au DICOMweb.","Can I use this viewer to diagnose a condition?":"Je, ninaweza kutumia kitazamaji hiki kutambua hali?","No. It is a limited technical viewer for supported files, not a medical device or diagnostic workstation. Use validated clinical software and ask a qualified clinician to interpret medical images.":"Na. Ni kitazamaji chache cha kiufundi cha faili zinazotumika, si kifaa cha matibabu au kituo cha uchunguzi. Tumia programu ya kimatibabu iliyoidhinishwa na umwombe daktari aliyehitimu kufasiri picha za matibabu.","Choose DICOM file(s)":"Chagua faili za DICOM","Medical files can contain identifying information. This viewer does not upload them and hides common identity fields, but review your screen before sharing it.":"Faili za matibabu zinaweza kuwa na taarifa ya kutambua. Kitazamaji hiki hakizipakii na huficha sehemu za utambulisho zinazojulikana, lakini kagua skrini yako kabla ya kuishiriki.","Select a single DICOM image or files from a single series. Supported: uncompressed, single-frame, 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome Part 10 files. A computer is recommended for larger studies.":"Chagua picha au faili moja za DICOM kutoka kwa mfululizo mmoja. Inatumika: faili zisizofinyizwa, za fremu moja, 8-bit au 16-bit monochrome Sehemu ya faili 10. Kompyuta inapendekezwa kwa masomo makubwa.","Choose one image or a series to begin.":"Chagua picha moja au mfululizo ili kuanza.","Reading locally":"Kusoma ndani ya nchi","Image series ready.":"Msururu wa picha tayari.","Images ready. The files did not include a series identifier; check that you selected only one series.":"Picha tayari. Faili hazikujumuisha kitambulisho cha mfululizo; hakikisha kuwa umechagua mfululizo mmoja tu.","Reading cancelled. The temporary viewer data was cleared.":"Usomaji umeghairiwa. Data ya muda ya mtazamaji ilifutwa.","Clear files":"Futa faili","Cancel reading":"Ghairi kusoma","Previous slice":"Kipande kilichotangulia","Next slice":"Kipande kinachofuata","Slice":"Kipande","Current slice":"Kipande cha sasa","Window center":"Kituo cha dirisha","Window width":"Upana wa dirisha","Modality":"Tabia","Image size":"Ukubwa wa picha","Pixel spacing":"Nafasi ya pikseli","Slice thickness":"Unene wa kipande","Image position (patient coordinates)":"Msimamo wa picha (viratibu vya wagonjwa)","Image orientation":"Mwelekeo wa picha","Photometric interpretation":"Tafsiri ya picha\nUmbizo la","Pixel format":"Pixel","Transfer syntax":"Hamisha sintaksia","Not available":"Haipatikani","This is not a DICOM Part 10 file with a DICM header.":"Hii si faili ya Sehemu ya DICOM 10 yenye kichwa cha DICM.","The DICOM file is truncated or malformed.":"Faili ya DICOM imepunguzwa au ina hitilafu.","Unsupported transfer syntax. This viewer accepts only uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian and Explicit VR Little Endian.":"Sintaksia ya uhamishaji isiyotumika. Mtazamaji huyu anakubali VR Implicit Endian na Endian ya Uhalisia Pepe ya Uhalisia Pepe pekee ambayo haijabanwa.","This DICOM object has no pixel data to display.":"Kifaa hiki cha DICOM hakina data ya pikseli ya kuonyesha.","Image dimensions exceed this viewer’s safe limit (2,048 per side and 4 megapixels per image).":"Vipimo vya picha vinazidi kikomo salama cha mtazamaji huyu (2,048 kwa kila upande na megapikseli 4 kwa kila picha).","Unsupported image type. Choose a single-sample MONOCHROME1 or MONOCHROME2 image.":"Aina ya picha isiyotumika. Chagua picha ya sampuli moja ya MONOCHROME1 au MONOCHROME2.","Unsupported pixel encoding. Only 8-bit and 16-bit monochrome integer pixels are supported.":"Usimbaji wa pikseli usiotumika. Ni saizi kamili za monochrome 8-bit na 16-bit pekee ndizo zinazotumika.","This file contains multiple frames. Select a single-frame image or split the series with trusted DICOM software.":"Faili hii ina fremu nyingi. Chagua picha ya fremu moja au ugawanye mfululizo kwa programu inayoaminika ya DICOM.","Invalid rescale values in this image.":"Thamani za upunguzaji alama zisizo sahihi katika picha hii.","This image uses a modality lookup table that this viewer does not support.":"Picha hii inatumia jedwali la kuangalia hali ambayo kitazamaji hiki hakitumii.","A file is empty or exceeds the 16 MiB per-file limit.":"Faili ni tupu au inazidi kikomo cha 16 MiB kwa kila faili.","This selection exceeds the safe series limit (100 files, 128 MiB input or 20 megapixels total). Select a smaller series.":"Uteuzi huu umezidi kikomo cha mfululizo salama (faili 100, ingizo la 128 MiB au jumla ya megapixels 20). Chagua mfululizo mdogo zaidi.","The selection contains more than one DICOM series. Choose files from one series only.":"Uteuzi una zaidi ya mfululizo mmoja wa DICOM. Chagua faili kutoka kwa mfululizo mmoja pekee.","The selected files have different image dimensions. Choose one consistent series.":"Faili zilizochaguliwa zina vipimo tofauti vya picha. Chagua mfululizo mmoja thabiti.","The selected files have different image orientations. Choose one consistent series.":"Faili zilizochaguliwa zina mwelekeo tofauti wa picha. Chagua mfululizo mmoja thabiti.","This file could not be read as a supported DICOM image.":"Faili hii haikuweza kusomeka kama picha inayotumika ya DICOM.","Enter a finite window center and a window width of at least 1.":"Ingiza kituo chenye kikomo cha dirisha na upana wa dirisha wa angalau 1.","DICOM image preview":"DICOM onyesho la kukagua picha","Image metadata":"Metadata ya picha","Use the slice slider, or the previous and next buttons, to move through the series.":"Tumia kitelezi cha kipande, au vitufe vilivyotangulia na vinavyofuata, kusogeza mfululizo."},"ta":{"Private DICOM Image Viewer":"தனியார் DICOM பட பார்வையாளர்","DICOM Viewer — Open Medical Images Privately in Your Browser":"DICOM பார்வையாளர் — மருத்துவப் படங்களை உங்கள் உலாவியில் தனிப்பட்ட முறையில் திறக்கவும்","Open and scroll through uncompressed monochrome DICOM image series locally. Adjust window and level; files are not uploaded. Compressed formats are identified clearly.":"உள்ளூரில் சுருக்கப்படாத ஒரே வண்ணமுடைய DICOM படத் தொடரைத் திறந்து உருட்டவும். சாளரம் மற்றும் நிலை சரி; கோப்புகள் பதிவேற்றப்படவில்லை. சுருக்கப்பட்ட வடிவங்கள் தெளிவாக அடையாளம் காணப்படுகின்றன.","Open a DICOM image or select one local series. Scroll through ordered slices, adjust window and level, and inspect technical image metadata. Files stay in this browser.":"DICOM படத்தைத் திறக்கவும் அல்லது ஒரு உள்ளூர் தொடரைத் தேர்ந்தெடுக்கவும். ஆர்டர் செய்யப்பட்ட ஸ்லைஸ்கள் மூலம் உருட்டவும், சாளரம் மற்றும் அளவை சரிசெய்து, தொழில்நுட்ப பட மெட்டாடேட்டாவை ஆய்வு செய்யவும். கோப்புகள் இந்த உலாவியில் இருக்கும்.","Supported images":"ஆதரவு படங்கள்","This viewer reads DICOM Part 10 files with uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian or Explicit VR Little Endian pixel data. It supports single-frame 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome images, including MONOCHROME1 inversion.":"இந்த பார்வையாளர் DICOM பகுதி 10 கோப்புகளை சுருக்கப்படாத மறைமுகமான VR லிட்டில் எண்டியன் அல்லது வெளிப்படையான VR லிட்டில் எண்டியன் பிக்சல் தரவுகளுடன் படிக்கிறார். இது ஒற்றை-பிரேம் 8-பிட் அல்லது 16-பிட் மோனோக்ரோம் படங்களை ஆதரிக்கிறது, இதில் MONOCHROME1 இன்வெர்ஷன் அடங்கும்.","Privacy and safe use":"தனியுரிமை மற்றும் பாதுகாப்பான பயன்பாடு","Selected files are read on this device and decoded in a temporary Web Worker. The worker is terminated when processing finishes or you cancel. Patient name, ID, birth date and accession fields are not displayed. This page does not upload or save images and has no screenshot-sharing feature.":"தேர்ந்தெடுக்கப்பட்ட கோப்புகள் இந்தச் சாதனத்தில் படிக்கப்பட்டு, தற்காலிக வலைப் பணியகத்தில் டிகோட் செய்யப்படும். செயலாக்கம் முடிந்ததும் அல்லது நீங்கள் ரத்துசெய்யும்போது பணியாளர் பணிநீக்கம் செய்யப்படுவார். நோயாளியின் பெயர், ஐடி, பிறந்த தேதி மற்றும் அணுகல் புலங்கள் காட்டப்படாது. இந்தப் பக்கம் படங்களைப் பதிவேற்றவோ சேமிக்கவோ இல்லை மற்றும் ஸ்கிரீன்ஷாட்-பகிர்வு அம்சமும் இல்லை.","DICOM viewer questions":"DICOM பார்வையாளர் கேள்விகள்","Formats and limitations":"வடிவங்கள் மற்றும் வரம்புகள்","This is a basic file viewer, not a PACS, DICOMweb client, radiology workstation or diagnostic device. It does not support compressed transfer syntaxes, color images, multi-frame objects, presentation states, overlays, structured reports, enhanced multi-frame studies or clinical measurements. Do not use it to make or change a diagnosis. If a study fails, the viewer reports the unsupported feature instead of showing a blank image.":"இது ஒரு அடிப்படை கோப்பு பார்வையாளர், PACS, DICOMweb கிளையன்ட், ரேடியாலஜி பணிநிலையம் அல்லது கண்டறியும் சாதனம் அல்ல. இது சுருக்கப்பட்ட பரிமாற்ற தொடரியல், வண்ணப் படங்கள், பல-பிரேம் பொருள்கள், விளக்கக்காட்சி நிலைகள், மேலடுக்குகள், கட்டமைக்கப்பட்ட அறிக்கைகள், மேம்படுத்தப்பட்ட பல-பிரேம் ஆய்வுகள் அல்லது மருத்துவ அளவீடுகளை ஆதரிக்காது. நோயறிதலைச் செய்ய அல்லது மாற்ற அதைப் பயன்படுத்த வேண்டாம். ஒரு ஆய்வில் தோல்வியுற்றால், பார்வையாளர் வெற்றுப் படத்தைக் காட்டுவதற்குப் பதிலாக ஆதரிக்கப்படாத அம்சத்தைப் புகாரளிக்கிறார்.","Are my medical images uploaded?":"எனது மருத்துவப் படங்கள் பதிவேற்றப்பட்டதா?","No. The selected file bytes are read locally by your browser and a temporary local worker. This tool has no upload, remote PACS or DICOMweb connection.":"எண். தேர்ந்தெடுக்கப்பட்ட கோப்பு பைட்டுகள் உங்கள் உலாவி மற்றும் தற்காலிக உள்ளூர் பணியாளர் மூலம் உள்நாட்டில் படிக்கப்படும். இந்தக் கருவியில் பதிவேற்றம், தொலைநிலை PACS அல்லது DICOMweb இணைப்பு இல்லை.","Can I use this viewer to diagnose a condition?":"இந்தப் பார்வையாளரைப் பயன்படுத்தி நோயைக் கண்டறிய முடியுமா?","No. It is a limited technical viewer for supported files, not a medical device or diagnostic workstation. Use validated clinical software and ask a qualified clinician to interpret medical images.":"எண். இது ஆதரிக்கப்படும் கோப்புகளுக்கான வரையறுக்கப்பட்ட தொழில்நுட்ப பார்வையாளர், மருத்துவ சாதனம் அல்லது கண்டறியும் பணிநிலையம் அல்ல. சரிபார்க்கப்பட்ட மருத்துவ மென்பொருளைப் பயன்படுத்தவும் மற்றும் மருத்துவப் படங்களை விளக்குவதற்கு தகுதியான மருத்துவரிடம் கேளுங்கள்.","Choose DICOM file(s)":"DICOM கோப்பை(களை) தேர்வு செய்யவும்","Medical files can contain identifying information. This viewer does not upload them and hides common identity fields, but review your screen before sharing it.":"மருத்துவ கோப்புகளில் அடையாளம் காணும் தகவல்கள் இருக்கலாம். இந்த பார்வையாளர் அவற்றைப் பதிவேற்றவில்லை மற்றும் பொதுவான அடையாளப் புலங்களை மறைக்கவில்லை, ஆனால் அதைப் பகிர்வதற்கு முன் உங்கள் திரையை மதிப்பாய்வு செய்யவும்.","Select a single DICOM image or files from a single series. Supported: uncompressed, single-frame, 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome Part 10 files. A computer is recommended for larger studies.":"ஒரு தொடரிலிருந்து ஒரு DICOM படம் அல்லது கோப்புகளைத் தேர்ந்தெடுக்கவும். ஆதரிக்கப்படும்: சுருக்கப்படாத, ஒற்றை-பிரேம், 8-பிட் அல்லது 16-பிட் மோனோக்ரோம் பகுதி 10 கோப்புகள். பெரிய படிப்புகளுக்கு கணினி பரிந்துரைக்கப்படுகிறது.","Choose one image or a series to begin.":"தொடங்குவதற்கு ஒரு படம் அல்லது தொடரைத் தேர்வு செய்யவும்.","Reading locally":"உள்ளூரில் படித்தல்","Image series ready.":"படத் தொடர் தயார்.","Images ready. The files did not include a series identifier; check that you selected only one series.":"படங்கள் தயார். கோப்புகளில் தொடர் அடையாளங்காட்டி இல்லை; நீங்கள் ஒரே ஒரு தொடரைத் தேர்ந்தெடுத்துள்ளீர்களா என்று சரிபார்க்கவும்.","Reading cancelled. The temporary viewer data was cleared.":"வாசிப்பு ரத்து செய்யப்பட்டது. தற்காலிக பார்வையாளர் தரவு அழிக்கப்பட்டது.","Clear files":"கோப்புகளை அழிக்கவும்","Cancel reading":"வாசிப்பை ரத்துசெய்","Previous slice":"முந்தைய துண்டு","Next slice":"அடுத்த துண்டு","Slice":"துண்டு","Current slice":"தற்போதைய துண்டு","Window center":"சாளர மையம்","Window width":"சாளர அகலம்","Modality":"முறை","Image size":"பட அளவு","Pixel spacing":"பிக்சல் இடைவெளி","Slice thickness":"ஸ்லைஸ் தடிமன்","Image position (patient coordinates)":"பட நிலை (நோயாளி ஒருங்கிணைப்பு)","Image orientation":"பட நோக்குநிலை","Photometric interpretation":"ஃபோட்டோமெட்ரிக் விளக்கம்","Pixel format":"பிக்சல் வடிவம்","Transfer syntax":"இயற்கையை மாற்றவும்","Not available":"கிடைக்கவில்லை","This is not a DICOM Part 10 file with a DICM header.":"இது DICM தலைப்புடன் கூடிய DICOM பகுதி 10 கோப்பு அல்ல.","The DICOM file is truncated or malformed.":"DICOM கோப்பு துண்டிக்கப்பட்டுள்ளது அல்லது தவறாக வடிவமைக்கப்பட்டுள்ளது.","Unsupported transfer syntax. This viewer accepts only uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian and Explicit VR Little Endian.":"ஆதரவற்ற பரிமாற்ற தொடரியல். இந்த பார்வையாளர் சுருக்கப்படாத மறைமுகமான VR லிட்டில் எண்டியனையும் வெளிப்படையான VR லிட்டில் எண்டியனையும் மட்டுமே ஏற்றுக்கொள்கிறார்.","This DICOM object has no pixel data to display.":"இந்த DICOM பொருளில் காண்பிக்க பிக்சல் தரவு இல்லை.","Image dimensions exceed this viewer’s safe limit (2,048 per side and 4 megapixels per image).":"பட பரிமாணங்கள் இந்த பார்வையாளரின் பாதுகாப்பான வரம்பை மீறுகின்றன (ஒரு பக்கத்திற்கு 2,048 மற்றும் ஒரு படத்திற்கு 4 மெகாபிக்சல்கள்).","Unsupported image type. Choose a single-sample MONOCHROME1 or MONOCHROME2 image.":"ஆதரவற்ற பட வகை. ஒற்றை மாதிரி MONOCHROME1 அல்லது MONOCHROME2 படத்தைத் தேர்ந்தெடுக்கவும்.","Unsupported pixel encoding. Only 8-bit and 16-bit monochrome integer pixels are supported.":"ஆதரவற்ற பிக்சல் குறியாக்கம். 8-பிட் மற்றும் 16-பிட் மோனோக்ரோம் முழு எண் பிக்சல்கள் மட்டுமே ஆதரிக்கப்படுகின்றன.","This file contains multiple frames. Select a single-frame image or split the series with trusted DICOM software.":"இந்த கோப்பில் பல பிரேம்கள் உள்ளன. ஒற்றை-சட்டப் படத்தைத் தேர்ந்தெடுக்கவும் அல்லது நம்பகமான DICOM மென்பொருளைக் கொண்டு தொடரைப் பிரிக்கவும்.","Invalid rescale values in this image.":"இந்தப் படத்தில் தவறான மறுஅளவீடு மதிப்புகள்.","This image uses a modality lookup table that this viewer does not support.":"இந்தப் படம் இந்த பார்வையாளர் ஆதரிக்காத மாதிரித் தேடல் அட்டவணையைப் பயன்படுத்துகிறது.","A file is empty or exceeds the 16 MiB per-file limit.":"ஒரு கோப்பு காலியாக உள்ளது அல்லது ஒரு கோப்புக்கான 16 MiB வரம்பை மீறுகிறது.","This selection exceeds the safe series limit (100 files, 128 MiB input or 20 megapixels total). Select a smaller series.":"இந்தத் தேர்வு பாதுகாப்பான தொடர் வரம்பை மீறுகிறது (100 கோப்புகள், 128 MiB உள்ளீடு அல்லது மொத்தம் 20 மெகாபிக்சல்கள்). சிறிய தொடரைத் தேர்ந்தெடுக்கவும்.","The selection contains more than one DICOM series. Choose files from one series only.":"தேர்வில் ஒன்றுக்கும் மேற்பட்ட DICOM தொடர்கள் உள்ளன. ஒரு தொடரிலிருந்து மட்டும் கோப்புகளைத் தேர்ந்தெடுக்கவும்.","The selected files have different image dimensions. Choose one consistent series.":"தேர்ந்தெடுக்கப்பட்ட கோப்புகள் வெவ்வேறு பட பரிமாணங்களைக் கொண்டுள்ளன. ஒரு சீரான தொடரைத் தேர்வு செய்யவும்.","The selected files have different image orientations. Choose one consistent series.":"தேர்ந்தெடுக்கப்பட்ட கோப்புகள் வெவ்வேறு பட நோக்குநிலைகளைக் கொண்டுள்ளன. ஒரு சீரான தொடரைத் தேர்வு செய்யவும்.","This file could not be read as a supported DICOM image.":"இந்த கோப்பை ஆதரிக்கப்படும் DICOM படமாக படிக்க முடியவில்லை.","Enter a finite window center and a window width of at least 1.":"ஒரு வரையறுக்கப்பட்ட சாளர மையத்தையும் குறைந்தபட்சம் 1 சாளர அகலத்தையும் உள்ளிடவும்.","DICOM image preview":"DICOM பட முன்னோட்டம்","Image metadata":"பட மெட்டாடேட்டா","Use the slice slider, or the previous and next buttons, to move through the series.":"தொடர் வழியாக செல்ல ஸ்லைஸ் ஸ்லைடர் அல்லது முந்தைய மற்றும் அடுத்த பொத்தான்களைப் பயன்படுத்தவும்."},"te":{"Private DICOM Image Viewer":"ప్రైవేట్ DICOM ఇమేజ్ వ్యూయర్","DICOM Viewer — Open Medical Images Privately in Your Browser":"DICOM వ్యూయర్ — మెడికల్ ఇమేజ్‌లను మీ బ్రౌజర్‌లో ప్రైవేట్‌గా తెరవండి","Open and scroll through uncompressed monochrome DICOM image series locally. Adjust window and level; files are not uploaded. Compressed formats are identified clearly.":"స్థానికంగా కంప్రెస్ చేయని మోనోక్రోమ్ DICOM ఇమేజ్ సిరీస్‌ని తెరిచి, స్క్రోల్ చేయండి. విండో మరియు స్థాయిని సర్దుబాటు చేయండి; ఫైల్‌లు అప్‌లోడ్ చేయబడవు. కంప్రెస్డ్ ఫార్మాట్‌లు స్పష్టంగా గుర్తించబడతాయి.","Open a DICOM image or select one local series. Scroll through ordered slices, adjust window and level, and inspect technical image metadata. Files stay in this browser.":"DICOM చిత్రాన్ని తెరవండి లేదా ఒక స్థానిక సిరీస్‌ని ఎంచుకోండి. ఆర్డర్ చేసిన స్లైస్‌ల ద్వారా స్క్రోల్ చేయండి, విండో మరియు స్థాయిని సర్దుబాటు చేయండి మరియు సాంకేతిక చిత్ర మెటాడేటాను తనిఖీ చేయండి. ఫైల్‌లు ఈ బ్రౌజర్‌లోనే ఉంటాయి.","Supported images":"మద్దతు ఉన్న చిత్రాలు","This viewer reads DICOM Part 10 files with uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian or Explicit VR Little Endian pixel data. It supports single-frame 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome images, including MONOCHROME1 inversion.":"ఈ వీక్షకుడు DICOM పార్ట్ 10 ఫైల్‌లను కంప్రెస్ చేయని ఇంప్లిసిట్ VR లిటిల్ ఎండియన్ లేదా స్పష్టమైన VR లిటిల్ ఎండియన్ పిక్సెల్ డేటాతో చదువుతుంది. ఇది MONOCHROME1 విలోమంతో సహా సింగిల్-ఫ్రేమ్ 8-బిట్ లేదా 16-బిట్ మోనోక్రోమ్ చిత్రాలకు మద్దతు ఇస్తుంది.","Privacy and safe use":"గోప్యత మరియు సురక్షితమైన ఉపయోగం","Selected files are read on this device and decoded in a temporary Web Worker. The worker is terminated when processing finishes or you cancel. Patient name, ID, birth date and accession fields are not displayed. This page does not upload or save images and has no screenshot-sharing feature.":"ఎంచుకున్న ఫైల్‌లు ఈ పరికరంలో చదవబడతాయి మరియు తాత్కాలిక వెబ్ వర్కర్‌లో డీకోడ్ చేయబడతాయి. ప్రాసెసింగ్ పూర్తయినప్పుడు లేదా మీరు రద్దు చేసినప్పుడు కార్మికుడు తొలగించబడతాడు. రోగి పేరు, ID, పుట్టిన తేదీ మరియు ప్రవేశ ఫీల్డ్‌లు ప్రదర్శించబడవు. ఈ పేజీ చిత్రాలను అప్‌లోడ్ చేయదు లేదా సేవ్ చేయదు మరియు స్క్రీన్‌షాట్-షేరింగ్ ఫీచర్ లేదు.","DICOM viewer questions":"DICOM వీక్షకుల ప్రశ్నలు","Formats and limitations":"ఆకృతులు మరియు పరిమితులు","This is a basic file viewer, not a PACS, DICOMweb client, radiology workstation or diagnostic device. It does not support compressed transfer syntaxes, color images, multi-frame objects, presentation states, overlays, structured reports, enhanced multi-frame studies or clinical measurements. Do not use it to make or change a diagnosis. If a study fails, the viewer reports the unsupported feature instead of showing a blank image.":"ఇది ప్రాథమిక ఫైల్ వ్యూయర్, PACS, DICOMweb క్లయింట్, రేడియాలజీ వర్క్‌స్టేషన్ లేదా డయాగ్నస్టిక్ పరికరం కాదు. ఇది కంప్రెస్డ్ ట్రాన్స్‌ఫర్ సింటాక్స్‌లు, కలర్ ఇమేజ్‌లు, మల్టీ-ఫ్రేమ్ ఆబ్జెక్ట్‌లు, ప్రెజెంటేషన్ స్టేట్‌లు, ఓవర్‌లేలు, స్ట్రక్చర్డ్ రిపోర్ట్‌లు, మెరుగుపరచబడిన బహుళ-ఫ్రేమ్ అధ్యయనాలు లేదా క్లినికల్ కొలతలకు మద్దతు ఇవ్వదు. రోగ నిర్ధారణ చేయడానికి లేదా మార్చడానికి దీన్ని ఉపయోగించవద్దు. అధ్యయనం విఫలమైతే, వీక్షకుడు ఖాళీ చిత్రాన్ని చూపించడానికి బదులుగా మద్దతు లేని ఫీచర్‌ను నివేదిస్తారు.","Are my medical images uploaded?":"నా వైద్య చిత్రాలు అప్‌లోడ్ చేయబడ్డాయా?","No. The selected file bytes are read locally by your browser and a temporary local worker. This tool has no upload, remote PACS or DICOMweb connection.":"నం. ఎంచుకున్న ఫైల్ బైట్‌లు మీ బ్రౌజర్ మరియు తాత్కాలిక స్థానిక కార్యకర్త ద్వారా స్థానికంగా చదవబడతాయి. ఈ సాధనానికి అప్‌లోడ్, రిమోట్ PACS లేదా DICOMweb కనెక్షన్ లేదు.","Can I use this viewer to diagnose a condition?":"నేను పరిస్థితిని నిర్ధారించడానికి ఈ వ్యూయర్‌ని ఉపయోగించవచ్చా?","No. It is a limited technical viewer for supported files, not a medical device or diagnostic workstation. Use validated clinical software and ask a qualified clinician to interpret medical images.":"నం. ఇది మద్దతు ఉన్న ఫైల్‌ల కోసం పరిమిత సాంకేతిక వీక్షకుడు, వైద్య పరికరం లేదా డయాగ్నస్టిక్ వర్క్‌స్టేషన్ కాదు. ధృవీకరించబడిన క్లినికల్ సాఫ్ట్‌వేర్‌ను ఉపయోగించండి మరియు వైద్య చిత్రాలను వివరించడానికి అర్హత కలిగిన వైద్యుని అడగండి.","Choose DICOM file(s)":"DICOM ఫైల్(లు)ని ఎంచుకోండి","Medical files can contain identifying information. This viewer does not upload them and hides common identity fields, but review your screen before sharing it.":"మెడికల్ ఫైల్‌లు గుర్తించే సమాచారాన్ని కలిగి ఉంటాయి. ఈ వీక్షకుడు వాటిని అప్‌లోడ్ చేయడు మరియు సాధారణ గుర్తింపు ఫీల్డ్‌లను దాచడు, కానీ మీ స్క్రీన్‌ను భాగస్వామ్యం చేయడానికి ముందు సమీక్షించండి.","Select a single DICOM image or files from a single series. Supported: uncompressed, single-frame, 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome Part 10 files. A computer is recommended for larger studies.":"ఒకే సిరీస్ నుండి ఒకే DICOM ఇమేజ్ లేదా ఫైల్‌లను ఎంచుకోండి. మద్దతు ఉంది: కంప్రెస్డ్, సింగిల్-ఫ్రేమ్, 8-బిట్ లేదా 16-బిట్ మోనోక్రోమ్ పార్ట్ 10 ఫైల్‌లు. పెద్ద చదువుల కోసం కంప్యూటర్ సిఫార్సు చేయబడింది.","Choose one image or a series to begin.":"ప్రారంభించడానికి ఒక చిత్రం లేదా సిరీస్‌ని ఎంచుకోండి.","Reading locally":"స్థానికంగా చదవడం","Image series ready.":"ఇమేజ్ సిరీస్ సిద్ధంగా ఉంది.","Images ready. The files did not include a series identifier; check that you selected only one series.":"చిత్రాలు సిద్ధంగా ఉన్నాయి. ఫైల్‌లు సిరీస్ ఐడెంటిఫైయర్‌ను కలిగి లేవు; మీరు ఒక సిరీస్‌ని మాత్రమే ఎంచుకున్నారని తనిఖీ చేయండి.","Reading cancelled. The temporary viewer data was cleared.":"పఠనం రద్దు చేయబడింది. తాత్కాలిక వీక్షకుల డేటా క్లియర్ చేయబడింది.","Clear files":"ఫైళ్లను క్లియర్ చేయండి","Cancel reading":"పఠనాన్ని రద్దు చేయండి","Previous slice":"మునుపటి స్లైస్","Next slice":"తదుపరి స్లైస్","Slice":"స్లైస్","Current slice":"ప్రస్తుత స్లైస్","Window center":"విండో సెంటర్","Window width":"కిటికీ వెడల్పు","Modality":"మోడాలిటీ","Image size":"చిత్ర పరిమాణం","Pixel spacing":"పిక్సెల్ అంతరం","Slice thickness":"స్లైస్ మందం","Image position (patient coordinates)":"చిత్ర స్థానం (రోగి కోఆర్డినేట్లు)","Image orientation":"ఇమేజ్ ఓరియంటేషన్","Photometric interpretation":"ఫోటోమెట్రిక్ వివరణ","Pixel format":"పిక్సెల్ ఫార్మాట్","Transfer syntax":"బదిలీ సింటాక్స్","Not available":"అందుబాటులో లేదు","This is not a DICOM Part 10 file with a DICM header.":"ఇది DICM హెడర్‌తో కూడిన DICOM పార్ట్ 10 ఫైల్ కాదు.","The DICOM file is truncated or malformed.":"DICOM ఫైల్ కత్తిరించబడింది లేదా తప్పుగా రూపొందించబడింది.","Unsupported transfer syntax. This viewer accepts only uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian and Explicit VR Little Endian.":"మద్దతు లేని బదిలీ సింటాక్స్. ఈ వీక్షకుడు కంప్రెస్ చేయని ఇంప్లిసిట్ VR లిటిల్ ఎండియన్ మరియు స్పష్టమైన VR లిటిల్ ఎండియన్‌లను మాత్రమే అంగీకరిస్తారు.","This DICOM object has no pixel data to display.":"ఈ DICOM ఆబ్జెక్ట్ ప్రదర్శించడానికి పిక్సెల్ డేటా లేదు.","Image dimensions exceed this viewer’s safe limit (2,048 per side and 4 megapixels per image).":"చిత్ర కొలతలు ఈ వీక్షకుని సురక్షిత పరిమితిని మించిపోయాయి (ప్రతి వైపు 2,048 మరియు ప్రతి చిత్రానికి 4 మెగాపిక్సెల్‌లు).","Unsupported image type. Choose a single-sample MONOCHROME1 or MONOCHROME2 image.":"మద్దతు లేని చిత్ర రకం. ఒకే నమూనా MONOCHROME1 లేదా MONOCHROME2 చిత్రాన్ని ఎంచుకోండి.","Unsupported pixel encoding. Only 8-bit and 16-bit monochrome integer pixels are supported.":"మద్దతు లేని పిక్సెల్ ఎన్‌కోడింగ్. 8-bit మరియు 16-bit మోనోక్రోమ్ పూర్ణాంక పిక్సెల్‌లకు మాత్రమే మద్దతు ఉంది.","This file contains multiple frames. Select a single-frame image or split the series with trusted DICOM software.":"ఈ ఫైల్ బహుళ ఫ్రేమ్‌లను కలిగి ఉంది. సింగిల్-ఫ్రేమ్ చిత్రాన్ని ఎంచుకోండి లేదా విశ్వసనీయ DICOM సాఫ్ట్‌వేర్‌తో సిరీస్‌ను విభజించండి.","Invalid rescale values in this image.":"ఈ చిత్రంలో చెల్లని రీస్కేల్ విలువలు.","This image uses a modality lookup table that this viewer does not support.":"ఈ చిత్రం ఈ వీక్షకుడు మద్దతు ఇవ్వని మోడాలిటీ లుకప్ పట్టికను ఉపయోగిస్తుంది.","A file is empty or exceeds the 16 MiB per-file limit.":"ఒక ఫైల్ ఖాళీగా ఉంది లేదా ప్రతి ఫైల్ పరిమితిని 16 MiB మించిపోయింది.","This selection exceeds the safe series limit (100 files, 128 MiB input or 20 megapixels total). Select a smaller series.":"ఈ ఎంపిక సురక్షిత సిరీస్ పరిమితిని మించిపోయింది (100 ఫైల్‌లు, 128 MiB ఇన్‌పుట్ లేదా మొత్తం 20 మెగాపిక్సెల్స్). చిన్న శ్రేణిని ఎంచుకోండి.","The selection contains more than one DICOM series. Choose files from one series only.":"ఎంపిక ఒకటి కంటే ఎక్కువ DICOM సిరీస్‌లను కలిగి ఉంది. ఒక సిరీస్ నుండి మాత్రమే ఫైల్‌లను ఎంచుకోండి.","The selected files have different image dimensions. Choose one consistent series.":"ఎంచుకున్న ఫైల్‌లు వేర్వేరు ఇమేజ్ కొలతలు కలిగి ఉన్నాయి. ఒక స్థిరమైన సిరీస్‌ని ఎంచుకోండి.","The selected files have different image orientations. Choose one consistent series.":"ఎంచుకున్న ఫైల్‌లు వేర్వేరు ఇమేజ్ ఓరియంటేషన్‌లను కలిగి ఉన్నాయి. ఒక స్థిరమైన సిరీస్‌ని ఎంచుకోండి.","This file could not be read as a supported DICOM image.":"ఈ ఫైల్ మద్దతు ఉన్న DICOM ఇమేజ్‌గా చదవబడదు.","Enter a finite window center and a window width of at least 1.":"పరిమిత విండో మధ్యలో మరియు కనీసం 1 విండో వెడల్పును నమోదు చేయండి.","DICOM image preview":"DICOM చిత్రం ప్రివ్యూ","Image metadata":"చిత్రం మెటాడేటా","Use the slice slider, or the previous and next buttons, to move through the series.":"శ్రేణి ద్వారా తరలించడానికి స్లైస్ స్లయిడర్ లేదా మునుపటి మరియు తదుపరి బటన్‌లను ఉపయోగించండి."},"th":{"Private DICOM Image Viewer":"โปรแกรมดูรูปภาพ DICOM ส่วนตัว","DICOM Viewer — Open Medical Images Privately in Your Browser":"DICOM Viewer — เปิดภาพทางการแพทย์แบบส่วนตัวในเบราว์เซอร์ของคุณ","Open and scroll through uncompressed monochrome DICOM image series locally. Adjust window and level; files are not uploaded. Compressed formats are identified clearly.":"เปิดและเลื่อนดูชุดรูปภาพ DICOM ขาวดำที่ไม่มีการบีบอัดในเครื่อง ปรับหน้าต่างและระดับ ไฟล์ไม่ได้รับการอัพโหลด มีการระบุรูปแบบการบีบอัดอย่างชัดเจน","Open a DICOM image or select one local series. Scroll through ordered slices, adjust window and level, and inspect technical image metadata. Files stay in this browser.":"เปิดอิมเมจ DICOM หรือเลือกซีรีส์ท้องถิ่นหนึ่งรายการ เลื่อนดูส่วนที่เรียงลำดับ ปรับหน้าต่างและระดับ และตรวจสอบข้อมูลเมตาของรูปภาพทางเทคนิค ไฟล์จะยังคงอยู่ในเบราว์เซอร์นี้","Supported images":"รูปภาพที่รองรับ","This viewer reads DICOM Part 10 files with uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian or Explicit VR Little Endian pixel data. It supports single-frame 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome images, including MONOCHROME1 inversion.":"โปรแกรมดูนี้จะอ่านไฟล์ DICOM Part 10 ที่มีข้อมูลพิกเซล Implicit VR Little Endian ที่ไม่มีการบีบอัด หรือ Explicit VR Little Endian pixel data รองรับภาพขาวดำ 8-บิตแบบเฟรมเดียว หรือภาพขาวดำ 16 บิต รวมถึงการกลับด้าน MONOCHROME1","Privacy and safe use":"ความเป็นส่วนตัวและการใช้งานที่ปลอดภัย","Selected files are read on this device and decoded in a temporary Web Worker. The worker is terminated when processing finishes or you cancel. Patient name, ID, birth date and accession fields are not displayed. This page does not upload or save images and has no screenshot-sharing feature.":"ไฟล์ที่เลือกจะถูกอ่านบนอุปกรณ์นี้และถอดรหัสใน Web Worker ชั่วคราว ผู้ปฏิบัติงานจะถูกยกเลิกเมื่อการประมวลผลเสร็จสิ้นหรือคุณยกเลิก ชื่อผู้ป่วย, ID, วันเกิด และฟิลด์ภาคยานุวัติจะไม่แสดง หน้านี้ไม่ได้อัปโหลดหรือบันทึกภาพ และไม่มีคุณสมบัติการแชร์ภาพหน้าจอ","DICOM viewer questions":"คำถามเกี่ยวกับโปรแกรมดู DICOM","Formats and limitations":"รูปแบบและข้อจำกัด","This is a basic file viewer, not a PACS, DICOMweb client, radiology workstation or diagnostic device. It does not support compressed transfer syntaxes, color images, multi-frame objects, presentation states, overlays, structured reports, enhanced multi-frame studies or clinical measurements. Do not use it to make or change a diagnosis. If a study fails, the viewer reports the unsupported feature instead of showing a blank image.":"นี่คือโปรแกรมดูไฟล์พื้นฐาน ไม่ใช่ PACS, ไคลเอ็นต์ DICOMweb, เวิร์กสเตชันรังสีวิทยา หรืออุปกรณ์วินิจฉัย ไม่รองรับไวยากรณ์การถ่ายโอนแบบบีบอัด รูปภาพสี วัตถุหลายเฟรม สถานะการนำเสนอ การซ้อนทับ รายงานแบบมีโครงสร้าง การศึกษาแบบหลายเฟรมที่ได้รับการปรับปรุง หรือการวัดผลทางคลินิก อย่าใช้เพื่อสร้างหรือเปลี่ยนแปลงการวินิจฉัย หากการศึกษาล้มเหลว ผู้ชมจะรายงานฟีเจอร์ที่ไม่รองรับ แทนที่จะแสดงภาพเปล่า","Are my medical images uploaded?":"ภาพทางการแพทย์ของฉันอัปโหลดหรือไม่","No. The selected file bytes are read locally by your browser and a temporary local worker. This tool has no upload, remote PACS or DICOMweb connection.":"No. ไบต์ของไฟล์ที่เลือกจะถูกอ่านในเครื่องโดยเบราว์เซอร์ของคุณและผู้ปฏิบัติงานชั่วคราวในพื้นที่ เครื่องมือนี้ไม่มีการอัปโหลด การเชื่อมต่อ PACS ระยะไกลหรือเว็บ DICOM","Can I use this viewer to diagnose a condition?":"ฉันสามารถใช้โปรแกรมดูนี้เพื่อวินิจฉัยอาการได้หรือไม่","No. It is a limited technical viewer for supported files, not a medical device or diagnostic workstation. Use validated clinical software and ask a qualified clinician to interpret medical images.":"No. เป็นโปรแกรมดูทางเทคนิคที่จำกัดสำหรับไฟล์ที่รองรับ ไม่ใช่อุปกรณ์ทางการแพทย์หรือเวิร์กสเตชันการวินิจฉัย ใช้ซอฟต์แวร์ทางคลินิกที่ผ่านการตรวจสอบแล้ว และขอให้แพทย์ที่มีคุณสมบัติเหมาะสมแปลภาพทางการแพทย์","Choose DICOM file(s)":"เลือกไฟล์ DICOM","Medical files can contain identifying information. This viewer does not upload them and hides common identity fields, but review your screen before sharing it.":"ไฟล์ทางการแพทย์อาจมีข้อมูลที่สามารถระบุตัวตนได้ โปรแกรมดูนี้ไม่ได้อัปโหลดและซ่อนฟิลด์ข้อมูลประจำตัวทั่วไป แต่ตรวจสอบหน้าจอของคุณก่อนแชร์","Select a single DICOM image or files from a single series. Supported: uncompressed, single-frame, 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome Part 10 files. A computer is recommended for larger studies.":"เลือกรูปภาพ DICOM หรือไฟล์เดียวจากซีรีส์เดียว รองรับ: ไฟล์ 8 บิตหรือ 16 บิตขาวดำส่วน 10 ที่ไม่บีบอัด แนะนำให้ใช้คอมพิวเตอร์สำหรับการศึกษาขนาดใหญ่","Choose one image or a series to begin.":"เลือกหนึ่งภาพหรือชุดเพื่อเริ่มต้น","Reading locally":"อ่านในเครื่อง","Image series ready.":"ชุดรูปภาพพร้อมแล้ว","Images ready. The files did not include a series identifier; check that you selected only one series.":"ภาพพร้อม ไฟล์ไม่มีตัวระบุซีรีส์ ตรวจสอบว่าคุณเลือกเพียงซีรี่ส์เดียวเท่านั้น","Reading cancelled. The temporary viewer data was cleared.":"การอ่านถูกยกเลิก ข้อมูลผู้ดูชั่วคราวถูกล้างแล้ว","Clear files":"ล้างไฟล์","Cancel reading":"ยกเลิกการอ่าน","Previous slice":"ชิ้นก่อนหน้า","Next slice":"ชิ้นถัดไป","Slice":"สไลซ์","Current slice":"สไลซ์ปัจจุบัน","Window center":"หน้าต่างตรงกลาง","Window width":"ความกว้างของหน้าต่าง","Modality":"กิริยา","Image size":"ขนาดภาพ","Pixel spacing":"ระยะห่างระหว่างพิกเซล","Slice thickness":"ความหนาของชิ้น","Image position (patient coordinates)":"ตำแหน่งภาพ (พิกัดผู้ป่วย)","Image orientation":"การวางแนวภาพ","Photometric interpretation":"การตีความเชิงแสง","Pixel format":"รูปแบบพิกเซล","Transfer syntax":"ไวยากรณ์การถ่ายโอน","Not available":"ไม่มีข้อมูล","This is not a DICOM Part 10 file with a DICM header.":"นี่ไม่ใช่ไฟล์ DICOM Part 10 ที่มีส่วนหัว DICM","The DICOM file is truncated or malformed.":"ไฟล์ DICOM ถูกตัดทอนหรือมีรูปแบบไม่ถูกต้อง","Unsupported transfer syntax. This viewer accepts only uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian and Explicit VR Little Endian.":"ไวยากรณ์การถ่ายโอนที่ไม่รองรับ โปรแกรมดูนี้ยอมรับเฉพาะ Implicit VR Little Endian และ Explicit VR Little Endian ที่ไม่มีการบีบอัดเท่านั้น","This DICOM object has no pixel data to display.":"ออบเจ็กต์ DICOM นี้ไม่มีข้อมูลพิกเซลที่จะแสดง","Image dimensions exceed this viewer’s safe limit (2,048 per side and 4 megapixels per image).":"ขนาดรูปภาพเกินขีดจำกัดความปลอดภัยของผู้ชม (2,048 ต่อด้านและ 4 เมกะพิกเซลต่อภาพ)","Unsupported image type. Choose a single-sample MONOCHROME1 or MONOCHROME2 image.":"ประเภทรูปภาพที่ไม่รองรับ เลือกรูปภาพ MONOCHROME1 หรือ MONOCHROME2 ตัวอย่างเดียว","Unsupported pixel encoding. Only 8-bit and 16-bit monochrome integer pixels are supported.":"ไม่รองรับการเข้ารหัสพิกเซล รองรับเฉพาะพิกเซลจำนวนเต็มขาวดำ 8 บิตและ 16 บิตเท่านั้น","This file contains multiple frames. Select a single-frame image or split the series with trusted DICOM software.":"ไฟล์นี้มีหลายเฟรม เลือกภาพเฟรมเดียวหรือแยกชุดด้วยซอฟต์แวร์ DICOM ที่เชื่อถือได้","Invalid rescale values in this image.":"ค่าการรีสเกลไม่ถูกต้องในภาพนี้","This image uses a modality lookup table that this viewer does not support.":"อิมเมจนี้ใช้ตารางค้นหาโมดาลลิตี้ที่วิวเวอร์นี้ไม่รองรับ","A file is empty or exceeds the 16 MiB per-file limit.":"ไฟล์ว่างเปล่าหรือเกินขีดจำกัด 16 MiB ต่อไฟล์","This selection exceeds the safe series limit (100 files, 128 MiB input or 20 megapixels total). Select a smaller series.":"การเลือกนี้เกินขีดจำกัดของซีรีส์ที่ปลอดภัย (ไฟล์ 100, อินพุต 128 MiB หรือจำนวนเมกะพิกเซลทั้งหมด 20) เลือกซีรี่ส์ที่มีขนาดเล็กกว่า","The selection contains more than one DICOM series. Choose files from one series only.":"รายการที่เลือกมีซีรี่ส์ DICOM มากกว่าหนึ่งชุด เลือกไฟล์จากซีรีส์เดียวเท่านั้น","The selected files have different image dimensions. Choose one consistent series.":"ไฟล์ที่เลือกมีขนาดภาพต่างกัน เลือกหนึ่งซีรี่ส์ที่สอดคล้องกัน","The selected files have different image orientations. Choose one consistent series.":"ไฟล์ที่เลือกมีการวางแนวของภาพที่แตกต่างกัน เลือกหนึ่งซีรี่ส์ที่สอดคล้องกัน","This file could not be read as a supported DICOM image.":"ไฟล์นี้ไม่สามารถอ่านเป็นอิมเมจ DICOM ที่รองรับได้","Enter a finite window center and a window width of at least 1.":"ป้อนจุดศูนย์กลางหน้าต่างที่มีขอบเขตและความกว้างหน้าต่างอย่างน้อย 1","DICOM image preview":"ตัวอย่างรูปภาพ DICOM","Image metadata":"ข้อมูลเมตาของรูปภาพ","Use the slice slider, or the previous and next buttons, to move through the series.":"ใช้แถบเลื่อนแบ่งส่วนหรือปุ่มก่อนหน้าและถัดไปเพื่อเลื่อนดูชุดข้อมูล"},"tl":{"Private DICOM Image Viewer":"Pribadong DICOM Image Viewer","DICOM Viewer — Open Medical Images Privately in Your Browser":"DICOM Viewer — Buksan nang Pribado ang Mga Medikal na Larawan sa Iyong Browser","Open and scroll through uncompressed monochrome DICOM image series locally. Adjust window and level; files are not uploaded. Compressed formats are identified clearly.":"Buksan at mag-scroll sa hindi naka-compress na monochrome na serye ng imahe ng DICOM nang lokal. Ayusin ang window at antas; hindi na-upload ang mga file. Malinaw na natukoy ang mga naka-compress na format.","Open a DICOM image or select one local series. Scroll through ordered slices, adjust window and level, and inspect technical image metadata. Files stay in this browser.":"Buksan ang isang DICOM na imahe o pumili ng isang lokal na serye. Mag-scroll sa mga nakaayos na hiwa, ayusin ang window at antas, at suriin ang metadata ng teknikal na larawan. Ang mga file ay mananatili sa browser na ito.","Supported images":"Mga suportadong larawan","This viewer reads DICOM Part 10 files with uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian or Explicit VR Little Endian pixel data. It supports single-frame 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome images, including MONOCHROME1 inversion.":"Binabasa ng viewer na ito ang DICOM Part 10 file na may hindi naka-compress na Implicit VR Little Endian o Explicit VR Little Endian pixel data. Sinusuportahan nito ang single-frame na 8-bit o 16-bit na mga monochrome na larawan, kabilang ang MONOCHROME1 inversion.","Privacy and safe use":"Privacy at ligtas na paggamit","Selected files are read on this device and decoded in a temporary Web Worker. The worker is terminated when processing finishes or you cancel. Patient name, ID, birth date and accession fields are not displayed. This page does not upload or save images and has no screenshot-sharing feature.":"Ang mga napiling file ay binabasa sa device na ito at na-decode sa isang pansamantalang Web Worker. Tinatanggal ang manggagawa kapag natapos na ang pagproseso o kinansela mo. Ang pangalan ng pasyente, ID, petsa ng kapanganakan at mga field ng pag-access ay hindi ipinapakita. Ang pahinang ito ay hindi nag-a-upload o nagse-save ng mga larawan at walang tampok na pagbabahagi ng screenshot.","DICOM viewer questions":"Mga tanong sa manonood ng DICOM","Formats and limitations":"Mga format at limitasyon","This is a basic file viewer, not a PACS, DICOMweb client, radiology workstation or diagnostic device. It does not support compressed transfer syntaxes, color images, multi-frame objects, presentation states, overlays, structured reports, enhanced multi-frame studies or clinical measurements. Do not use it to make or change a diagnosis. If a study fails, the viewer reports the unsupported feature instead of showing a blank image.":"Ito ay isang pangunahing file viewer, hindi isang PACS, DICOMweb client, radiology workstation o diagnostic device. Hindi nito sinusuportahan ang mga compressed transfer syntax, mga larawang may kulay, mga multi-frame na bagay, mga estado ng presentasyon, mga overlay, mga structured na ulat, pinahusay na multi-frame na pag-aaral o mga klinikal na sukat. Huwag gamitin ito para gumawa o magbago ng diagnosis. Kung mabigo ang isang pag-aaral, iuulat ng manonood ang hindi sinusuportahang feature sa halip na magpakita ng blangkong larawan.","Are my medical images uploaded?":"Na-upload ba ang aking mga medikal na larawan?","No. The selected file bytes are read locally by your browser and a temporary local worker. This tool has no upload, remote PACS or DICOMweb connection.":"Hindi. Ang mga napiling file byte ay lokal na binabasa ng iyong browser at isang pansamantalang lokal na manggagawa. Ang tool na ito ay walang upload, remote na PACS o DICOMweb na koneksyon.","Can I use this viewer to diagnose a condition?":"Maaari ko bang gamitin ang viewer na ito para mag-diagnose ng kundisyon?","No. It is a limited technical viewer for supported files, not a medical device or diagnostic workstation. Use validated clinical software and ask a qualified clinician to interpret medical images.":"Hindi. Ito ay isang limitadong teknikal na viewer para sa mga sinusuportahang file, hindi isang medikal na device o diagnostic workstation. Gumamit ng napatunayang klinikal na software at hilingin sa isang kwalipikadong clinician na bigyang-kahulugan ang mga medikal na larawan.","Choose DICOM file(s)":"Pumili ng (mga) DICOM file","Medical files can contain identifying information. This viewer does not upload them and hides common identity fields, but review your screen before sharing it.":"Maaaring maglaman ng impormasyong nagpapakilala ang mga medikal na file. Ang manonood na ito ay hindi nag-a-upload sa kanila at nagtatago ng mga karaniwang field ng pagkakakilanlan, ngunit suriin ang iyong screen bago ito ibahagi.","Select a single DICOM image or files from a single series. Supported: uncompressed, single-frame, 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome Part 10 files. A computer is recommended for larger studies.":"Pumili ng isang imahe ng DICOM o mga file mula sa isang serye. Sinusuportahan: hindi naka-compress, single-frame, 8-bit o 16-bit na monochrome Part 10 file. Ang isang computer ay inirerekomenda para sa mas malalaking pag-aaral.","Choose one image or a series to begin.":"Pumili ng isang larawan o isang serye upang magsimula.","Reading locally":"Lokal na nagbabasa","Image series ready.":"Handa na ang serye ng larawan.","Images ready. The files did not include a series identifier; check that you selected only one series.":"Handa na ang mga larawan. Ang mga file ay walang kasamang series identifier; tingnan kung isang serye lang ang napili mo.","Reading cancelled. The temporary viewer data was cleared.":"Kinansela ang pagbabasa. Na-clear ang pansamantalang data ng tumitingin.","Clear files":"I-clear ang mga file","Cancel reading":"Kanselahin ang pagbabasa","Previous slice":"Nakaraang slice","Next slice":"Susunod na slice","Slice":"Hiwa","Current slice":"Kasalukuyang slice","Window center":"Sentro ng bintana","Window width":"Lapad ng bintana","Modality":"Modalidad","Image size":"Laki ng larawan","Pixel spacing":"Pixel spacing","Slice thickness":"Kapal ng hiwa","Image position (patient coordinates)":"Posisyon ng larawan (mga coordinate ng pasyente)","Image orientation":"Oryentasyon ng larawan","Photometric interpretation":"Photometric na interpretasyon","Pixel format":"Format ng pixel","Transfer syntax":"Transfer syntax","Not available":"Hindi available","This is not a DICOM Part 10 file with a DICM header.":"Ito ay hindi isang DICOM Part 10 file na may isang DICM header.","The DICOM file is truncated or malformed.":"Naputol o mali ang pagkakabuo ng DICOM file.","Unsupported transfer syntax. This viewer accepts only uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian and Explicit VR Little Endian.":"Hindi sinusuportahang syntax ng paglilipat. Tumatanggap lang ang manonood na ito ng hindi naka-compress na Implicit VR Little Endian at Explicit VR Little Endian.","This DICOM object has no pixel data to display.":"Itong DICOM object ay walang pixel data na ipapakita.","Image dimensions exceed this viewer’s safe limit (2,048 per side and 4 megapixels per image).":"Lampas ang mga sukat ng larawan sa ligtas na limitasyon ng manonood na ito (2,048 bawat gilid at 4 megapixel bawat larawan).","Unsupported image type. Choose a single-sample MONOCHROME1 or MONOCHROME2 image.":"Hindi sinusuportahang uri ng larawan. Pumili ng single-sample na MONOCHROME1 o MONOCHROME2 na larawan.","Unsupported pixel encoding. Only 8-bit and 16-bit monochrome integer pixels are supported.":"Hindi sinusuportahang pixel encoding. Tanging 8-bit at 16-bit na monochrome integer pixels lang ang sinusuportahan.","This file contains multiple frames. Select a single-frame image or split the series with trusted DICOM software.":"Ang file na ito ay naglalaman ng maramihang mga frame. Pumili ng isang single-frame na larawan o hatiin ang serye gamit ang pinagkakatiwalaang DICOM software.","Invalid rescale values in this image.":"Di-wastong rescale value sa larawang ito.","This image uses a modality lookup table that this viewer does not support.":"Gumagamit ang larawang ito ng modality lookup table na hindi sinusuportahan ng viewer na ito.","A file is empty or exceeds the 16 MiB per-file limit.":"Walang laman ang isang file o lumampas sa 16 MiB per-file na limitasyon.","This selection exceeds the safe series limit (100 files, 128 MiB input or 20 megapixels total). Select a smaller series.":"Lampas ang pagpipiliang ito sa limitasyon ng ligtas na serye (100 file, 128 MiB input o 20 megapixels sa kabuuan). Pumili ng mas maliit na serye.","The selection contains more than one DICOM series. Choose files from one series only.":"Ang pagpili ay naglalaman ng higit sa isang serye ng DICOM. Pumili ng mga file mula sa isang serye lamang.","The selected files have different image dimensions. Choose one consistent series.":"May iba't ibang dimensyon ng larawan ang mga napiling file. Pumili ng isang pare-parehong serye.","The selected files have different image orientations. Choose one consistent series.":"Ang mga napiling file ay may iba't ibang oryentasyon ng imahe. Pumili ng isang pare-parehong serye.","This file could not be read as a supported DICOM image.":"Hindi mababasa ang file na ito bilang suportadong DICOM na imahe.","Enter a finite window center and a window width of at least 1.":"Maglagay ng limitadong window center at lapad ng window na hindi bababa sa 1.","DICOM image preview":"Preview ng larawan ng DICOM","Image metadata":"Metadata ng larawan","Use the slice slider, or the previous and next buttons, to move through the series.":"Gamitin ang slice slider, o ang nakaraan at susunod na mga button, upang lumipat sa serye."},"tr":{"Private DICOM Image Viewer":"Özel DICOM Resim Görüntüleyici","DICOM Viewer — Open Medical Images Privately in Your Browser":"DICOM Görüntüleyici — Tıbbi Görüntüleri Tarayıcınızda Özel Olarak Açın","Open and scroll through uncompressed monochrome DICOM image series locally. Adjust window and level; files are not uploaded. Compressed formats are identified clearly.":"Sıkıştırılmamış monokrom DICOM görüntü serisini yerel olarak açın ve bunlar arasında gezinin. Pencereyi ve seviyeyi ayarlayın; dosyalar yüklenmiyor. Sıkıştırılmış formatlar açıkça tanımlanır.","Open a DICOM image or select one local series. Scroll through ordered slices, adjust window and level, and inspect technical image metadata. Files stay in this browser.":"Bir DICOM görüntüsü açın veya bir yerel seri seçin. Sıralı dilimler arasında ilerleyin, pencereyi ve düzeyi ayarlayın ve teknik görüntü meta verilerini inceleyin. Dosyalar bu tarayıcıda kalır.","Supported images":"Desteklenen görseller","This viewer reads DICOM Part 10 files with uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian or Explicit VR Little Endian pixel data. It supports single-frame 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome images, including MONOCHROME1 inversion.":"Bu görüntüleyici, sıkıştırılmamış Implicit VR Little Endian veya Explicit VR Little Endian piksel verileriyle DICOM Part 10 dosyalarını okur. MONOCHROME1 ters çevirme de dahil olmak üzere tek kare 8 bit veya 16 bit monokrom görüntüleri destekler.","Privacy and safe use":"Gizlilik ve güvenli kullanım","Selected files are read on this device and decoded in a temporary Web Worker. The worker is terminated when processing finishes or you cancel. Patient name, ID, birth date and accession fields are not displayed. This page does not upload or save images and has no screenshot-sharing feature.":"Seçilen dosyalar bu cihazda okunur ve geçici bir Web Worker'da kodu çözülür. İşlem bittiğinde veya siz iptal ettiğinizde işçinin işine son verilir. Hasta adı, kimliği, doğum tarihi ve erişim alanları görüntülenmez. Bu sayfa görsel yüklemez veya kaydetmez ve ekran görüntüsü paylaşma özelliği yoktur.","DICOM viewer questions":"DICOM görüntüleyici soruları","Formats and limitations":"Biçimler ve sınırlamalar","This is a basic file viewer, not a PACS, DICOMweb client, radiology workstation or diagnostic device. It does not support compressed transfer syntaxes, color images, multi-frame objects, presentation states, overlays, structured reports, enhanced multi-frame studies or clinical measurements. Do not use it to make or change a diagnosis. If a study fails, the viewer reports the unsupported feature instead of showing a blank image.":"Bu bir PACS, DICOMweb istemcisi, radyoloji iş istasyonu veya teşhis cihazı değil, temel bir dosya görüntüleyicidir. Sıkıştırılmış aktarım sözdizimlerini, renkli görüntüleri, çok çerçeveli nesneleri, sunum durumlarını, katmanları, yapılandırılmış raporları, geliştirilmiş çok çerçeveli çalışmaları veya klinik ölçümleri desteklemez. Teşhis koymak veya değiştirmek için kullanmayın. Bir çalışma başarısız olursa izleyici boş bir resim göstermek yerine desteklenmeyen özelliği bildirir.","Are my medical images uploaded?":"Tıbbi resimlerim yükleniyor mu?","No. The selected file bytes are read locally by your browser and a temporary local worker. This tool has no upload, remote PACS or DICOMweb connection.":"Hayır. Seçilen dosya baytları, tarayıcınız ve geçici bir yerel çalışan tarafından yerel olarak okunur. Bu aracın yükleme, uzak PACS veya DICOMweb bağlantısı yoktur.","Can I use this viewer to diagnose a condition?":"Bu görüntüleyiciyi bir durumu teşhis etmek için kullanabilir miyim?","No. It is a limited technical viewer for supported files, not a medical device or diagnostic workstation. Use validated clinical software and ask a qualified clinician to interpret medical images.":"Hayır. Tıbbi bir cihaz veya teşhis iş istasyonu değil, desteklenen dosyalar için sınırlı bir teknik görüntüleyicidir. Doğrulanmış klinik yazılımı kullanın ve kalifiye bir klinisyenden tıbbi görüntüleri yorumlamasını isteyin.","Choose DICOM file(s)":"DICOM dosyalarını seçin","Medical files can contain identifying information. This viewer does not upload them and hides common identity fields, but review your screen before sharing it.":"Tıbbi dosyalar tanımlayıcı bilgiler içerebilir. Bu görüntüleyici bunları yüklemez ve ortak kimlik alanlarını gizler; ancak paylaşmadan önce ekranınızı inceler.","Select a single DICOM image or files from a single series. Supported: uncompressed, single-frame, 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome Part 10 files. A computer is recommended for larger studies.":"Tek bir seriden tek bir DICOM görüntüsü veya dosyaları seçin. Desteklenen: sıkıştırılmamış, tek kare, 8-bit veya 16-bit monokrom Parça 10 dosyaları. Daha büyük çalışmalar için bilgisayar önerilir.","Choose one image or a series to begin.":"Başlamak için bir resim veya seri seçin.","Reading locally":"Yerel olarak okuma","Image series ready.":"Resim serisi hazır.","Images ready. The files did not include a series identifier; check that you selected only one series.":"Resimler hazır. Dosyalar bir seri tanımlayıcı içermiyordu; Yalnızca bir seri seçtiğinizden emin olun.","Reading cancelled. The temporary viewer data was cleared.":"Okuma iptal edildi. Geçici izleyici verileri temizlendi.","Clear files":"Dosyaları temizle","Cancel reading":"Okumayı iptal et","Previous slice":"Önceki dilim","Next slice":"Sonraki dilim","Slice":"Dilim","Current slice":"Geçerli dilim","Window center":"Pencere merkezi","Window width":"Pencere genişliği","Modality":"Modalite","Image size":"Resim boyutu","Pixel spacing":"Piksel aralığı","Slice thickness":"Dilim kalınlığı","Image position (patient coordinates)":"Görüntü konumu (hasta koordinatları)","Image orientation":"Görüntü yönlendirmesi","Photometric interpretation":"Fotometrik yorumlama","Pixel format":"Piksel formatı","Transfer syntax":"Aktarım söz dizimi","Not available":"Mevcut değil","This is not a DICOM Part 10 file with a DICM header.":"Bu, DICM başlığına sahip bir DICOM Parça 10 dosyası değil.","The DICOM file is truncated or malformed.":"DICOM dosyası kesilmiş veya hatalı biçimlendirilmiş.","Unsupported transfer syntax. This viewer accepts only uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian and Explicit VR Little Endian.":"Desteklenmeyen aktarım sözdizimi. Bu görüntüleyici yalnızca sıkıştırılmamış Implicit VR Little Endian ve Explicit VR Little Endian'ı kabul eder.","This DICOM object has no pixel data to display.":"Bu DICOM nesnesinin görüntülenecek piksel verisi yok.","Image dimensions exceed this viewer’s safe limit (2,048 per side and 4 megapixels per image).":"Resim boyutları bu izleyicinin güvenli sınırını aşıyor (yan başına 2,048 ve görüntü başına 4 megapiksel).","Unsupported image type. Choose a single-sample MONOCHROME1 or MONOCHROME2 image.":"Desteklenmeyen resim türü. Tek örnekli bir MONOCHROME1 veya MONOCHROME2 görüntüsü seçin.","Unsupported pixel encoding. Only 8-bit and 16-bit monochrome integer pixels are supported.":"Desteklenmeyen piksel kodlaması. Yalnızca 8-bit ve 16-bit monokrom tam sayı pikselleri desteklenir.","This file contains multiple frames. Select a single-frame image or split the series with trusted DICOM software.":"Bu dosya birden fazla kare içeriyor. Tek kareli bir görüntü seçin veya seriyi güvenilir DICOM yazılımıyla bölün.","Invalid rescale values in this image.":"Bu görüntüde geçersiz yeniden ölçeklendirme değerleri.","This image uses a modality lookup table that this viewer does not support.":"Bu resim, bu görüntüleyicinin desteklemediği bir modalite arama tablosu kullanıyor.","A file is empty or exceeds the 16 MiB per-file limit.":"Bir dosya boş veya dosya başına 16 MiB sınırını aşıyor.","This selection exceeds the safe series limit (100 files, 128 MiB input or 20 megapixels total). Select a smaller series.":"Bu seçim, güvenli seri sınırını aşıyor (100 dosyalar, 128 MiB girişi veya toplam 20 megapiksel). Daha küçük bir seri seçin.","The selection contains more than one DICOM series. Choose files from one series only.":"Seçim birden fazla DICOM serisi içeriyor. Yalnızca bir serideki dosyaları seçin.","The selected files have different image dimensions. Choose one consistent series.":"Seçilen dosyalar farklı görüntü boyutlarına sahip. Tutarlı bir seri seçin.","The selected files have different image orientations. Choose one consistent series.":"Seçilen dosyalar farklı görüntü yönelimlerine sahip. Tutarlı bir seri seçin.","This file could not be read as a supported DICOM image.":"Bu dosya desteklenen bir DICOM görüntüsü olarak okunamadı.","Enter a finite window center and a window width of at least 1.":"Sonlu bir pencere merkezi ve en az 1 pencere genişliği girin.","DICOM image preview":"DICOM görüntü önizlemesi","Image metadata":"Resim meta verileri","Use the slice slider, or the previous and next buttons, to move through the series.":"Seride ilerlemek için dilim kaydırıcısını veya önceki ve sonraki düğmelerini kullanın."},"uk":{"Private DICOM Image Viewer":"Приватний засіб перегляду зображень DICOM","DICOM Viewer — Open Medical Images Privately in Your Browser":"DICOM Viewer — відкривайте медичні зображення приватно у своєму браузері","Open and scroll through uncompressed monochrome DICOM image series locally. Adjust window and level; files are not uploaded. Compressed formats are identified clearly.":"Локально відкривайте та прокручуйте нестиснені монохромні зображення DICOM. Відрегулювати вікно та рівень; файли не завантажуються. Стиснуті формати чітко ідентифікуються.","Open a DICOM image or select one local series. Scroll through ordered slices, adjust window and level, and inspect technical image metadata. Files stay in this browser.":"Відкрийте зображення DICOM або виберіть одну локальну серію. Прокрутіть упорядковані фрагменти, налаштуйте вікно та рівень і перевірте технічні метадані зображення. Файли залишаються в цьому браузері.","Supported images":"Підтримувані зображення","This viewer reads DICOM Part 10 files with uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian or Explicit VR Little Endian pixel data. It supports single-frame 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome images, including MONOCHROME1 inversion.":"Цей засіб перегляду зчитує файли DICOM Part 10 із нестисненими піксельними даними неявного VR Little Endian або явного VR Little Endian. Він підтримує однокадрові 8-біт або 16-біт монохромні зображення, включаючи інверсію MONOCHROME1.","Privacy and safe use":"Конфіденційність і безпечне використання","Selected files are read on this device and decoded in a temporary Web Worker. The worker is terminated when processing finishes or you cancel. Patient name, ID, birth date and accession fields are not displayed. This page does not upload or save images and has no screenshot-sharing feature.":"Вибрані файли зчитуються на цьому пристрої та декодуються у тимчасовому Web Worker. Воркер припиняється, коли обробка завершується або ви скасуєте її. Ім’я пацієнта, ідентифікатор, дата народження та поля приєднання не відображаються. Ця сторінка не завантажує та не зберігає зображення та не має функції обміну знімками екрана.","DICOM viewer questions":"Запитання щодо програми перегляду DICOM","Formats and limitations":"Формати та обмеження","This is a basic file viewer, not a PACS, DICOMweb client, radiology workstation or diagnostic device. It does not support compressed transfer syntaxes, color images, multi-frame objects, presentation states, overlays, structured reports, enhanced multi-frame studies or clinical measurements. Do not use it to make or change a diagnosis. If a study fails, the viewer reports the unsupported feature instead of showing a blank image.":"Це базовий засіб перегляду файлів, а не клієнт PACS, DICOMweb, радіологічна робоча станція чи діагностичний пристрій. Він не підтримує стислий синтаксис передачі, кольорові зображення, багатокадрові об’єкти, стани презентації, накладення, структуровані звіти, розширені багатокадрові дослідження або клінічні вимірювання. Не використовуйте його для встановлення або зміни діагнозу. Якщо дослідження не вдається, глядач повідомляє про непідтримувану функцію замість показу порожнього зображення.","Are my medical images uploaded?":"Чи завантажено мої медичні зображення?","No. The selected file bytes are read locally by your browser and a temporary local worker. This tool has no upload, remote PACS or DICOMweb connection.":"№ Байти вибраного файлу зчитуються локально вашим браузером і тимчасовим локальним виконавцем. Цей інструмент не має завантаження, віддаленого підключення PACS або DICOMweb.","Can I use this viewer to diagnose a condition?":"Чи можу я використовувати цей засіб перегляду для діагностики стану?","No. It is a limited technical viewer for supported files, not a medical device or diagnostic workstation. Use validated clinical software and ask a qualified clinician to interpret medical images.":"№ Це обмежений технічний засіб перегляду підтримуваних файлів, а не медичний пристрій чи діагностична робоча станція. Використовуйте перевірене клінічне програмне забезпечення та попросіть кваліфікованого клініциста інтерпретувати медичні зображення.","Choose DICOM file(s)":"Виберіть файл(и) DICOM","Medical files can contain identifying information. This viewer does not upload them and hides common identity fields, but review your screen before sharing it.":"Медичні файли можуть містити ідентифікаційну інформацію. Цей засіб перегляду не завантажує їх і приховує загальні поля ідентифікації, але перевіряє ваш екран, перш ніж ділитися ним.","Select a single DICOM image or files from a single series. Supported: uncompressed, single-frame, 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome Part 10 files. A computer is recommended for larger studies.":"Виберіть одне зображення DICOM або файли з однієї серії. Підтримуються: нестиснуті, однокадрові, 8-бітні або 16-бітні монохромні файли Part 10. Комп’ютер рекомендується для великих досліджень.","Choose one image or a series to begin.":"Виберіть одне зображення або серію, щоб почати.","Reading locally":"Локальне читання","Image series ready.":"Серія зображень готова.","Images ready. The files did not include a series identifier; check that you selected only one series.":"Зображення готові. Файли не містили ідентифікатора серії; переконайтеся, що ви вибрали лише одну серію.","Reading cancelled. The temporary viewer data was cleared.":"Читання скасовано. Тимчасові дані переглядача видалено.","Clear files":"Очистити файли","Cancel reading":"Скасувати читання","Previous slice":"Попередній зріз","Next slice":"Наступний фрагмент","Slice":"Зріз","Current slice":"Поточний зріз","Window center":"Центр вікна","Window width":"Ширина вікна","Modality":"Модальність","Image size":"Розмір зображення","Pixel spacing":"Відстань між пікселями","Slice thickness":"Товщина зрізу","Image position (patient coordinates)":"Позиція зображення (координати пацієнта)","Image orientation":"Орієнтація зображення","Photometric interpretation":"Фотометрична інтерпретація","Pixel format":"Піксельний формат","Transfer syntax":"Синтаксис передачі","Not available":"Не доступний","This is not a DICOM Part 10 file with a DICM header.":"Це не файл DICOM Part 10 із заголовком DICM.","The DICOM file is truncated or malformed.":"Файл DICOM скорочено або має неправильний формат.","Unsupported transfer syntax. This viewer accepts only uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian and Explicit VR Little Endian.":"Непідтримуваний синтаксис передачі. Цей засіб перегляду приймає лише нестиснене імпліцитний VR Little Endian і явний VR Little Endian.","This DICOM object has no pixel data to display.":"Цей об’єкт DICOM не має піксельних даних для відображення.","Image dimensions exceed this viewer’s safe limit (2,048 per side and 4 megapixels per image).":"Розміри зображення перевищують безпечне обмеження для цього засобу перегляду (2,048 на сторону та 4 мегапікселів на зображення).","Unsupported image type. Choose a single-sample MONOCHROME1 or MONOCHROME2 image.":"Непідтримуваний тип зображення. Виберіть однозразкове зображення MONOCHROME1 або MONOCHROME2.","Unsupported pixel encoding. Only 8-bit and 16-bit monochrome integer pixels are supported.":"Непідтримуване кодування пікселів. Підтримуються лише 8-бітні та 16-бітні монохромні цілі пікселі.","This file contains multiple frames. Select a single-frame image or split the series with trusted DICOM software.":"Цей файл містить кілька кадрів. Виберіть однокадрове зображення або розділіть серію за допомогою надійного програмного забезпечення DICOM.","Invalid rescale values in this image.":"Недійсні значення масштабування на цьому зображенні.","This image uses a modality lookup table that this viewer does not support.":"Це зображення використовує таблицю пошуку модальності, яку цей засіб перегляду не підтримує.","A file is empty or exceeds the 16 MiB per-file limit.":"Файл порожній або перевищує ліміт 16 MiB на файл.","This selection exceeds the safe series limit (100 files, 128 MiB input or 20 megapixels total). Select a smaller series.":"Цей вибір перевищує ліміт безпечної серії (100 файлів, 128 вхідних даних MiB або 20 мегапікселів загалом). Виберіть меншу серію.","The selection contains more than one DICOM series. Choose files from one series only.":"Вибір містить більше однієї серії DICOM. Вибирайте файли тільки з однієї серії.","The selected files have different image dimensions. Choose one consistent series.":"Вибрані файли мають різні розміри зображення. Виберіть одну послідовну серію.","The selected files have different image orientations. Choose one consistent series.":"Вибрані файли мають різну орієнтацію зображення. Виберіть одну послідовну серію.","This file could not be read as a supported DICOM image.":"Цей файл не можна прочитати як підтримуване зображення DICOM.","Enter a finite window center and a window width of at least 1.":"Введіть кінцевий центр вікна та ширину вікна щонайменше 1.","DICOM image preview":"Попередній перегляд зображення DICOM","Image metadata":"Метадані зображення","Use the slice slider, or the previous and next buttons, to move through the series.":"Використовуйте повзунок фрагмента або кнопки «попередній» і «наступний», щоб переміщуватися серією."},"ur":{"Private DICOM Image Viewer":"پرائیویٹ DICOM امیج ویور","DICOM Viewer — Open Medical Images Privately in Your Browser":"DICOM ناظر — اپنے براؤزر میں نجی طور پر میڈیکل امیجز کھولیں","Open and scroll through uncompressed monochrome DICOM image series locally. Adjust window and level; files are not uploaded. Compressed formats are identified clearly.":"مقامی طور پر غیر کمپریسڈ مونوکروم DICOM امیج سیریز کو کھولیں اور اسکرول کریں۔ ونڈو اور سطح کو ایڈجسٹ کریں؛ فائلیں اپ لوڈ نہیں ہوتیں۔ کمپریسڈ فارمیٹس واضح طور پر پہچانے جاتے ہیں۔","Open a DICOM image or select one local series. Scroll through ordered slices, adjust window and level, and inspect technical image metadata. Files stay in this browser.":"ایک DICOM امیج کھولیں یا ایک مقامی سیریز منتخب کریں۔ آرڈر شدہ سلائسز کے ذریعے سکرول کریں، ونڈو اور لیول کو ایڈجسٹ کریں، اور ٹیکنیکل امیج میٹا ڈیٹا کا معائنہ کریں۔ فائلیں اس براؤزر میں رہتی ہیں۔","Supported images":"تعاون یافتہ تصاویر","This viewer reads DICOM Part 10 files with uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian or Explicit VR Little Endian pixel data. It supports single-frame 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome images, including MONOCHROME1 inversion.":"یہ ناظر DICOM پارٹ 10 فائلوں کو غیر کمپریسڈ امپلیسیٹ VR لٹل اینڈین یا واضح VR لٹل اینڈین پکسل ڈیٹا کے ساتھ پڑھتا ہے۔ یہ سنگل فریم 8-bit یا 16-bit مونوکروم امیجز کو سپورٹ کرتا ہے، بشمول MONOCHROME1 الٹا۔","Privacy and safe use":"پرائیویسی اور محفوظ استعمال","Selected files are read on this device and decoded in a temporary Web Worker. The worker is terminated when processing finishes or you cancel. Patient name, ID, birth date and accession fields are not displayed. This page does not upload or save images and has no screenshot-sharing feature.":"منتخب فائلوں کو اس ڈیوائس پر پڑھا جاتا ہے اور عارضی ویب ورکر میں ڈی کوڈ کیا جاتا ہے۔ پروسیسنگ ختم ہونے یا آپ منسوخ کرنے پر کارکن کو ختم کر دیا جاتا ہے۔ مریض کا نام، شناختی کارڈ، تاریخ پیدائش اور الحاق کے شعبوں کو ظاہر نہیں کیا گیا ہے۔ یہ صفحہ تصاویر کو اپ لوڈ یا محفوظ نہیں کرتا ہے اور اس میں اسکرین شاٹ شیئر کرنے کی کوئی خصوصیت نہیں ہے۔","DICOM viewer questions":"DICOM ناظرین کے سوالات","Formats and limitations":"فارمیٹس اور حدود","This is a basic file viewer, not a PACS, DICOMweb client, radiology workstation or diagnostic device. It does not support compressed transfer syntaxes, color images, multi-frame objects, presentation states, overlays, structured reports, enhanced multi-frame studies or clinical measurements. Do not use it to make or change a diagnosis. If a study fails, the viewer reports the unsupported feature instead of showing a blank image.":"یہ ایک بنیادی فائل دیکھنے والا ہے، نہ کہ PACS، DICOMweb کلائنٹ، ریڈیولوجی ورک سٹیشن یا تشخیصی آلہ۔ یہ کمپریسڈ ٹرانسفر نحو، کلر امیجز، ملٹی فریم آبجیکٹ، پریزنٹیشن سٹیٹس، اوورلیز، سٹرکچرڈ رپورٹس، بہتر ملٹی فریم اسٹڈیز یا کلینیکل پیمائش کی حمایت نہیں کرتا ہے۔ اسے تشخیص کرنے یا تبدیل کرنے کے لیے استعمال نہ کریں۔ اگر کوئی مطالعہ ناکام ہو جاتا ہے، تو ناظر خالی تصویر دکھانے کے بجائے غیر تعاون یافتہ خصوصیت کی اطلاع دیتا ہے۔","Are my medical images uploaded?":"کیا میری طبی تصاویر اپ لوڈ کی گئی ہیں؟","No. The selected file bytes are read locally by your browser and a temporary local worker. This tool has no upload, remote PACS or DICOMweb connection.":"No منتخب فائل بائٹس مقامی طور پر آپ کے براؤزر اور ایک عارضی مقامی کارکن کے ذریعہ پڑھی جاتی ہیں۔ اس ٹول میں کوئی اپ لوڈ، ریموٹ PACS یا DICOMweb کنکشن نہیں ہے۔","Can I use this viewer to diagnose a condition?":"کیا میں اس ویور کو کسی حالت کی تشخیص کے لیے استعمال کر سکتا ہوں؟","No. It is a limited technical viewer for supported files, not a medical device or diagnostic workstation. Use validated clinical software and ask a qualified clinician to interpret medical images.":"No یہ معاون فائلوں کے لیے ایک محدود تکنیکی ناظر ہے، طبی ڈیوائس یا تشخیصی ورک سٹیشن نہیں۔ تصدیق شدہ کلینیکل سافٹ ویئر استعمال کریں اور کسی مستند طبیب سے طبی امیجز کی تشریح کرنے کو کہیں۔","Choose DICOM file(s)":"DICOM فائل (فائلوں) کو منتخب کریں","Medical files can contain identifying information. This viewer does not upload them and hides common identity fields, but review your screen before sharing it.":"میڈیکل فائلوں میں شناختی معلومات شامل ہو سکتی ہیں۔ یہ ناظر انہیں اپ لوڈ نہیں کرتا اور عام شناخت والے فیلڈز کو چھپاتا ہے، لیکن اسے شیئر کرنے سے پہلے اپنی اسکرین کا جائزہ لیں۔","Select a single DICOM image or files from a single series. Supported: uncompressed, single-frame, 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome Part 10 files. A computer is recommended for larger studies.":"کسی ایک سیریز سے ایک واحد DICOM تصویر یا فائلیں منتخب کریں۔ تعاون یافتہ: غیر کمپریسڈ، سنگل فریم، 8-bit یا 16-bit مونوکروم پارٹ 10 فائلیں۔ بڑے مطالعے کے لیے کمپیوٹر کی سفارش کی جاتی ہے۔","Choose one image or a series to begin.":"شروع کرنے کے لیے ایک تصویر یا سیریز کا انتخاب کریں۔","Reading locally":"مقامی طور پر پڑھنا","Image series ready.":"تصویری سیریز تیار ہے۔","Images ready. The files did not include a series identifier; check that you selected only one series.":"تصاویر تیار ہیں۔ فائلوں میں سیریز کا شناخت کنندہ شامل نہیں تھا۔ چیک کریں کہ آپ نے صرف ایک سیریز کا انتخاب کیا ہے۔","Reading cancelled. The temporary viewer data was cleared.":"پڑھنا منسوخ کر دیا گیا۔ ناظرین کا عارضی ڈیٹا صاف کر دیا گیا تھا۔","Clear files":"فائلیں صاف کریں۔","Cancel reading":"پڑھنا منسوخ کریں۔","Previous slice":"پچھلا ٹکڑا","Next slice":"اگلا ٹکڑا","Slice":"ٹکڑا","Current slice":"موجودہ ٹکڑا","Window center":"ونڈو سینٹر","Window width":"کھڑکی کی چوڑائی","Modality":"موڈیلٹی","Image size":"تصویر کا سائز","Pixel spacing":"پکسل اسپیسنگ","Slice thickness":"ٹکڑے کی موٹائی","Image position (patient coordinates)":"تصویر کی پوزیشن (مریض کے نقاط)","Image orientation":"تصویری واقفیت","Photometric interpretation":"فوٹو میٹرک تشریح","Pixel format":"پکسل فارمیٹ","Transfer syntax":"منتقلی نحو","Not available":"دستیاب نہیں ہے۔","This is not a DICOM Part 10 file with a DICM header.":"یہ DICOM پارٹ 10 فائل نہیں ہے جس میں DICM ہیڈر ہے۔","The DICOM file is truncated or malformed.":"DICOM فائل کاٹ دی گئی یا خراب ہے۔","Unsupported transfer syntax. This viewer accepts only uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian and Explicit VR Little Endian.":"غیر تعاون یافتہ ٹرانسفر نحو۔ یہ ناظرین صرف غیر کمپریسڈ امپلیسیٹ وی آر لٹل اینڈین اور ایکسپلیسیٹ وی آر لٹل اینڈین کو قبول کرتا ہے۔","This DICOM object has no pixel data to display.":"اس DICOM آبجیکٹ میں ڈسپلے کرنے کے لیے کوئی پکسل ڈیٹا نہیں ہے۔","Image dimensions exceed this viewer’s safe limit (2,048 per side and 4 megapixels per image).":"تصویر کے طول و عرض اس ناظر کی محفوظ حد سے زیادہ ہیں (فی طرف 2,048 اور 4 میگا پکسلز فی تصویر)۔","Unsupported image type. Choose a single-sample MONOCHROME1 or MONOCHROME2 image.":"غیر تعاون یافتہ تصویر کی قسم۔ ایک واحد نمونہ MONOCHROME1 یا MONOCHROME2 تصویر منتخب کریں۔","Unsupported pixel encoding. Only 8-bit and 16-bit monochrome integer pixels are supported.":"غیر تعاون یافتہ پکسل انکوڈنگ۔ صرف 8-bit اور 16-bit مونوکروم انٹیجر پکسلز معاون ہیں۔","This file contains multiple frames. Select a single-frame image or split the series with trusted DICOM software.":"یہ فائل متعدد فریموں پر مشتمل ہے۔ ایک واحد فریم تصویر منتخب کریں یا بھروسہ مند DICOM سافٹ ویئر کے ساتھ سیریز کو تقسیم کریں۔","Invalid rescale values in this image.":"اس تصویر میں ری اسکیل کی غلط اقدار۔","This image uses a modality lookup table that this viewer does not support.":"یہ تصویر ایک موڈیلٹی تلاش کرنے والی میز کا استعمال کرتی ہے جسے یہ ناظرین سپورٹ نہیں کرتا ہے۔","A file is empty or exceeds the 16 MiB per-file limit.":"ایک فائل خالی ہے یا 16 MiB فی فائل کی حد سے زیادہ ہے۔","This selection exceeds the safe series limit (100 files, 128 MiB input or 20 megapixels total). Select a smaller series.":"یہ انتخاب محفوظ سیریز کی حد سے زیادہ ہے (100 فائلیں، 128 MiB ان پٹ یا 20 میگا پکسلز کل)۔ ایک چھوٹی سیریز کا انتخاب کریں۔","The selection contains more than one DICOM series. Choose files from one series only.":"انتخاب میں ایک سے زیادہ DICOM سیریز شامل ہیں۔ صرف ایک سیریز سے فائلوں کا انتخاب کریں۔","The selected files have different image dimensions. Choose one consistent series.":"منتخب فائلوں کی تصویر کے مختلف جہت ہیں۔ ایک مسلسل سیریز کا انتخاب کریں۔","The selected files have different image orientations. Choose one consistent series.":"منتخب فائلوں میں مختلف تصویری سمتیں ہیں۔ ایک مسلسل سیریز کا انتخاب کریں۔","This file could not be read as a supported DICOM image.":"اس فائل کو معاون DICOM تصویر کے طور پر نہیں پڑھا جا سکتا۔","Enter a finite window center and a window width of at least 1.":"ایک محدود ونڈو سینٹر اور ونڈو کی چوڑائی کم از کم 1 درج کریں۔","DICOM image preview":"DICOM تصویر کا پیش نظارہ","Image metadata":"تصویری میٹا ڈیٹا","Use the slice slider, or the previous and next buttons, to move through the series.":"سیریز میں آگے بڑھنے کے لیے سلائس سلائیڈر، یا پچھلے اور اگلے بٹن کا استعمال کریں۔"},"vi":{"Private DICOM Image Viewer":"Trình xem ảnh DICOM riêng tư","DICOM Viewer — Open Medical Images Privately in Your Browser":"DICOM Viewer — Mở riêng tư các hình ảnh y tế trong trình duyệt của bạn","Open and scroll through uncompressed monochrome DICOM image series locally. Adjust window and level; files are not uploaded. Compressed formats are identified clearly.":"Mở và cuộn qua loạt hình ảnh DICOM đơn sắc không nén cục bộ. Điều chỉnh cửa sổ và mức độ; tập tin không được tải lên. Các định dạng nén được xác định rõ ràng.","Open a DICOM image or select one local series. Scroll through ordered slices, adjust window and level, and inspect technical image metadata. Files stay in this browser.":"Mở hình ảnh DICOM hoặc chọn một chuỗi cục bộ. Cuộn qua các lát cắt theo thứ tự, điều chỉnh cửa sổ và cấp độ cũng như kiểm tra siêu dữ liệu hình ảnh kỹ thuật. Các tập tin vẫn ở trong trình duyệt này.","Supported images":"Hình ảnh được hỗ trợ","This viewer reads DICOM Part 10 files with uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian or Explicit VR Little Endian pixel data. It supports single-frame 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome images, including MONOCHROME1 inversion.":"Trình xem này đọc các tệp DICOM Part 10 với dữ liệu pixel Implicit VR Little Endian hoặc Explicit VR Little Endian không nén. Nó hỗ trợ hình ảnh đơn sắc 8-bit hoặc 16-bit khung đơn, bao gồm cả đảo ngược MONOCHROME1.","Privacy and safe use":"Quyền riêng tư và sử dụng an toàn","Selected files are read on this device and decoded in a temporary Web Worker. The worker is terminated when processing finishes or you cancel. Patient name, ID, birth date and accession fields are not displayed. This page does not upload or save images and has no screenshot-sharing feature.":"Các tệp đã chọn được đọc trên thiết bị này và được giải mã trong Web Worker tạm thời. Công nhân bị chấm dứt khi quá trình xử lý kết thúc hoặc bạn hủy. Tên bệnh nhân, ID, ngày sinh và các trường đăng nhập không được hiển thị. Trang này không tải lên hoặc lưu hình ảnh và không có tính năng chia sẻ ảnh chụp màn hình.","DICOM viewer questions":"DICOM","Formats and limitations":"Định dạng và hạn chế","This is a basic file viewer, not a PACS, DICOMweb client, radiology workstation or diagnostic device. It does not support compressed transfer syntaxes, color images, multi-frame objects, presentation states, overlays, structured reports, enhanced multi-frame studies or clinical measurements. Do not use it to make or change a diagnosis. If a study fails, the viewer reports the unsupported feature instead of showing a blank image.":"Đây là trình xem tệp cơ bản, không phải PACS, máy khách DICOMweb, trạm X quang hoặc thiết bị chẩn đoán. Nó không hỗ trợ cú pháp truyền nén, hình ảnh màu, đối tượng nhiều khung, trạng thái trình bày, lớp phủ, báo cáo có cấu trúc, nghiên cứu đa khung nâng cao hoặc đo lường lâm sàng. Không sử dụng nó để thực hiện hoặc thay đổi chẩn đoán. Nếu nghiên cứu không thành công, người xem sẽ báo cáo tính năng không được hỗ trợ thay vì hiển thị hình ảnh trống.","Are my medical images uploaded?":"Hình ảnh y tế của tôi có được tải lên không?","No. The selected file bytes are read locally by your browser and a temporary local worker. This tool has no upload, remote PACS or DICOMweb connection.":"Không. Các byte tệp đã chọn được đọc cục bộ bởi trình duyệt của bạn và một nhân viên cục bộ tạm thời. Công cụ này không có kết nối tải lên, PACS hoặc DICOMweb từ xa.","Can I use this viewer to diagnose a condition?":"Tôi có thể sử dụng thiết bị xem này để chẩn đoán tình trạng không?","No. It is a limited technical viewer for supported files, not a medical device or diagnostic workstation. Use validated clinical software and ask a qualified clinician to interpret medical images.":"Không. Nó là một trình xem kỹ thuật hạn chế dành cho các tệp được hỗ trợ, không phải là thiết bị y tế hoặc trạm chẩn đoán. Sử dụng phần mềm lâm sàng đã được xác nhận và yêu cầu bác sĩ lâm sàng có trình độ chuyên môn giải thích các hình ảnh y tế.","Choose DICOM file(s)":"Chọn (các) tệp DICOM","Medical files can contain identifying information. This viewer does not upload them and hides common identity fields, but review your screen before sharing it.":"Các tệp y tế có thể chứa thông tin nhận dạng. Trình xem này không tải chúng lên và ẩn các trường nhận dạng chung nhưng xem lại màn hình của bạn trước khi chia sẻ.","Select a single DICOM image or files from a single series. Supported: uncompressed, single-frame, 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome Part 10 files. A computer is recommended for larger studies.":"Chọn một hình ảnh hoặc tệp DICOM từ một chuỗi đơn lẻ. Được hỗ trợ: các tệp Phần 10 đơn sắc, không nén, một khung, 8-bit hoặc 16-bit. Một máy tính được khuyến khích cho các nghiên cứu lớn hơn.","Choose one image or a series to begin.":"Chọn một hình ảnh hoặc một loạt hình ảnh để bắt đầu.","Reading locally":"Đọc cục bộ","Image series ready.":"Loạt hình ảnh đã sẵn sàng.","Images ready. The files did not include a series identifier; check that you selected only one series.":"Hình ảnh đã sẵn sàng. Các tập tin không bao gồm số nhận dạng sê-ri; kiểm tra xem bạn chỉ chọn một chuỗi.","Reading cancelled. The temporary viewer data was cleared.":"Việc đọc bị hủy. Dữ liệu người xem tạm thời đã bị xóa.","Clear files":"Xóa tập tin","Cancel reading":"Hủy đọc","Previous slice":"Lát trước","Next slice":"Lát tiếp theo","Slice":"Lát","Current slice":"Lát cắt hiện tại","Window center":"Trung tâm cửa sổ","Window width":"Chiều rộng cửa sổ","Modality":"Phương thức","Image size":"Kích thước hình ảnh","Pixel spacing":"Khoảng cách điểm ảnh","Slice thickness":"Độ dày lát cắt","Image position (patient coordinates)":"Vị trí hình ảnh (tọa độ bệnh nhân)","Image orientation":"Hướng hình ảnh","Photometric interpretation":"Giải thích trắc quang","Pixel format":"Định dạng pixel","Transfer syntax":"Cú pháp truyền","Not available":"Không có sẵn","This is not a DICOM Part 10 file with a DICM header.":"Đây không phải là tệp DICOM Part 10 có tiêu đề DICM.","The DICOM file is truncated or malformed.":"Tệp DICOM bị cắt bớt hoặc không đúng định dạng.","Unsupported transfer syntax. This viewer accepts only uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian and Explicit VR Little Endian.":"Cú pháp truyền không được hỗ trợ. Trình xem này chỉ chấp nhận Implicit VR Little Endian và Explicit VR Little Endian không nén.","This DICOM object has no pixel data to display.":"Đối tượng DICOM này không có dữ liệu pixel để hiển thị.","Image dimensions exceed this viewer’s safe limit (2,048 per side and 4 megapixels per image).":"Kích thước hình ảnh vượt quá giới hạn an toàn của người xem này (2,048 mỗi bên và 4 megapixel mỗi hình ảnh).","Unsupported image type. Choose a single-sample MONOCHROME1 or MONOCHROME2 image.":"Loại hình ảnh không được hỗ trợ. Chọn một hình ảnh MONOCHROME1 hoặc MONOCHROME2 một mẫu.","Unsupported pixel encoding. Only 8-bit and 16-bit monochrome integer pixels are supported.":"Mã hóa pixel không được hỗ trợ. Chỉ hỗ trợ các pixel nguyên đơn sắc 8-bit và 16-bit.","This file contains multiple frames. Select a single-frame image or split the series with trusted DICOM software.":"Tệp này chứa nhiều khung. Chọn một hình ảnh một khung hình hoặc chia chuỗi hình ảnh bằng phần mềm DICOM đáng tin cậy.","Invalid rescale values in this image.":"Giá trị thay đổi tỷ lệ không hợp lệ trong hình ảnh này.","This image uses a modality lookup table that this viewer does not support.":"Hình ảnh này sử dụng bảng tra cứu phương thức mà trình xem này không hỗ trợ.","A file is empty or exceeds the 16 MiB per-file limit.":"Một tệp trống hoặc vượt quá giới hạn 16 MiB cho mỗi tệp.","This selection exceeds the safe series limit (100 files, 128 MiB input or 20 megapixels total). Select a smaller series.":"Lựa chọn này vượt quá giới hạn chuỗi an toàn (tệp 100, đầu vào 128 MiB hoặc tổng số megapixel 20). Chọn một chuỗi nhỏ hơn.","The selection contains more than one DICOM series. Choose files from one series only.":"Phần lựa chọn chứa nhiều hơn một chuỗi DICOM. Chỉ chọn các tập tin từ một loạt.","The selected files have different image dimensions. Choose one consistent series.":"Các tệp đã chọn có kích thước hình ảnh khác nhau. Chọn một chuỗi nhất quán.","The selected files have different image orientations. Choose one consistent series.":"Các tệp đã chọn có hướng hình ảnh khác nhau. Chọn một chuỗi nhất quán.","This file could not be read as a supported DICOM image.":"Không thể đọc tệp này dưới dạng hình ảnh DICOM được hỗ trợ.","Enter a finite window center and a window width of at least 1.":"Nhập tâm cửa sổ hữu hạn và chiều rộng cửa sổ ít nhất là 1.\nXem trước hình ảnh","DICOM image preview":"DICOM","Image metadata":"Siêu dữ liệu hình ảnh","Use the slice slider, or the previous and next buttons, to move through the series.":"Sử dụng thanh trượt lát hoặc các nút trước và sau để di chuyển qua chuỗi."},"zh":{"Private DICOM Image Viewer":"专用 DICOM 图像查看器","DICOM Viewer — Open Medical Images Privately in Your Browser":"DICOM 查看器 — 在浏览器中私密地打开医学图像","Open and scroll through uncompressed monochrome DICOM image series locally. Adjust window and level; files are not uploaded. Compressed formats are identified clearly.":"在本地打开并滚动未压缩的单色 DICOM 图像系列。调整窗户和水平；文件未上传。压缩格式被清楚地识别。","Open a DICOM image or select one local series. Scroll through ordered slices, adjust window and level, and inspect technical image metadata. Files stay in this browser.":"打开 DICOM 图像或选择一个本地系列。滚动浏览有序切片，调整窗口和级别，并检查技术图像元数据。文件保留在此浏览器中。","Supported images":"支持的图像","This viewer reads DICOM Part 10 files with uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian or Explicit VR Little Endian pixel data. It supports single-frame 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome images, including MONOCHROME1 inversion.":"此查看器读取带有未压缩的隐式 VR Little Endian 或显式 VR Little Endian 像素数据的 DICOM 部分 10 文件。它支持单帧8位或16位单色图像，包括MONOCHROME1反转。","Privacy and safe use":"隐私和安全使用","Selected files are read on this device and decoded in a temporary Web Worker. The worker is terminated when processing finishes or you cancel. Patient name, ID, birth date and accession fields are not displayed. This page does not upload or save images and has no screenshot-sharing feature.":"选定的文件在此设备上读取并在临时 Web Worker 中解码。当处理完成或您取消时，工作线程将被终止。不显示患者姓名、ID、出生日期和加入字段。该页面不上传或保存图像，也不具有屏幕截图共享功能。","DICOM viewer questions":"DICOM 查看器问题","Formats and limitations":"格式和限制","This is a basic file viewer, not a PACS, DICOMweb client, radiology workstation or diagnostic device. It does not support compressed transfer syntaxes, color images, multi-frame objects, presentation states, overlays, structured reports, enhanced multi-frame studies or clinical measurements. Do not use it to make or change a diagnosis. If a study fails, the viewer reports the unsupported feature instead of showing a blank image.":"这是一个基本的文件查看器，而不是 PACS、DICOMweb 客户端、放射工作站或诊断设备。它不支持压缩传输语法、彩色图像、多帧对象、演示状态、覆盖、结构化报告、增强的多帧研究或临床测量。请勿用它来做出或改变诊断。如果研究失败，查看器会报告不受支持的功能，而不是显示空白图像。","Are my medical images uploaded?":"我的医学图像上传了吗？","No. The selected file bytes are read locally by your browser and a temporary local worker. This tool has no upload, remote PACS or DICOMweb connection.":"编号所选文件字节由您的浏览器和临时本地工作人员在本地读取。该工具没有上传、远程 PACS 或 DICOMweb 连接。","Can I use this viewer to diagnose a condition?":"我可以使用此查看器来诊断病情吗？","No. It is a limited technical viewer for supported files, not a medical device or diagnostic workstation. Use validated clinical software and ask a qualified clinician to interpret medical images.":"编号它是受支持文件的有限技术查看器，而不是医疗设备或诊断工作站。使用经过验证的临床软件并请合格的临床医生解释医学图像。","Choose DICOM file(s)":"选择 DICOM 文件","Medical files can contain identifying information. This viewer does not upload them and hides common identity fields, but review your screen before sharing it.":"医疗文件可以包含识别信息。此查看器不会上传它们并隐藏常见的身份字段，但会在共享之前查看您的屏幕。","Select a single DICOM image or files from a single series. Supported: uncompressed, single-frame, 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome Part 10 files. A computer is recommended for larger studies.":"从单个系列中选择单个 DICOM 图像或文件。支持：未压缩、单帧、8 位或 16 位单色零件 10 文件。建议使用计算机进行大型研究。","Choose one image or a series to begin.":"选择一张图像或一系列图像开始。","Reading locally":"本地读取","Image series ready.":"图像系列准备就绪。","Images ready. The files did not include a series identifier; check that you selected only one series.":"图像准备就绪。这些文件不包含系列标识符；检查您是否只选择了一个系列。","Reading cancelled. The temporary viewer data was cleared.":"读取已取消。临时查看器数据被清除。","Clear files":"清除文件","Cancel reading":"取消读取","Previous slice":"上一个切片","Next slice":"下一片","Slice":"切片","Current slice":"当前切片","Window center":"窗口中心","Window width":"窗口宽度","Modality":"模态","Image size":"图像尺寸","Pixel spacing":"像素间距","Slice thickness":"切片厚度","Image position (patient coordinates)":"图像位置（患者坐标）","Image orientation":"图像方向","Photometric interpretation":"光度解释","Pixel format":"像素格式","Transfer syntax":"传输语法","Not available":"不可用","This is not a DICOM Part 10 file with a DICM header.":"这不是带有 DICM 标头的 DICOM 部件 10 文件。","The DICOM file is truncated or malformed.":"DICOM 文件被截断或格式错误。","Unsupported transfer syntax. This viewer accepts only uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian and Explicit VR Little Endian.":"不支持的传输语法。此查看器仅接受未压缩的隐式 VR Little Endian 和显式 VR Little Endian。","This DICOM object has no pixel data to display.":"此 DICOM 对象没有要显示的像素数据。","Image dimensions exceed this viewer’s safe limit (2,048 per side and 4 megapixels per image).":"图像尺寸超出了此查看器的安全限制（每边 2,048 和每张图像 4 百万像素）。","Unsupported image type. Choose a single-sample MONOCHROME1 or MONOCHROME2 image.":"不受支持的图像类型。选择单样本 MONOCHROME1 或 MONOCHROME2 图像。","Unsupported pixel encoding. Only 8-bit and 16-bit monochrome integer pixels are supported.":"不支持的像素编码。仅支持 8 位和 16 位单色整数像素。","This file contains multiple frames. Select a single-frame image or split the series with trusted DICOM software.":"此文件包含多个帧。选择单帧图像或使用值得信赖的 DICOM 软件分割系列图像。","Invalid rescale values in this image.":"此图像中的重新缩放值无效。","This image uses a modality lookup table that this viewer does not support.":"此图像使用此查看器不支持的模态查找表。","A file is empty or exceeds the 16 MiB per-file limit.":"文件为空或超出 16 MiB 每个文件的限制。","This selection exceeds the safe series limit (100 files, 128 MiB input or 20 megapixels total). Select a smaller series.":"此选择超出了安全系列限制（100 文件、128 MiB 输入或 20 百万像素总数）。选择较小的系列。","The selection contains more than one DICOM series. Choose files from one series only.":"该选择包含多个 DICOM 系列。仅从一个系列中选择文件。","The selected files have different image dimensions. Choose one consistent series.":"所选文件具有不同的图像尺寸。选择一个一致的系列。","The selected files have different image orientations. Choose one consistent series.":"所选文件具有不同的图像方向。选择一个一致的系列。","This file could not be read as a supported DICOM image.":"无法将该文件读取为受支持的 DICOM 图像。","Enter a finite window center and a window width of at least 1.":"输入有限窗口中心和至少为 1 的窗口宽度。","DICOM image preview":"DICOM图像预览","Image metadata":"图像元数据","Use the slice slider, or the previous and next buttons, to move through the series.":"使用切片滑块或上一个和下一个按钮在系列中移动。"},"zh_tw":{"Private DICOM Image Viewer":"專用 DICOM 影像檢視器","DICOM Viewer — Open Medical Images Privately in Your Browser":"DICOM 檢視器 — 在瀏覽器中私密地開啟醫學影像","Open and scroll through uncompressed monochrome DICOM image series locally. Adjust window and level; files are not uploaded. Compressed formats are identified clearly.":"在本機開啟並捲動未壓縮的單色 DICOM 影像系列。調整窗戶和水平；文件未上傳。壓縮格式被清楚地辨識。","Open a DICOM image or select one local series. Scroll through ordered slices, adjust window and level, and inspect technical image metadata. Files stay in this browser.":"開啟 DICOM 映像或選擇一個本機系列。捲動有序切片，調整視窗和級別，並檢查技術影像元資料。文件保留在此瀏覽器中。","Supported images":"支援的影像","This viewer reads DICOM Part 10 files with uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian or Explicit VR Little Endian pixel data. It supports single-frame 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome images, including MONOCHROME1 inversion.":"此檢視器可讀取具有未壓縮的隱式 VR Little Endian 或明確 VR Little Endian 像素資料的 DICOM 部分 10 檔案。它支援單幀8位元或16位元單色影像，包括MONOCHROME1反轉。","Privacy and safe use":"隱私與安全使用","Selected files are read on this device and decoded in a temporary Web Worker. The worker is terminated when processing finishes or you cancel. Patient name, ID, birth date and accession fields are not displayed. This page does not upload or save images and has no screenshot-sharing feature.":"選定的檔案在此裝置上讀取並在暫存 Web Worker 中解碼。當處理完成或您取消時，工作執行緒將被終止。不顯示患者姓名、ID、出生日期和加入欄位。該頁面不上傳或儲存圖像，也不具有螢幕截圖共享功能。","DICOM viewer questions":"DICOM 檢視器問題","Formats and limitations":"格式和限制","This is a basic file viewer, not a PACS, DICOMweb client, radiology workstation or diagnostic device. It does not support compressed transfer syntaxes, color images, multi-frame objects, presentation states, overlays, structured reports, enhanced multi-frame studies or clinical measurements. Do not use it to make or change a diagnosis. If a study fails, the viewer reports the unsupported feature instead of showing a blank image.":"這是一個基本的檔案檢視器，而不是 PACS、DICOMweb 用戶端、放射工作站或診斷設備。它不支援壓縮傳輸語法、彩色影像、多幀物件、演示狀態、覆蓋、結構化報告、增強的多幀研究或臨床測量。請勿用它來做出或改變診斷。如果研究失敗，檢視器會報告不支援的功能，而不是顯示空白影像。","Are my medical images uploaded?":"我的醫學影像上傳了嗎？","No. The selected file bytes are read locally by your browser and a temporary local worker. This tool has no upload, remote PACS or DICOMweb connection.":"編號所選檔案位元組由您的瀏覽器和臨時本機工作人員在本機讀取。該工具沒有上傳、遠端 PACS 或 DICOMweb 連線。","Can I use this viewer to diagnose a condition?":"我可以使用此檢視器來診斷病情嗎？","No. It is a limited technical viewer for supported files, not a medical device or diagnostic workstation. Use validated clinical software and ask a qualified clinician to interpret medical images.":"編號它是受支援文件的有限技術檢視器，而不是醫療設備或診斷工作站。使用經過驗證的臨床軟體並請合格的臨床醫生解釋醫學影像。","Choose DICOM file(s)":"選擇 DICOM 檔案","Medical files can contain identifying information. This viewer does not upload them and hides common identity fields, but review your screen before sharing it.":"醫療文件可以包含識別資訊。此檢視器不會上傳它們並隱藏常見的身份字段，但會在共享之前查看您的螢幕。","Select a single DICOM image or files from a single series. Supported: uncompressed, single-frame, 8-bit or 16-bit monochrome Part 10 files. A computer is recommended for larger studies.":"從單一系列中選擇單一 DICOM 影像或檔案。支援：未壓縮、單幀、8 位元或 16 位元單色零件 10 檔案。建議使用計算機進行大型研究。","Choose one image or a series to begin.":"選擇一張影像或一系列影像開始。","Reading locally":"本地讀取","Image series ready.":"影像系列準備就緒。","Images ready. The files did not include a series identifier; check that you selected only one series.":"影像準備就緒。這些文件不包含系列識別碼；檢查您是否只選擇了一個系列。","Reading cancelled. The temporary viewer data was cleared.":"讀取已取消。臨時查看器資料被清除。","Clear files":"清除文件","Cancel reading":"取消讀取","Previous slice":"上一個切片","Next slice":"下一片","Slice":"切片","Current slice":"目前切片","Window center":"視窗中心","Window width":"視窗寬度","Modality":"模態","Image size":"影像尺寸","Pixel spacing":"像素間距","Slice thickness":"切片厚度","Image position (patient coordinates)":"影像位置（病患座標）","Image orientation":"影像方向","Photometric interpretation":"光度解釋","Pixel format":"像素格式","Transfer syntax":"傳輸語法","Not available":"不可用","This is not a DICOM Part 10 file with a DICM header.":"這不是帶有 DICM 標頭的 DICOM 元件 10 檔案。","The DICOM file is truncated or malformed.":"DICOM 檔案被截斷或格式錯誤。","Unsupported transfer syntax. This viewer accepts only uncompressed Implicit VR Little Endian and Explicit VR Little Endian.":"不支援的傳輸語法。此檢視器僅接受未壓縮的隱式 VR Little Endian 和顯式 VR Little Endian。","This DICOM object has no pixel data to display.":"此 DICOM 物件沒有要顯示的像素資料。","Image dimensions exceed this viewer’s safe limit (2,048 per side and 4 megapixels per image).":"影像尺寸超出了此檢視器的安全限制（每邊 2,048 和每張影像 4 百萬像素）。","Unsupported image type. Choose a single-sample MONOCHROME1 or MONOCHROME2 image.":"不支援的影像類型。選擇單樣本 MONOCHROME1 或 MONOCHROME2 影像。","Unsupported pixel encoding. Only 8-bit and 16-bit monochrome integer pixels are supported.":"不支援的像素編碼。僅支援 8 位元和 16 位元單色整數像素。","This file contains multiple frames. Select a single-frame image or split the series with trusted DICOM software.":"此檔案包含多個訊框。選擇單幀影像或使用值得信賴的 DICOM 軟體分割系列影像。","Invalid rescale values in this image.":"此影像中的重新縮放值無效。","This image uses a modality lookup table that this viewer does not support.":"此影像使用此檢視器不支援的模態查找表。","A file is empty or exceeds the 16 MiB per-file limit.":"檔案為空或超出 16 MiB 每個檔案的限制。","This selection exceeds the safe series limit (100 files, 128 MiB input or 20 megapixels total). Select a smaller series.":"此選擇超出了安全性系列限制（100 檔案、128 MiB 輸入或 20 百萬像素總數）。選擇較小的系列。","The selection contains more than one DICOM series. Choose files from one series only.":"此選擇包含多個 DICOM 系列。僅從一個系列中選擇文件。","The selected files have different image dimensions. Choose one consistent series.":"所選檔案具有不同的影像尺寸。選擇一個一致的系列。","The selected files have different image orientations. Choose one consistent series.":"所選檔案具有不同的影像方向。選擇一個一致的系列。","This file could not be read as a supported DICOM image.":"無法將該檔案讀取為受支援的 DICOM 影像。","Enter a finite window center and a window width of at least 1.":"輸入有限視窗中心和至少為 1 的視窗寬度。","DICOM image preview":"DICOM影像預覽","Image metadata":"影像元資料","Use the slice slider, or the previous and next buttons, to move through the series.":"使用切片滑桿或上一個和下一個按鈕在系列中移動。"}});
